B.RH=new A.X("v1.4.165 beta","2026-11-21","Ayarlar\u2019da Aray\xfcz alt men\xfcs\xfc (ara\xe7 ikonu, istatistik ikonlar\u0131, kay\u0131t kartlar\u0131). Geli\u015fmi\u015f anahtar\u0131: kapal\u0131yken g\xfcn bazl\u0131 i\xe7e/d\u0131\u015fa aktarma ve revize gizlenir; g\xfcn detay\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcleme kal\u0131r.","Settings Interface submenu (vehicle icon, stat icons, recording cards). Advanced switch: when off, day-based import/export/revise are hidden; day viewing remains.")
B.SJ=new A.X("v1.4.164 beta","2026-11-21","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck g\xfcn detay\u0131nda ortalama ve maksimum h\u0131z kartlar\u0131 eklendi. Kartlar inceldi; uzun bas\u0131p s\xfcr\xfckleyerek yer de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir. Ayar (di\u015fli) men\xfcs\xfcnden t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f vb. g\xf6ster/gizle.","Multi-day day detail adds average and max speed cards. Tiles are thinner and long-press drag-reorderable. A tune menu shows/hides climb/descent and other cards.")
B.US=new A.X("v1.4.163 beta","2026-11-21","G\xfcn revize, kayda GPX ekleme ve d\u0131\u015fa aktarmada ilerleme diyalo\u011fu: dosya okunuyor (N/M), g\xfcn yaz\u0131l\u0131yor, birle\u015ftiriliyor, dosya yaz\u0131l\u0131yor. Bitti\u011finde g\xfcn ad\u0131 + nokta say\u0131s\u0131 snackbar\u2019da g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.","Day revise, import-into-recording, and export show a progress dialog: reading file (N/M), writing day, merging, writing files. Success snackbar includes day label and point count.")
B.ST=new A.X("v1.4.161 beta","2026-11-21","Kay\u0131t adland\u0131r\u0131l\u0131p uygulamaya yaz\u0131l\u0131nca hemen \u201cNereye kaydedilsin?\u201d gelir (klas\xf6r / payla\u015f\u0131m / sadece uygulama); galeri taramas\u0131 art\u0131k bunu gizlemez. Klas\xf6r se\xe7ilince sistem klas\xf6r se\xe7ici a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r.","Right after naming and saving into the app, \u201cWhere should it be saved?\u201d appears (folder / share / app only); gallery scan no longer hides it. Folder still opens the system picker.")
B.TZ=new A.X("v1.4.159 beta","2026-11-21","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck kayd\u0131 bitirirken varsay\u0131lan isim yaln\u0131zca ilk g\xfcn de\u011fil; ilk\u2013son g\xfcn aral\u0131\u011f\u0131d\u0131r (\xf6r. Kay\u0131t 4-21 Kas 2026). Tek g\xfcn h\xe2l\xe2 saatli kal\u0131r.","Finishing a multi-day recording suggests a first\u2013last date span (e.g. Recording 4-21 Nov 2026), not only the start day. Single-day names still include the start time.")
B.TN=new A.X("v1.4.158 beta","2026-11-21","\u201cKlas\xf6re kaydet\u201d her seferinde klas\xf6r se\xe7iciyi a\xe7ar; Ayarlar\u2019daki g\xfcnl\xfck yedek klas\xf6r\xfcne sessizce yazmaz.","\u201cSave to folder\u201d always opens the folder picker; it no longer silently writes into the Settings daily-backup folder.")
B.TS=new A.X("v1.4.157 beta","2026-11-21","G\xfcn detay\u0131nda sa\u011f \xfcst ikon art\u0131k o g\xfcn\xfc d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131r: nereye (klas\xf6r/payla\u015f) ve format sorulur; dosya ad\u0131 RideAtlas_yyyy-MM-dd. GPX ile revize altta \u201cBu g\xfcn\xfc GPX ile revize et\u201d butonunda kal\u0131r.","Day-detail top-right icon exports that day: asks where (folder/share) then format; file name is RideAtlas_yyyy-MM-dd. GPX revise stays on the bottom \u201cRevise this day from GPX\u201d button.")
B.Tf=new A.X("v1.4.156 beta","2026-11-20","G\xfcn revize onay penceresi \u201c\xdczerine yaz\u0131lacak g\xfcn\u201d ve \u201cY\xfcklenecek dosya\u201dyu ayr\u0131 sat\u0131rlarda g\xf6sterir; hangi g\xfcn\xfcn silinip hangi GPX\u2019in yaz\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 netle\u015fir.","Day-revise confirm lists \u201cDay to overwrite\u201d and \u201cFile to load\u201d on separate lines so it\u2019s clear which day is deleted and which GPX is written.")
B.SK=new A.X("v1.4.155 beta","2026-11-20","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck rota ve canl\u0131 kay\u0131tta sa\u011fdaki takvim ikonu g\xfcn g\xfcn g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc a\xe7ar/kapat\u0131r (renkli g\xfcnler + \u015ferit). \u0130ze t\u0131klamak yava\u015f veya zor geldi\u011fi i\xe7in art\u0131k ikon yeterli.","On multi-day saved routes and live recording, the right-side calendar icon toggles day-by-day view (colored days + chips). No need to tap the thin track line.")
B.TA=new A.X("v1.4.154 beta","2026-11-20","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck d\u0131\u015fa aktarmada g\xfcn se\xe7iminden sonra tekrar isim sorulmaz (dosya ad\u0131 zaten RideAtlas_tarih). \u201cNereye kaydedilsin?\u201d g\xfcn listesinin alt\u0131nda sabit kal\u0131r; tek g\xfcnl\xfckte de klas\xf6r/payla\u015f sorulur.","Multi-day export no longer asks for a file name after day selection (files stay RideAtlas_date). \u201cWhere?\u201d stays pinned under the day list; single-day export also asks folder vs share.")
B.Sb=new A.X("v1.4.153 beta","2026-11-19","G\xfcn detay sheet\u2019inde y\xfckle ikonu ve \u201cBu g\xfcn\xfc GPX ile revize et\u201d: o g\xfcn\xfcn izi silinir, se\xe7ti\u011fin GPX/KML yaz\u0131l\u0131r (kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota ve canl\u0131 kay\u0131t).","Day detail sheet: upload icon and \u201cRevise this day from GPX\u201d delete that day\u2019s track and write your GPX/KML (saved routes and live recording).")
B.Sv=new A.X("v1.4.152 beta","2026-11-19","Kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda rota ikonuna k\u0131sa bas\u0131\u015f men\xfcy\xfc a\xe7ar; \u201cBu kayda ekle (eksik g\xfcn)\u2026\u201d orada. G\xfcn \u015feridi de ayn\u0131 men\xfcden.","While recording, a short tap on the route icon opens the menu; \u201cAdd into this recording\u2026\u201d is there. Day chips are in the same menu.")
B.RB=new A.X("v1.4.151 beta","2026-11-19","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda \u201cBu kayda ekle (eksik g\xfcn)\u2026\u201d: ba\u015fka uygulamadan GPX/KML ile g\xfcnleri canl\u0131 \xe7ok g\xfcnl\xfck kayda ekleyip devam edebilirsiniz (o g\xfcnlerdeki mevcut iz silinir, senin dosyan yaz\u0131l\u0131r).","Record screen \u201cAdd into this recording\u2026\u201d: import GPX/KML days into a live multi-day session and keep recording (those calendar days\u2019 existing points are deleted, then your file is written).")
B.TX=new A.X("v1.4.150 beta","2026-11-17","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck haritada ayn\u0131 noktaya binen g\xfcn yaz\u0131lar\u0131 \xe7apraz kayd\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r; alttaki etiketler az\u0131c\u0131k g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr kal\u0131r.","On multi-day maps, stacked day labels cascade diagonally so lower pills still peek out from underneath.")
B.S6=new A.X("v1.4.149 beta","2026-11-17","G\xfcn detay sheet\u2019ine kapat (\xd7) eklendi (sol \xfcst). B\xfcy\xfck haritada \xd7 sa\u011f/sol oklar\u0131n yan\u0131ndan \xe7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131; ekran\u0131n sol \xfcst\xfcne al\u0131nd\u0131.","Day detail sheet now has a top-left close (\xd7). On the full map, \xd7 moved off the prev/next row to that screen\u2019s top-left corner.")
B.S1=new A.X("v1.4.148 beta","2026-11-17","G\xfcn kart\u0131 mesafesi Day Atlas tarz\u0131 \u201cs\xfcr\xfclm\xfc\u015f km\u201d (park/jitter/s\u0131\xe7rama hari\xe7). \xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck kay\u0131t/rota \xf6nce tek k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 iz; ize dokununca g\xfcn renkleri + etiketler; bir g\xfcne dokununca o g\xfcn\xfcn detay\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r (sa\u011f/sol ile di\u011fer g\xfcnler). H\u0131z kart\u0131nda otomatik duraklatma: k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 e\u011fik \xe7izgi + durak ikonu.","Day-card distance is Day Atlas\u2013style driven km (no park jitter / jumps). Multi-day tracks start as one red line; tap to expand day colors/labels; tap a day to open that day\u2019s detail (left/right for others). Auto-pause on the speed pill is a red slash + pause icon.")
B.RG=new A.X("v1.4.147 beta","2026-11-17","Android g\xfcncelleme indirirken uygulama donup \u201cRideAtlas yan\u0131t vermiyor\u201d diyordu: ~70 MB APK art\u0131k arka planda (ayr\u0131 isolate) iner; ilerleme aray\xfcz\xfc yeniden \xe7izimi de seyreltildi.","Updating on Android could freeze with \u201cRideAtlas isn\u2019t responding\u201d: the ~70 MB APK now downloads on a background isolate, and progress UI rebuilds are throttled.")
B.Up=new A.X("v1.4.146 beta","2026-11-17","Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131nda G\xfcn 1 / G\xfcn 2 \u015feridi varsay\u0131lan gizli; Ruta ikonuna bas\u0131nca a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r, tekrar bas\u0131nca kapan\u0131r (uzun bas\u0131nca kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota men\xfcs\xfc). Ayr\u0131 \u201cOtomatik duraklat\u0131ld\u0131\u201d band\u0131 kalkt\u0131; yaz\u0131 h\u0131z kart\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerinde \u015feffaf katman olarak g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.","On the recording map, Day 1 / Day 2 chips stay hidden until you tap Ruta (tap again to hide; long-press for saved-route menu). The separate auto-pause banner is gone \u2014 the label overlays the speed card translucently instead.")
B.V7=new A.X("v1.4.145 beta","2026-11-16","G\xfcn detay\u0131 her zaman 1. g\xfcnden a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r; sa\u011f/sol oklarla g\xfcnler aras\u0131 ge\xe7i\u015f. Se\xe7ili g\xfcn\xfcn g\xfczerg\xe2h\u0131 mini haritada \xe7izilir; haritaya dokununca tam ekran harita a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r, g\xfcn bilgileri \xfcstte/altta g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.","Day detail always opens on Day 1; left/right arrows move between days. The selected day\u2019s track is drawn on a mini map; tap it for a fullscreen map with day stats overlaid top and bottom.")
B.RS=new A.X("v1.4.144 beta","2026-11-16","Kay\u0131t devam ederken de \xe7ok g\xfcnl\xfck izler g\xfcn g\xfcn renklenir; haritada G\xfcn \xb7 tarih etiketleri ve \xfcstte g\xfcn \u015feridi \xe7\u0131kar. Etikete, \u015feride veya ize dokununca o g\xfcn\xfcn detay\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r; detaydan ayn\u0131 noktaya not / foto\u011fraf eklenebilir.","While recording continues, multi-day tracks are color-coded by day with Day \xb7 date labels and a chip strip. Tap a label, chip, or track for that day\u2019s detail; from the sheet you can still add a note / photo at the tapped point.")
B.Sa=new A.X("v1.4.143 beta","2026-11-16","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck rotada her g\xfcn renkli \xe7izilir; haritada \u201cG\xfcn 1 \xb7 tarih\u201d etiketleri ve \xfcstte g\xfcn \u015feridi var. Etikete, \u015feride veya renkli ize dokununca o g\xfcn\xfcn km, s\xfcre, t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f ve detay sayfas\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r (yaln\u0131zca o g\xfcn\xfc haritada g\xf6sterme se\xe7ene\u011fiyle). Analiz \u2192 G\xfcnl\xfck kartlar\u0131 da ayn\u0131 sayfay\u0131 a\xe7ar.","Multi-day routes stay color-coded per day, with \u201cDay 1 \xb7 date\u201d map labels and a day chip strip. Tap a label, chip, or colored track for that day\u2019s km, time, climb/descent details (optional show-only-this-day on the map). Analysis \u2192 Daily cards open the same sheet.")
B.SV=new A.X("v1.4.142 beta","2026-11-16","Kay\u0131t d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131rken dosya ad\u0131na bug\xfcn\xfcn (kaydetme an\u0131) tarihi yaz\u0131l\u0131yordu. Art\u0131k her dosya, o par\xe7an\u0131n GPS takvim g\xfcn\xfcn\xfc kullan\u0131r (RideAtlas_yyyy-MM-dd; \xe7ok g\xfcn tek dosyada first_last).","Saving/exporting named files with today\u2019s (save-time) date. Files now use each segment\u2019s GPS calendar day (RideAtlas_yyyy-MM-dd; multi-day single file uses first_last).")
B.S5=new A.X("v1.4.141 beta","2026-11-15","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck d\u0131\u015fa aktarma diyalo\u011funda \u201cSe\xe7ili g\xfcnler\u201d se\xe7ilince g\xfcn i\u015faret kutular\u0131 (1. g\xfcn, 2. g\xfcn, \u2026) g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyordu \u2014 liste Flexible + min Column y\xfcz\xfcnden s\u0131f\u0131r y\xfckseklik al\u0131yordu. Kayd\u0131r\u0131labilir g\xf6vde ile d\xfczeltildi.","In the multi-day export dialog, picking \u201cSelected days\u201d did not show the day checkboxes (day 1, day 2, \u2026) \u2014 a Flexible inside a min-sized Column gave the list zero height. Fixed with a scrollable body.")
B.Tr=new A.X("v1.4.140 beta","2026-11-15","Dil \u0130ngilizceyken s\xfcr\xfcm ge\xe7mi\u015fi, yenilikler penceresi ve kalan sabit T\xfcrk\xe7e metinler (Android Auto, kay\u0131t bildirimi, analiz ilerleme) \u0130ngilizce.","With English selected, version history, the what\u2019s-new dialog, and leftover hardcoded copy (Android Auto, the recording notification, analysis progress) are now English too.")
B.U_=new A.X("v1.4.139 beta","2026-11-15","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck canl\u0131 kay\u0131tta g\xfcn/t\xfcm rota d\u0131\u015fa aktarma yaln\u0131z \xfcstteki payla\u015f tu\u015fu; duraklat\u0131nca ayr\u0131 d\xfc\u011fme, Analiz G\xfcnl\xfck sat\u0131r payla\u015f ve harita \u22ee \u201cG\xfcnleri d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u201d kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (kay\u0131tl\u0131 rotada harita payla\u015f kal\u0131r). G\xfcnl\xfck Drive: \u201cEksik g\xfcnleri \u015fimdi yaz\u201d men\xfcs\xfc yok \u2014 uygulama \xf6ne gelince / klas\xf6r se\xe7ilince / gece yar\u0131s\u0131 a\xe7\u0131k kay\u0131ttaki g\xfcnler yeniden yaz\u0131l\u0131r (Hive\u2019da i\u015faretli ama Drive\u2019da olmayan g\xfcnler de). Ayarlar\u2019da Aray\xfcz: ara\xe7 ikonu, istatistik ikon g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc, kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 kartlar\u0131.","On a multi-day live recording, day/whole-trip export is only the top share button; the paused control, Analysis Daily row share, and map \u22ee \u201cExport days\u201d are gone (saved routes still use map share). Daily Drive: no \u201cWrite missing days now\u201d menu \u2014 bringing the app forward / picking the folder / midnight rewrites days from the open recording (including Hive-marked days missing on Drive). Settings \u2192 Interface: vehicle icon, stat icon look, recording screen cards.")
B.TR=new A.X("v1.4.138 beta","2026-11-15","Samsung One UI\u2019da kay\u0131t / zoom / konum ikonlar\u0131 sistem geri/son uygulamalar \xe7ubu\u011funun \xfcst\xfcne ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131 (OS inset; yoksa 24 dp). Harita (i) kimlik metni se\xe7ili dile g\xf6re: EN contributors, TR katk\u0131da bulunanlar, DE Mitwirkende.","On Samsung One UI the record / zoom / locate icons sit above the system back/recents bar (OS inset; 24 dp fallback). The map (i) credit follows the selected language: EN contributors, TR katk\u0131da bulunanlar, DE Mitwirkende.")
B.Tt=new A.X("v1.4.137 beta","2026-11-15","iPhone kay\u0131t: hop-within-noise izi seyreltirken HUD h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 da s\u0131f\u0131rl\u0131yordu (ger\xe7ek h\u0131z \u2192 0 yan\u0131p s\xf6nmesi). Art\u0131k HUD yaln\u0131z StickyStay kilitliyken 0; s\xfcr\xfc\u015fte Doppler\u2229displacement. Kay\u0131t StickyStay a\xe7\u0131k ba\u015flar (ilk 80\u2013240 m d\xfc\u015fmez). \u0130z seyreltme taban\u0131 5 m. iOS: AppleSettings distanceFilter 0, otomatik pause kapal\u0131.","iPhone recording: hop-within-noise thinning was also zeroing HUD speed (real speed \u2192 0 flash). HUD is now 0 only while StickyStay is locked; while riding it uses Doppler\u2229displacement. Recording starts with StickyStay on (first 80\u2013240 m are not dropped). Track thinning floor is 5 m. iOS: AppleSettings distanceFilter 0, automatic pause off.")
B.V4=new A.X("v1.4.136 beta","2026-11-15","GPX/KML i\xe7e aktarma: file_picker bazen bytes=null + ge\xe7erli path d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcyordu (iPhone / baz\u0131 Android). Art\u0131k path ve xFile yedekleniyor; \u201cdosya okunamad\u0131\u201d yanl\u0131\u015f negatifleri azal\u0131yor. \xc7oklu se\xe7imde zaten kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota atlanm\u0131\u015f de\u011fil ba\u015far\u0131 say\u0131l\u0131r.","GPX/KML import: file_picker sometimes returned bytes=null with a valid path (iPhone / some Android). Path and xFile are now fallbacks, so false \u201ccouldn\u2019t read file\u201d errors drop. In multi-select, an already-saved route counts as success rather than skipped.")
B.UE=new A.X("v1.4.135 beta","2026-11-15","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 \xe7ok g\xfcnl\xfck rotada istenen g\xfcn\xfc bulmak kolayd\u0131 de\u011fil. Art\u0131k Analiz \u2192 G\xfcnl\xfck sekmesinde her g\xfcn\xfcn sat\u0131r\u0131nda payla\u015f simgesi var; dokununca o g\xfcn ayr\u0131 dosya olarak klas\xf6re veya payla\u015f\u0131m men\xfcs\xfcne gider. Harita \u22ee men\xfcs\xfcnde de \u201cG\xfcnleri d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u201d sat\u0131r\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr.","Finding a day on a saved multi-day route was hard. Analysis \u2192 Daily now has a share icon on each day row \u2014 tap to send that day as its own file to a folder or the share sheet. The map \u22ee menu also shows \u201cExport days\u201d.")
B.SO=new A.X("v1.4.134 beta","2026-11-15","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck canl\u0131 kay\u0131tta g\xfcnleri \xe7\u0131karma yeri: kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 \xfcst sa\u011fdaki payla\u015f ikonu, veya duraklat\u0131nca \u201cG\xfcnleri d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u201d d\xfc\u011fmesi \u2014 g\xfcn se\xe7 \u2192 klas\xf6r/payla\u015f. Kaydetince ayr\u0131ca \u201cNereye kaydedilsin?\u201d (klas\xf6r se\xe7ici / payla\u015f / sadece uygulama) sorulur; \xe7ok g\xfcnl\xfckse g\xfcn ay\u0131rma da gelir. Yedek klas\xf6r\xfc sessizce kullan\u0131lmaz.","On a live multi-day recording, export days from the share icon top-right, or \u201cExport days\u201d when paused \u2014 pick days \u2192 folder/share. On Save you also get \u201cWhere should it be saved?\u201d (folder picker / share / app only); multi-day rides also offer day splitting. The backup folder is never used silently.")
B.S3=new A.X("v1.4.133 beta","2026-11-15","GPS s\xfczgeci: anl\u0131k tek hop 120 km/s \xfcst\xfcyse (sonraki hop da h\u0131zl\u0131 de\u011filse) s\u0131ra d\u0131\u015f\u0131 kabul edilip at\u0131l\u0131r; ard\u0131\u015f\u0131k hop\u2019lar 120\u2019nin \xfcst\xfcndeyse ger\xe7ek h\u0131z say\u0131l\u0131r ve iz korunur. Mutlak tavan h\xe2l\xe2 ~300 km/s (\u0131\u015f\u0131nlanma). \u0130\xe7e aktarmada MotionX vb. uygulamalara g\xf6re mesafe d\xfc\u015f\xfck \xe7\u0131k\u0131yorsa (\xf6r. 414\u2192384 km) \xe7o\u011funlukla glitch / spike-and-return s\xfczgecinin nokta silmesi \u2014 ham GPX ile kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131labilir.","GPS filter: a single hop above 120 km/h (when the next hop is not also fast) is treated as a glitch and dropped; consecutive hops above 120 count as real speed and the track is kept. Absolute ceiling is still ~300 km/h (teleport). If import distance looks low vs MotionX etc. (e.g. 414\u2192384 km), it is usually the glitch / spike-and-return filter removing points \u2014 compare with the raw GPX.")
B.Su=new A.X("v1.4.131 beta","2026-11-15","G\xfcnl\xfck Drive yede\u011fi: otomatik yazma yaln\u0131zca yeni GPS noktas\u0131nda tetikleniyordu; gece auto-pause / uygulama kapal\u0131yken tamamlanan g\xfcnler (\xf6r. 9\u2019dan sonras\u0131) klas\xf6re d\xfc\u015fmeyebiliyordu. Art\u0131k uygulama \xf6ne gelince, yedek ayar\u0131 y\xfcklenince ve yerel gece yar\u0131s\u0131ndan biraz sonra eksik g\xfcnler yakalan\u0131yor. Ayarlar\u2019da \u201cEksik g\xfcnleri \u015fimdi yaz\u201d ile a\xe7\u0131k kay\u0131ttaki g\xfcnler bir defada aktar\u0131l\u0131r; klas\xf6r yeniden se\xe7ilince de catch-up \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r. Payla\u015f \u2192 g\xfcnl\xfck d\u0131\u015fa aktarmada yedek klas\xf6r\xfc ayarl\u0131ysa ikinci kez klas\xf6r sorulmaz. Yazma hatalar\u0131 Ayarlar\u2019da g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr; Drive truncate reddi i\xe7in sil-yeniden olu\u015ftur yedek yolu eklendi.","Daily Drive backup: auto-write only fired on a new GPS point, so days finished overnight under auto-pause or with the app closed (e.g. after the 9th) could miss the folder. Missing days are now caught when the app comes to the foreground, when backup settings load, and shortly after local midnight. Settings \u2192 \u201cWrite missing days now\u201d dumps open-recording days in one pass; re-picking the folder also runs catch-up. Share \u2192 daily export skips asking for a folder again when the backup folder is set. Write errors show in Settings; a delete-and-recreate path covers Drive truncate refusals.")
B.Sg=new A.X("v1.4.130 beta","2026-11-15","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck rota/kay\u0131tta ka\xe7 g\xfcn oldu\u011fu g\xf6sterilir; t\xfcm rota tek dosya veya se\xe7ilen takvim g\xfcnleri (\xf6r. yaln\u0131zca 1. g\xfcn, ya da her g\xfcn ayr\u0131) d\u0131\u015fa aktar\u0131labilir. Nereye kaydedilece\u011fi sorulur: Android\u2019de klas\xf6r se\xe7imi (Drive vb.) veya payla\u015f\u0131m men\xfcs\xfc. \xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck kay\u0131t kaydedilince ayn\u0131 g\xfcn-g\xfcn d\u0131\u015fa aktarma teklif edilir. Analiz \u201cG\xfcnl\xfck\u201d ile ayn\u0131 yerel g\xfcn s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131.","Multi-day routes/recordings show how many days they span; you can export the whole ride as one file or selected calendar days (e.g. day 1 only, or each day separately). Destination is asked: Android folder picker (Drive etc.) or the share sheet. Saving a multi-day recording also offers the same day-by-day export. Day boundaries match Analysis \u2192 Daily.")
B.TK=new A.X("v1.4.129 beta","2026-11-04","Evde ak\u015famdan sabaha kay\u0131t ~2.4 km ve 7 saat \u201caktif\u201d yaz\u0131yordu: 25 m e\u015fi\u011fi gece GPS yuma\u011f\u0131n\u0131 tek tek kabul edip duraklatmay\u0131 a\xe7\u0131yordu. Art\u0131k durulan noktaya kilit: \xfcst \xfcste 3 fix her biri \u226580 m uzakla\u015fmadan iz b\xfcy\xfcmez, otomatik duraklama kalkmaz.","An overnight indoor recording used to log ~2.4 km and 7 hours \u201cactive\u201d: the 25 m hop rule accepted each GPS scribble and cleared auto-pause. The parked spot is now locked \u2014 the track does not grow and pause does not lift until three fixes in a row are each \u226580 m away.")
B.Tg=new A.X("v1.4.128 beta","2026-11-04","Evde dururken v1.4.127 h\xe2l\xe2 ~100 m ve 10 km/s b\u0131rakabiliyordu: telefon do\u011frulu\u011fu 8 m deyince 12 m\u2019lik i\xe7 mek\xe2n z\u0131plamas\u0131 ger\xe7ek san\u0131l\u0131yordu. Art\u0131k hop en az 25 m ve 2\xd7 bildirilen do\u011fruluk d\u0131\u015f\u0131ndaysa hareket say\u0131l\u0131r; otomatik duraklama daha erken tutar.","While sitting still, v1.4.127 could still write ~100 m and 10 km/h: a phone that reported 8 m accuracy treated a 12 m indoor hop as real. Movement now counts only if the hop is at least 25 m and outside 2\xd7 the reported accuracy, so auto-pause holds sooner.")
B.Uo=new A.X("v1.4.127 beta","2026-11-04","Evde dururken GPS sapmas\u0131 (\xf6r. 6 km, 72 km/s, irtifa inip \xe7\u0131kmas\u0131) art\u0131k mesafe/h\u0131z yazmaz. \u0130\xe7 mek\xe2n 20\u201340 m z\u0131plamalar\u0131 hem izi \u015fi\u015firiyor hem otomatik duraklatmay\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131yordu; bildirilen do\u011fruluk \xe7emberinin i\xe7indeki hop hareket say\u0131lmaz, duraklama ancak \xe7emberin belirgin d\u0131\u015f\u0131na \xe7\u0131k\u0131nca a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Kaydetmede native iz de ayn\u0131 s\xfczge\xe7ten ge\xe7er.","Indoor GPS wander (e.g. 6 km, 72 km/h, altitude bouncing) no longer writes distance or speed. 20\u201340 m indoor hops both bloated the track and cleared auto-pause; hops inside the reported accuracy circle do not count as movement, and pause lifts only after a clear exit. The native save path uses the same filter.")
B.Ug=new A.X("v1.4.126 beta","2026-10-13",'\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck kay\u0131tlarda her yerel g\xfcn, Analiz "G\xfcnl\xfck" ile ayn\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131rlarla tek GPX olarak yedeklenebiliyor (RideAtlas_yyyy-MM-dd.gpx) - dosyada yaln\u0131zca o g\xfcn\xfcn noktalar\u0131. Ayarlar > G\xfcnl\xfck Drive yede\u011fi ile Google Drive klas\xf6r\xfc se\xe7ilir (Android SAF); gece yar\u0131s\u0131 ge\xe7en g\xfcn ve kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda kaydetme tetikler.',"On multi-day recordings each local day can be backed up as its own GPX (RideAtlas_yyyy-MM-dd.gpx) using the same day boundaries as Analysis \u2192 Daily \u2014 only that day's points. Settings \u2192 Daily Drive backup picks a Google Drive folder (Android SAF); midnight and Save-during-recording both write the completed day.")
B.UK=new A.X("v1.4.125 beta","2026-09-29","Ayarlar'a \"G\xfcncellemeleri kontrol et\" sat\u0131r\u0131 eklendi: \xe7al\u0131\u015fan s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc g\xf6sterir, GitHub'daki android-latest ile kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131r\u0131r; g\xfcncelseniz s\xf6yler, yeni APK varsa ayn\u0131 G\xfcncelle / indirme ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131 ba\u015flat\u0131r. Web'de service worker yoklamas\u0131 yap\u0131p alttaki mevcut G\xfcncelle banner'\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131r (ikinci bir web g\xfcncelleme UI'\u0131 yok).","Settings now has \u201cCheck for updates\u201d: it shows the running version, compares it to GitHub android-latest, says if you are current, and starts the same Update / download flow when a new APK exists. On web it probes the service worker and uses the existing bottom Update banner (no second web update UI).")
B.Uf=new A.X("v1.4.124 beta","2026-09-29","Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131nda canl\u0131 k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 ize dokunarak not ve/veya foto\u011fraf eklenebiliyor; kaydetince GPX waypoint ve rota foto\u011fraf\u0131 olarak saklan\u0131yor. Kapal\u0131 alanda GPS'in telefon dururken g\xf6sterdi\u011fi sahte 2\u20135 km/s s\xfcr\xfcklenme, yer de\u011fi\u015ftirmeye g\xf6re s\u0131n\u0131rland\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yor \u2014 h\u0131z HUD'da ~0 g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr ve otomatik duraklama yine devreye girer. Mevcut s\u0131\xe7rama / imk\xe2ns\u0131z h\u0131z filtreleri ayn\u0131 kald\u0131.","On the recording map you can tap the live red track to add a note and/or photo; they are stored as a GPX waypoint and route photo on save. Indoor GPS fake 2\u20135 km/h crawl while the phone is still is capped by actual movement \u2014 the HUD shows ~0 and auto-pause still engages. Existing jump / impossible-speed filters are unchanged.")
B.Ub=new A.X("v1.4.123 beta","2026-09-23",'Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131ndaki h\u0131z rakam\u0131 art\u0131k tek sat\u0131rda ortalan\u0131yor: hane art\u0131nca (\xf6r. 97 \u2192 108) gerekirse k\xfc\xe7\xfcl\xfcyor, rakamlar alt alta k\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131yor. \xdcst s\u0131radaki gereksiz Spacer kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 - h\u0131z kutusu sola s\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131p "9 / 7" diye iki sat\u0131ra b\xf6l\xfcn\xfcyordu.',"The recording-map speed figure stays on one centered line: it shrinks when digits grow (e.g. 97 \u2192 108) instead of wrapping. A leftover Spacer in the top row was removed \u2014 it used to squeeze the speed box so \u201c97\u201d split onto two lines.")
B.UB=new A.X("v1.4.122 beta","2026-09-11","Uygulama s\xfcrekli a\xe7\u0131ksa (\xf6r. gece boyu kay\u0131t) her g\xfcn yerel saat 12:00'de g\xfcncelleme kontrol\xfc yap\u0131l\u0131yor; yeni s\xfcr\xfcm varsa sessizce indirmeye ba\u015fl\u0131yor - yaln\u0131zca a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta bakmakla kalm\u0131yor.","If the app stays open (e.g. overnight recording), it checks for updates every day at local noon and starts a silent download when a new version exists \u2014 not only on launch.")
B.V8=new A.X("v1.4.121 beta","2026-09-11","Rota se\xe7im ekran\u0131nda G\xf6ster/Gizle yerine Tamam/Vazge\xe7 var; se\xe7imi bo\u015f b\u0131rak\u0131p Tamam deyince haritadaki rotalar kalk\u0131yor. \u0130\u015faretlenen rotalar i\xe7in \xe7\xf6p kutusu \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor - se\xe7ililer kal\u0131c\u0131 silinebiliyor.","The route picker uses OK/Cancel instead of Show/Hide; confirming with nothing selected clears routes from the map. A trash control appears for checked routes so you can delete the selection permanently.")
B.SE=new A.X("v1.4.120 beta","2026-09-09","Se\xe7ili rotay\u0131 silmek art\u0131k rota detay haritas\u0131nda (\u22ee men\xfc) ve ana ekran / kay\u0131t haritas\u0131nda rotaya dokununca \xe7\u0131kan etiketin alt\u0131ndaki Sil tu\u015fuyla m\xfcmk\xfcn - yaln\u0131zca rota listesinden silmek zorunda kal\u0131nm\u0131yor.","Deleting the selected route is now possible from the route-detail map (\u22ee menu) and from the Delete button under the name chip when you tap a route on the home or recording map \u2014 you no longer have to go through the route list.")
B.Un=new A.X("v1.4.119 beta","2026-09-07",'Otomatik g\xfcncelleme kontrol\xfc art\u0131k tamamen sessiz: ana ekran a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda yeni bir s\xfcr\xfcm bulunursa "g\xfcncelle ister misin?" diye sormadan direkt indirmeye ba\u015fl\u0131yor (ilerleme durumu yine banner\'da g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor). Kurulum an\u0131nda Android\'in kendi kurulum onay ekran\u0131 yine de \xe7\u0131kar - bunu hi\xe7bir uygulama atlayamaz, tek "onay" ad\u0131m\u0131 art\u0131k bu.',"Automatic update checks are fully silent: if a new version is found when the home screen opens, download starts without asking \u201cdo you want to update?\u201d (progress still shows on the banner). Android still shows its own install confirmation \u2014 no app can skip that; it is now the only confirm step.")
B.T6=new A.X("v1.4.118 beta","2026-09-07","Ana ekran\u0131n \"Rota se\xe7...\" penceresindeki 10/24 rota s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 - Home'un amac\u0131 zaten rotalar\u0131 y\xfckleyip g\xf6rmek, s\u0131n\u0131rlama orada mant\u0131ks\u0131zd\u0131. Ayn\u0131 s\u0131n\u0131r, ayn\u0131 gerek\xe7eyle route list'ten \xe7oklu rota haritas\u0131na (multi_route_map_screen) girerken de kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki overlay se\xe7imi (canl\u0131 GPS kayd\u0131 s\u0131ras\u0131nda, performans i\xe7in) eskisi gibi 10/24 s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131 kald\u0131 - harita zaten Android'de ~20+ rotada donma riski ta\u015f\u0131yor oldu\u011fu i\xe7in orada k\u0131s\u0131tlama h\xe2l\xe2 gerekli.","The 10/24 route cap on the home \u201cSelect route\u2026\u201d sheet is gone \u2014 Home is meant to load and show routes. The same cap is removed when opening the multi-route map from the list. The recording overlay picker stays capped at 10/24 for performance \u2014 the live map can freeze around 20+ tracks on Android.")
B.V0=new A.X("v1.4.117 beta","2026-09-07",'Canl\u0131 testte bulunan bir dizi k\xfc\xe7\xfck ama ger\xe7ek sorun d\xfczeltildi. (1) Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n rota men\xfcs\xfc ("T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster"/"T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc gizle" kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131) art\u0131k ana ekran\u0131nkiyle tutarl\u0131: sadece "Rota se\xe7..." ve "\u0130\xe7e aktar...". (2) Veri sayfas\u0131na da (kay\u0131t s\xfcrerken bile) geri tu\u015fu eklendi - PopScope zaten izin verdi\u011fi i\xe7in kay\u0131t s\xfcrerken \xf6nce Harita sayfas\u0131na ge\xe7iyor, oradan bir daha bas\u0131nca Ana ekrana \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor. (3) Ana ekranda tek rota se\xe7mek (Rota se\xe7... ile veya tek dosya i\xe7e aktararak) art\u0131k o rotay\u0131 da overlay\'e ekliyor - \xf6nceden sadece detay sayfas\u0131na gidip overlay\'i hi\xe7 dokunmuyordu; \u015fimdi geri d\xf6n\xfcld\xfc\u011f\xfcnde o tek rota haritada g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor ve "Rota se\xe7..." tekrar a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda i\u015faretli geliyor, \xe7oklu se\xe7imde oldu\u011fu gibi. (4) Rota detay ekran\u0131ndaki (tek rota haritas\u0131) "rota de\u011fi\u015ftir" listesi d\xfc\u011fmesi kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 - art\u0131k gereksiz, rota se\xe7imi tamamen ana ekrandan y\xf6netiliyor; o d\xfc\u011fmenin alt\u0131ndaki anormal-nokta-d\xfczenleme \xf6zelli\u011fi kaybolmad\u0131, sa\u011f \xfcstteki yeni bir men\xfcye ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131. (5) Rota se\xe7im penceresine sa\u011f \xfcstte bir s\u0131ralama d\xfc\u011fmesi eklendi: tarihe (kay\u0131t tarihi), isme, veya uzunlu\u011fa g\xf6re. (6) Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki h\u0131z g\xf6stergesi art\u0131k ekran\u0131n ortas\u0131nda; hane say\u0131s\u0131 (1/2/3 haneli h\u0131z) artt\u0131k\xe7a sa\u011fdan sola tek y\xf6nl\xfc b\xfcy\xfcmek yerine iki yandan simetrik geni\u015fliyor.',"Live-test fixes. (1) The recording-screen route menu now matches Home: only \u201cSelect route\u2026\u201d and \u201cImport\u2026\u201d. (2) The Data page also has a back button \u2014 while recording it first returns to Map, then Home. (3) Picking a single route (or importing one file) now also adds it as a home overlay, so it is still on the map when you come back. (4) The route-detail \u201cswitch route\u201d list button is gone; anomaly editing moved to a new top-right menu. (5) The route picker has a sort button: date, name, or length. (6) Recording-screen speed is centered and grows symmetrically as digits are added.")
B.Sk=new A.X("v1.4.116 beta","2026-09-07","\u0130ki eksiklik canl\u0131 testte bulundu ve d\xfczeltildi. (1) Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndan ana harita ekran\u0131na d\xf6necek g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr bir tu\u015f yoktu - v1.4.112'de \xfcstteki geri oku kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131p sistem geri tu\u015fu/hareketine b\u0131rak\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131, ama iOS web'de bunun g\xfcvenilir bir kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131\u011f\u0131 yok; kay\u0131t s\xfcrerken kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n Ana ekrana d\xf6necek hi\xe7bir yolu kalmam\u0131\u015ft\u0131. Harita sayfas\u0131n\u0131n sol \xfcst\xfcne (hem bo\u015fta hem kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda) bir geri oku eklendi - PopScope'un zaten izin verdi\u011fi tam olarak ayn\u0131 davran\u0131\u015f\u0131 tetikliyor, kay\u0131t arka planda devam ediyor. (2) Ana ekranda birden fazla iz overlay olarak g\xf6sterildi\u011finde (v1.4.115), o izlere yeniden s\u0131\u011fd\u0131racak bir tu\u015f yoktu - haritada uzakla\u015f\u0131p/yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131ktan sonra manuel olarak eski konuma d\xf6nmek gerekiyordu. Sa\u011f alttaki zoom tu\u015flar\u0131n\u0131n aras\u0131na, izler g\xf6steriliyorken \xe7\u0131kan bir \"s\u0131\u011fd\u0131r\" tu\u015fu eklendi.","Two live-test gaps. (1) After v1.4.112 removed the top back arrow, iOS web had no reliable way back to Home while recording. A back arrow is on the map page (idle and recording) and triggers the same PopScope path \u2014 recording continues. (2) With several overlay tracks on Home there was no refit control; a fit button now sits among the zoom buttons when tracks are shown.")
B.Tv=new A.X("v1.4.115 beta","2026-09-07",'Ana ekran\u0131n "Rota se\xe7..." ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 yeniden kurguland\u0131. \xd6nceki s\xfcr\xfcmde (v1.4.113) birden fazla rota se\xe7mek ayr\u0131 bir ekrana (MultiRouteMapScreen) g\xf6t\xfcr\xfcyordu; sistem geri tu\u015funa bas\u0131nca o ekran kapan\u0131yor, izleri tekrar g\xf6rmek i\xe7in "Rota se\xe7..." penceresini yeniden a\xe7\u0131p onaylamak gerekiyordu - kullan\u0131c\u0131 testi s\u0131ras\u0131nda bunun "hi\xe7 kapanmam\u0131\u015f gibi devam etme" beklentisini kar\u015f\u0131lamad\u0131\u011f\u0131, ayr\u0131ca ger\xe7ek bir hata bar\u0131nd\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131 ortaya \xe7\u0131kt\u0131: g\xf6sterilen t\xfcm izlerin i\u015faretini kald\u0131r\u0131p onaylay\u0131nca (24 rotay\u0131 se\xe7ip "Hepsi" ile hepsini kald\u0131rma senaryosu) bu bo\u015f se\xe7im hi\xe7 haf\u0131zaya yaz\u0131lm\u0131yordu - ekran tekrar a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda eski, kald\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f se\xe7im geri geliyordu, sanki hi\xe7 temizlenmemi\u015f gibi. \u015eimdi: kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki referans-iz mant\u0131\u011f\u0131yla ayn\u0131 yakla\u015f\u0131m - se\xe7ilen izler do\u011frudan ana ekran\u0131n kendi haritas\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerine \xe7iziliyor, ayr\u0131 ekrana hi\xe7 gidilmiyor; bu se\xe7im (bo\u015f dahil) her zaman do\u011fru \u015fekilde haf\u0131zaya yaz\u0131l\u0131p uygulama yeniden a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda geri y\xfckleniyor. Tek rota se\xe7ilirse (Rota se\xe7... ile veya tek dosya i\xe7e aktararak) otomatik olarak o rotan\u0131n tam detay ekran\u0131na (g\xfcn bazl\u0131 analiz, y\xfckseklik, hava durumu, tam \xe7\xf6z\xfcn\xfcrl\xfck) gidiliyor - MultiRouteMapScreen\'in payla\u015f\u0131lan/d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfclm\xfc\u015f \xe7\xf6z\xfcn\xfcrl\xfck b\xfct\xe7esine hi\xe7 girmiyor. \xc7oklu izler g\xf6sterilirken haritada birine dokununca ismi ve yan\u0131nda bir "Detayl\u0131 analiz" butonu \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor, ona bas\u0131nca da ayn\u0131 tam detay ekran\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor. Ayr\u0131ca rota se\xe7im penceresinin "G\xf6ster" butonu art\u0131k hi\xe7bir \u015fey se\xe7ili de\u011filken pasifle\u015fmek yerine "Gizle" yaz\u0131p etkin kal\u0131yor - bilerek bo\u015f b\u0131rakmay\u0131 ger\xe7ek bir se\xe7enek haline getiriyor.',"Home \u201cSelect route\u2026\u201d no longer opens a separate MultiRouteMapScreen. Selected tracks draw on the home map itself and the selection (including empty) is persisted. A single route still opens the full detail screen. Tapping a track among several shows its name and \u201cDetailed analysis\u201d. The picker\u2019s Show button stays enabled as Hide when nothing is selected, so clearing the map is a real choice.")
B.T7=new A.X("v1.4.114 beta","2026-09-07",'Rota se\xe7im penceresi ba\u015ftan tasarland\u0131. Eskiden kutu i\xe7inde sade bir "Hepsi + checkbox listesi" olan AlertDialog, \xfc\xe7 ayr\u0131 yerde (kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n referans iz overlay\'i, \xe7oklu-rota haritas\u0131n\u0131n "N rota" pilinden a\xe7\u0131lan yeniden se\xe7im, ana ekran\u0131n "Rota se\xe7...") de ayn\u0131 "amat\xf6r" g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcmdeydi. \u015eimdi alttan a\xe7\u0131lan, yuvarlak k\xf6\u015feli bir panel: "Hepsi" sat\u0131r\u0131 ve ka\xe7 rotan\u0131n se\xe7ili oldu\u011fu ("2/5" gibi) listenin \xfcst\xfcnde sabit duruyor (art\u0131k kayd\u0131r\u0131l\u0131p g\xf6zden ka\xe7m\u0131yor), her rota haritada \xe7izilece\u011fi renkle (\xe7oklu-rota haritas\u0131ndaki legend ile ayn\u0131 renk s\u0131ras\u0131) \xf6nizleniyor, "G\xf6ster" butonu se\xe7ili say\u0131y\u0131 g\xf6steriyor ve hi\xe7bir \u015fey se\xe7ili de\u011filken pasif oluyor.',"The route picker is a bottom sheet instead of a plain checkbox dialog. The All row and selected count stay pinned at the top, each route is previewed in its map color, and Show reports the selected count and is disabled when none are checked.")
B.Tb=new A.X("v1.4.113 beta","2026-09-07",'Ana ekrandaki rota men\xfcs\xfc sadele\u015ftirildi: "T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster" ve "Rotalar" listesi men\xfcden kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 ("Hepsi" zaten "Rota se\xe7..." penceresinde vard\u0131), sol \xfcstteki rota ikonu yerine d\xfcz "Rotalar" yaz\u0131s\u0131 kondu. Rota yeniden adland\u0131rma/birle\u015ftirme/silme ekran\u0131 art\u0131k Ayarlar > Rotalar\'dan a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor (men\xfcden kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in eri\u015fimi orada kals\u0131n diye ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131). En b\xfcy\xfck de\u011fi\u015fiklik: izleri g\xf6steren harita ekran\u0131 art\u0131k en son hangi izler g\xf6steriliyorduysa onu hat\u0131rl\u0131yor - "Rota se\xe7..." penceresi son se\xe7imi i\u015faretli a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor, ve ayn\u0131 se\xe7imle yeniden a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda harita da kapanmadan \xf6nceki zoom/konumla devam ediyor (her seferinde yeniden \xe7er\xe7eveleme yapm\u0131yor). Ayr\u0131ca \xfc\xe7 ayr\u0131 yerde (kay\u0131t ekran\u0131, \xe7oklu-rota haritas\u0131, ana ekran) neredeyse ayn\u0131 olan "Hepsi + rota listesi" se\xe7im penceresi tek bir ortak bile\u015fene indirildi.',"Home route menu simplified: \u201cShow all\u201d and the Routes list left the menu (All is already in \u201cSelect route\u2026\u201d); the icon is now a \u201cRoutes\u201d label. Rename/merge/delete moved to Settings \u2192 Routes. The map remembers the last shown tracks, restores the picker checks, and keeps zoom/position instead of re-fitting every time. The three nearly identical All+list pickers are now one shared widget.")
B.SD=new A.X("v1.4.112 beta","2026-09-06",'GPX i\xe7e aktarmadaki "sessizce hi\xe7bir \u015fey olmuyor" hatas\u0131n\u0131n k\xf6k nedeni bulundu: web dosya se\xe7icisinde taray\u0131c\u0131, ger\xe7ekten bir dosya se\xe7ilmi\u015f olsa bile "cancel" DOM olay\u0131n\u0131 "change" olay\u0131ndan \xf6nce tetikleyebiliyordu - \xf6nceki d\xfczeltmedeki sabit 400ms gecikme bile bu fark\u0131 her zaman kapatam\u0131yordu, canl\u0131 testte 4/4 denemede i\xe7e aktarma h\xe2l\xe2 ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oluyordu. \u015eimdi sabit bir gecikme yerine, ger\xe7ek "change" olay\u0131 gelene ya da okuma ba\u015flayana kadar (en fazla ~2 saniye) tekrar tekrar kontrol ediliyor; canl\u0131 testte art arda 4/4 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131. Ayr\u0131ca kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n gezinme modeli sadele\u015ftirildi: art\u0131k yaln\u0131zca iki sayfa var (Harita, Veri), \xfcstteki geri oku tu\u015fu tamamen kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (sistem geri tu\u015fu/hareketi zaten ayn\u0131 i\u015fi g\xf6r\xfcyor - bo\u015ftayken ekrandan \xe7\u0131kar, kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda Veri sayfas\u0131ndayken \xf6nce Haritaya d\xf6ner). Yeni bir kay\u0131t ba\u015flat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda (hen\xfcz kay\u0131t yokken) her zaman Veri sayfas\u0131nda a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor; devam eden bir kay\u0131t yeniden a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda ise en son hangi sayfada kal\u0131nd\u0131ysa (Harita ya da Veri) orada a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda g\xf6sterilen referans izler de art\u0131k hat\u0131rlan\u0131yor: se\xe7ilen izler bir sonraki kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda otomatik olarak yeniden g\xf6steriliyor.',"Silent GPX import on web: the browser could fire cancel before change even after a 400 ms delay. The picker now waits (up to ~2 s) until a real change or a read starts \u2014 4/4 in live tests. Recording navigation is two pages (Map, Data); the top back arrow is gone (system back does the same). A new recording opens on Data; a resumed one reopens the last page. Reference tracks on the recording map are remembered.")
B.Tw=new A.X("v1.4.111 beta","2026-09-06","Kay\u0131t / konum beyaz ekran\u0131n\u0131n ger\xe7ek k\xf6k nedeni bulundu. v1.4.109 ve v1.4.110 harita karolar\u0131n\u0131n y\xfcklenme zamanlamas\u0131n\u0131 d\xfczeltmeye \xe7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131\u015ft\u0131 ama bu yanl\u0131\u015f te\u015fhisti - ekran h\xe2l\xe2 bombo\u015f kal\u0131yordu. Uygulama yerel olarak derlenip ger\xe7ek bir taray\u0131c\u0131da ad\u0131m ad\u0131m test edilerek as\u0131l neden bulundu: kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n Stack'i i\xe7indeki \"kesintiye u\u011fram\u0131\u015f kay\u0131t devam ediyor\" bildirimini \xe7izen _buildResumedFlash metodu, bildirim g\xf6sterilmeyecekse (kay\u0131tlar\u0131n b\xfcy\xfck \xe7o\u011funlu\u011funda b\xf6yle) konumland\u0131r\u0131lmam\u0131\u015f (Positioned olmayan) bo\u015f bir widget d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcyordu. Stack'in di\u011fer t\xfcm elemanlar\u0131 Positioned iken aralar\u0131na Positioned olmayan bir eleman girince Flutter o Stack'in TAMAMINI (harita, t\xfcm tu\u015flar, her \u015fey) \xe7izmeyi b\u0131rak\u0131yordu - sadece o k\xfc\xe7\xfck bildirim widget'\u0131 de\u011fil. D\xfczeltme tek sat\u0131r: bo\u015f durumda da Positioned.fill ile sarmalanm\u0131\u015f bir widget d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcl\xfcyor art\u0131k.","The recording / location white screen was not a tile-timing bug. _buildResumedFlash returned a non-Positioned empty widget when the resume toast was hidden; Flutter then skipped painting the entire Stack (map and all buttons). Empty state now returns a Positioned.fill widget.")
B.U7=new A.X("v1.4.110 beta","2026-09-06","v1.4.109 derlemesi k\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131: kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda _tileLayerEpoch alan\u0131 eksikti, web/APK \xe7\u0131kmad\u0131. Alan geri eklendi; kay\u0131t/konum beyaz ekran d\xfczeltmesi (GPS merkezi, onMapReady kick, TileLayer remount) art\u0131k ger\xe7ekten da\u011f\u0131t\u0131l\u0131yor.","v1.4.109 did not compile: RecordScreen was missing _tileLayerEpoch, so web/APK never shipped. The field is back; the GPS-center / onMapReady / TileLayer remount fix is actually released.")
B.RR=new A.X("v1.4.109 beta","2026-09-06","Ana ekran kay\u0131t / konum (ve kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda konuma git) beyaz ekran: RecordScreen\u2019e son GPS merkezi aktar\u0131l\u0131yor; onMapReady + geni\u015f zoom + soft karo zemini; gecikmeli TileLayer remount + kick. Konuma git / Data\u2192Harita ge\xe7i\u015finde de ayn\u0131 g\xfc\xe7lendirme.","Home recording / location (and recenter while recording) white screen: RecordScreen now receives the last GPS center; onMapReady + wide zoom + a soft tile floor; delayed TileLayer remount + kick. Recenter and Data\u2192Map use the same strengthening.")
B.T4=new A.X("v1.4.108 beta","2026-09-06","Android\u2019de ~20 izle \u201ct\xfcm izleri g\xf6ster\u201d kilitlenmesi: harita i\xe7in toplam k\xf6\u015fe b\xfct\xe7esi (~6k), iz ba\u015f\u0131na daha agresif sadele\u015ftirme, paralel parse 4\u21922, progress setState throttle, \xe7ok izde foto pin yok, polyline daha ince. Soft/hard cap 10/24.","Android freeze showing ~20 tracks: a ~6k vertex budget for the map, more aggressive per-track simplify, parallel parse 4\u21922, throttled progress setState, no photo pins on many tracks, thinner polylines. Soft/hard caps 10/24.")
B.Th=new A.X("v1.4.105 beta","2026-09-06","Ana ekran iz men\xfcs\xfcnden GPX/KML/KMZ i\xe7e aktarma hatalar\u0131 (okunamayan dosya, desteklenmeyen t\xfcr, yinelenen rota, parse hatas\u0131) sessizce yutuluyordu \u2014 snackbar + mevcut rotay\u0131 a\xe7ma eklendi. iPhone kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 bo\u015f beyaz kalma: harita karo kick (ana haritadaki gibi).","GPX/KML/KMZ import errors from the home track menu (unreadable file, unsupported type, duplicate, parse error) were swallowed \u2014 snackbar + opening the existing route added. iPhone recording screen staying white: map tile kick like the home map.")
B.RU=new A.X("v1.4.104 beta","2026-09-06","v1.4.103 derlemesi k\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015ft\u0131: kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda track_io importu eksikti, web/APK \xe7\u0131kmad\u0131. Import geri eklendi; t\xfcm izleri g\xf6ster h\u0131zland\u0131rmas\u0131 (paralel y\xfckleme, bellek \xf6nbelle\u011fi, tek seferde \xe7izim) art\u0131k ger\xe7ekten da\u011f\u0131t\u0131l\u0131yor.","v1.4.103 did not compile: RecordScreen was missing a track_io import. Import restored; show-all-tracks speedups (parallel load, memory cache, one-shot draw) now actually ship.")
B.Tz=new A.X("v1.4.103 beta","2026-09-06","T\xfcm izleri g\xf6ster art\u0131k \xf6nce belle\u011fe al\u0131p paralel parse ediyor, haz\u0131r olunca tek seferde \xe7iziyor; sadele\u015ftirilmi\u015f geometri \xf6nbellekte kal\u0131yor b\xf6ylece ikinci a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f neredeyse an\u0131nda. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 overlay izleri de ayn\u0131 h\u0131zl\u0131 yolu kullan\u0131yor.","Show all tracks now parses in parallel into memory and draws once; simplified geometry stays cached so the second open is nearly instant. Recording overlay tracks use the same fast path.")
B.UO=new A.X("v1.4.102 beta","2026-09-05","T\xfcm izleri g\xf6ster kilitlemesi giderildi: \xe7ok izde uyar\u0131/sert s\u0131n\u0131r, rota ba\u015f\u0131na daha agresif nokta sadele\u015ftirme, g\xf6sterimde ilerleyici \xe7izim kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131, harita foto pinleri art\u0131k tam g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfc yerine hafif ikon, iz ismi i\xe7in dokunma testi \xf6rnekleniyor. Kay\u0131t overlay ekran\u0131nda da ayn\u0131 sadele\u015ftirme uygulan\u0131yor.","Show-all-tracks freeze: warn/hard cap on many tracks, more aggressive per-route simplify, no progressive draw, photo pins as light icons, sampled hit-testing for names. Same simplify on the recording overlay.")
B.T0=new A.X("v1.4.101 beta","2026-09-05",'Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 son Veri/Harita tercihini hat\u0131rl\u0131yor; kesilip s\xfcren kay\u0131tta k\u0131sa ortada "s\xfcrd\xfcr\xfcl\xfcyor" bildirimi. Ana harita sol \xfcst iz men\xfcs\xfc (t\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster / se\xe7 / i\xe7e aktar / rota listesi). Kay\u0131t bitince yaln\u0131zca GPS konumlu galeri medyas\u0131 sunuluyor (konumsuz yok); foto\u011fraf iz \xfczerinde nokta. \xc7oklu iz / kay\u0131t haritas\u0131nda ize dokununca isim balonu a\xe7\u0131l\u0131p tekrar dokununca kapan\u0131yor.',"Recording screen remembers the last Data/Map page; a short \u201cresumed\u201d flash after an interrupted session. Home map has a top-left track menu (show all / pick / import / list). After save, only GPS-tagged gallery media are offered; photos mark the track. Tapping a track on multi-track / recording maps toggles a name bubble.")
B.RJ=new A.X("v1.4.100 beta","2026-09-05","Kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda geri tu\u015fu kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131: sol \xfcst yaln\u0131zca iz y\xf6netimi (T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster / T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc gizle / Rota se\xe7... / \u0130\xe7e aktar...) \u2014 hem veri hem harita sayfas\u0131nda ayn\u0131 men\xfc. Veri \u2194 Harita d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm\xfc sadece sol alttaki tu\u015fla; geri tu\u015fuyla ikinci bir harita yolu yok. Kay\u0131t ba\u015flamadan (idle) haritada geri h\xe2l\xe2 var. Sistem geri: verideyken haritaya, haritadayken ekrandan \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f (kay\u0131t arka planda s\xfcrer).","While recording, the back button is gone: top-left is only track management (Show all / Hide all / Select route\u2026 / Import\u2026) on both Data and Map. Data \u2194 Map is only the bottom-left button. Idle map still has back. System back: Data\u2192Map, Map leaves the screen (recording continues).")
B.TM=new A.X("v1.4.99 beta","2026-09-05","Kay\u0131t veri ekran\u0131ndaki geri tu\u015fu (ve Android sistem geri) art\u0131k kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndan \xe7\u0131kmak yerine do\u011frudan haritaya ge\xe7iyor - haritadaki geri tu\u015fu h\xe2l\xe2 ekrandan ayr\u0131lmay\u0131 sa\u011fl\u0131yor (kay\u0131t arka planda devam eder). Sol alttaki Veri \u2194 Haritalar ge\xe7i\u015fi ve harita sol \xfcst\xfcndeki rota men\xfcs\xfc (T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster / T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc gizle / Rota se\xe7... / \u0130\xe7e aktar...) v1.4.98'deki gibi duruyor; alttan a\xe7\u0131lan panel yok.","Back on the recording Data page (and Android system back) now goes to the map instead of leaving; the map back button still leaves (recording continues). Bottom-left Data \u2194 Maps and the top-left route menu stay as in v1.4.98; no bottom sheet.")
B.RY=new A.X("v1.4.98 beta","2026-09-05","v1.4.97'deki tek-ekran + alttan a\xe7\u0131lan panel denemesi geri al\u0131nd\u0131: kullan\u0131c\u0131 canl\u0131da test edince paneli be\u011fenmedi ve \xf6nceki iki tam sayfal\u0131 (Veri / Harita, sol alttaki tu\u015fla ge\xe7i\u015fli) yap\u0131n\u0131n aynen kalmas\u0131n\u0131 istedi. Sol \xfcstteki rota men\xfcs\xfc (v1.4.97 ile gelen T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster / T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc gizle / Rota se\xe7... dropdown'\u0131) korundu ve geni\u015fletildi: art\u0131k ayn\u0131 men\xfcden \"\u0130\xe7e aktar...\" ile kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndan hi\xe7 ayr\u0131lmadan yeni bir GPX/KML/KMZ dosyas\u0131 se\xe7ilip hem \u0130zler listesine kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak eklenebiliyor hem de haritada referans rota olarak g\xf6sterilebiliyor.","The v1.4.97 single-screen + bottom sheet was reverted after live testing \u2014 the two full pages (Data / Map, bottom-left toggle) stay. The top-left route menu is kept and extended: \u201cImport\u2026\u201d adds a GPX/KML/KMZ to the library and as a reference track without leaving recording.")
B.T5=new A.X("v1.4.97 beta","2026-09-05","v1.4.94'teki d\xfczenleme yetersiz kalm\u0131\u015ft\u0131: kullan\u0131c\u0131 h\xe2l\xe2 veri ve harita aras\u0131nda iki ayr\u0131 sayfa gezinmek zorunda kal\u0131yordu ve sol \xfcstteki rota tu\u015fu sadece k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir onay kutusu diyalo\u011fu a\xe7\u0131yordu. Bu s\xfcr\xfcmde kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 ger\xe7ekten tek ekrana indirildi: harita art\u0131k kal\u0131c\u0131 taban katman, \xfczerinde de yukar\u0131/a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 s\xfcr\xfcklenebilen bir veri paneli (DraggableScrollableSheet) var - kapal\u0131yken sadece duraklat/kaydet/s\u0131f\u0131rla tu\u015flar\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor, yukar\u0131 \xe7ekilince s\xfcre, h\u0131z ve t\xfcm \xf6zelle\u015ftirilebilir istatistik kartlar\u0131 geliyor. Sol \xfcstteki rota tu\u015fu da referans uygulamadaki gibi ger\xe7ek bir a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r men\xfcye (PopupMenuButton) d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcld\xfc: T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster / T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc gizle / Rota se\xe7....","Recording became one screen: the map is the permanent base with a draggable data sheet (closed: pause/save/reset; pulled up: time, speed, stat cards). The top-left route button is a real menu: Show all / Hide all / Select route\u2026.")
B.SI=new A.X("v1.4.96 beta","2026-09-05",'v1.4.93\'ten sonra kullan\u0131c\u0131 iPhone/Safari\'de art\u0131k GPX dosyas\u0131n\u0131 se\xe7ebildi\u011fini ama rotan\u0131n eklenmedi\u011fini bildirdi. K\xf6k sebep bir yar\u0131\u015f durumuydu: web dosya se\xe7icisi hem "change" olay\u0131n\u0131 hem de (Safari "cancel" olay\u0131n\u0131 g\xfcvenilir vermedi\u011fi i\xe7in eklenen) pencere odaklanma yede\u011fini dinliyordu; okuma yava\u015f kald\u0131\u011f\u0131nda (b\xfcy\xfck dosya/yava\u015f cihaz) ikisi de ayn\u0131 dosyay\u0131 ayn\u0131 anda okumaya \xe7al\u0131\u015fabiliyordu, bu da sessizce ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olabiliyordu - ve okuma ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olan dosyalar hi\xe7 hata g\xf6stermeden tamamen atlan\u0131yordu, sanki hi\xe7bir \u015fey se\xe7ilmemi\u015f gibi. Art\u0131k bir okuma ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda yedek mekanizma ayn\u0131 dosyaya asla tekrar dokunmuyor, ve okunamayan bir dosya da "dosya okunamad\u0131" uyar\u0131s\u0131yla kullan\u0131c\u0131ya bildiriliyor.',"On iPhone/Safari a GPX could be picked but not added. The web picker listened to both change and a window-focus fallback; a slow read could start twice and fail silently. Once a read starts the fallback never retries the same file, and unreadable files show \u201ccould not read the file\u201d.")
B.UM=new A.X("v1.4.95 beta","2026-09-05","S\xfcr\xfcm ge\xe7mi\u015fi buraya v1.4.85'ten bu yana eklenen s\xfcr\xfcmlerin hepsiyle g\xfcncellendi - her push'ta bu listenin atlanmamas\u0131 gerekti\u011fi hat\u0131rlat\u0131ld\u0131. Ayarlar > Yard\u0131m ekran\u0131 \xe7ok daha detayland\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131: otomatik duraklaman\u0131n tam e\u015fikleri, anormal GPS noktalar\u0131n\u0131 d\xfczenleme ekran\u0131, kesintiye u\u011frayan kay\u0131tlar\u0131n otomatik kurtar\u0131lmas\u0131, uydu say\u0131s\u0131 g\xf6stergesi, konum izinleri/pil optimizasyonu, \xe7oklu dosya i\xe7e aktarma ve rota taslak ikonlar\u0131 gibi daha \xf6nce hi\xe7 anlat\u0131lmam\u0131\u015f \xf6zellikler art\u0131k yard\u0131m metninde yer al\u0131yor (TR/EN/DE).","Version history filled in from v1.4.85 onward \u2014 this list must be updated on every push. Settings \u2192 Help is much more detailed: auto-pause thresholds, anomaly editor, interrupted-recording recovery, satellite count, location/battery permissions, multi-file import and route sketch icons (TR/EN/DE).")
B.SX=new A.X("v1.4.94 beta","2026-09-05",'Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 d\xfczeni sadele\u015fti: referans rota se\xe7me tu\u015fu sa\u011f alttaki ikon y\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131ndan haritan\u0131n sol \xfcst\xfcne (geri tu\u015funun yan\u0131na) ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131 - hangi rotalar\u0131n g\xf6sterildi\u011fini kontrol etmek art\u0131k haritan\u0131n \xfczerinde, referans uygulamalardaki gibi. Veri \u2194 Harita ge\xe7i\u015f tu\u015flar\u0131 art\u0131k her iki ekranda da ayn\u0131 yerde: sol altta - \xf6nceden bilgi ekran\u0131nda sa\u011f \xfcstte "haritaya git", harita ekran\u0131nda ayr\u0131 olarak sa\u011f \xfcstte "veriye d\xf6n" duruyordu; \u015fimdi ikisi de simetrik tek bir konumda.',"Recording layout: the reference-route button moved from the bottom-right stack to top-left next to back. Data \u2194 Map toggles sit in the same bottom-left corner on both pages.")
B.V6=new A.X("v1.4.93 beta","2026-09-05",'GPX i\xe7e aktarmama sorununun as\u0131l k\xf6keni netle\u015fti: kullan\u0131c\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 iPhone\'da Safari \xfczerinden web sitesi olarak a\xe7\u0131yordu (native uygulama de\u011fil) - Flutter\'\u0131n web dosya se\xe7icisi uzant\u0131 listesini d\xfcz bir "accept=.gpx,.kml,.kmz" dizesine \xe7eviriyor, Safari ise GPX\'i bu \u015fekilde g\xfcvenilir e\u015fle\u015ftiremiyor (sadece KML ge\xe7iyordu - en ba\u015ftaki "gpx kabul etmiyor, kml ediyor" \u015fikayetiyle birebir uyu\u015fuyor). Web i\xe7in MediaAtlas\'\u0131n kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015f \xe7\xf6z\xfcm\xfc uyguland\u0131: dosya se\xe7ici art\u0131k elle kurulan bir HTML giri\u015fiyle a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor, her uzant\u0131 kendi MIME t\xfcr\xfcyle ve tan\u0131mlanamayan dosyalar i\xe7in bir yedek t\xfcrle e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor, resim/video t\xfcr\xfc hi\xe7 yok - b\xf6ylece Safari GPX/KML/KMZ\'yi g\xfcvenilir \u015fekilde tan\u0131yor ve "Foto\u011fraf Kitapl\u0131\u011f\u0131" men\xfcs\xfc de \xe7\u0131km\u0131yor. Android/iOS native ve masa\xfcst\xfc taraf\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fmedi.',"Safari web import: Flutter\u2019s accept=.gpx,.kml,.kmz string did not match GPX (only KML worked). Web now opens a hand-built HTML input with MIME types per extension plus a generic fallback \u2014 no image/video types, so Photo Library is not offered. Native Android/iOS/desktop unchanged.")
B.S8=new A.X("v1.4.92 beta","2026-09-05",'"T\xfcm izi g\xf6ster" tu\u015fu art\u0131k MediaAtlas\'taki kadar sa\u011flam: harita d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfclm\xfc\u015fken bile \xf6nce kuzeye s\u0131f\u0131rlay\u0131p do\u011fru \u015fekilde s\u0131\u011fd\u0131r\u0131yor (d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfclm\xfc\u015f g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcme g\xf6re s\u0131\u011fd\u0131rma yanl\u0131\u015f \xe7er\xe7eve hesaplay\u0131p rotay\u0131 ekran\u0131n sadece bir k\u0131sm\u0131nda b\u0131rakabiliyordu), ve s\u0131\u011fd\u0131rman\u0131n ger\xe7ekten uygulan\u0131p uygulanmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 haritan\u0131n ger\xe7ek son konumuna bakarak do\u011fruluyor - eskiden "reddedildi" ile "kamera zaten oradayd\u0131" ayr\u0131m\u0131 yap\u0131lamad\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan buton bazen hi\xe7bir \u015fey yapm\u0131yormu\u015f gibi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu; art\u0131k reddedilirse t\xfcm d\xfcnyaya s\u0131\u011fd\u0131rmaya d\xfc\u015f\xfcyor.',"\u201cShow whole track\u201d now resets north first when the map is rotated (fitting a rotated view framed only part of the route) and verifies the camera actually moved; if the fit is rejected it falls back to a world fit so the button never looks dead.")
B.Uq=new A.X("v1.4.91 beta","2026-09-05",'Bir \xf6nceki d\xfczeltme (v1.4.90) dosya se\xe7iciyi t\xfcm platformlarda serbest b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan iPhone\'da art\u0131k gereksiz yere "Foto\u011fraf Kitapl\u0131\u011f\u0131" / "Foto\u011fraf ya da Video \xc7ek" se\xe7enekleri de \xe7\u0131k\u0131yordu - izin verilen dosya t\xfcrleri resimleri de kapsayacak kadar geni\u015fledi\u011finde iOS bu k\u0131sayollar\u0131 ekliyor. Art\u0131k bu serbest b\u0131rakma sadece Android\'de uygulan\u0131yor; di\u011fer platformlarda eskisi gibi gpx/kml/kmz uzant\u0131lar\u0131na k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131 se\xe7im var (iOS bunu sistem MIME kayd\u0131na ihtiya\xe7 duymadan do\u011fru \xe7\xf6z\xfcyor). Ayr\u0131ca i\xe7e aktarma art\u0131k tek seferde birden fazla dosya kabul ediyor, hepsini tek seferde i\u015fleyip "X rota i\xe7e aktar\u0131ld\u0131, Y dosya atland\u0131" \u015feklinde bir \xf6zet g\xf6steriyor.',"v1.4.90\u2019s unrestricted picker made iPhone offer Photo Library / Take Photo. That loosening is Android-only; other platforms stay filtered to gpx/kml/kmz. Import now accepts several files at once and reports \u201cX routes imported, Y skipped\u201d.")
B.RW=new A.X("v1.4.90 beta","2026-09-05","GPX dosyalar\u0131 i\xe7e aktarma ekran\u0131nda dosya se\xe7icide hi\xe7 g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyor/se\xe7ilemiyordu, KML/KMZ ise sorunsuzdu. Sebep: Android'in dosya se\xe7icisi uzant\u0131ya g\xf6re filtrelerken cihaz\u0131n MimeTypeMap'inde \xe7o\u011fu zaman \"gpx\" i\xe7in bir kay\u0131t olmuyor, sistem bu dosyalar\u0131 listeden tamamen gizliyordu. Art\u0131k se\xe7im serbest b\u0131rak\u0131l\u0131p uzant\u0131 kontrol\xfc uygulama taraf\u0131nda yap\u0131l\u0131yor; desteklenmeyen bir dosya se\xe7ilirse kullan\u0131c\u0131 dostu bir uyar\u0131 g\xf6steriliyor.","GPX files were invisible in the Android picker (MimeTypeMap often has no \u201cgpx\u201d entry) while KML/KMZ worked. The picker is unrestricted and the app checks the extension, with a friendly warning for unsupported files.")
B.U5=new A.X("v1.4.89 beta","2026-09-05",'Durma sonras\u0131 otomatik duraklama art\u0131k tek bir hatal\u0131 GPS \xf6l\xe7\xfcm\xfcyle (elde tutarken/multipath y\xfcz\xfcnden 1-2 km\'lik anl\u0131k s\u0131\xe7rama) bozulmuyor - b\xf6yle bir s\u0131\xe7rama art\u0131k g\xf6z ard\u0131 ediliyor. G\xfcncelleme kurulunca Android y\xfckleyicisi a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131ktan k\u0131sa s\xfcre sonra eski uygulama s\xfcreci kendini kapat\u0131yor, eskisine geri d\xf6n\xfclm\xfcyor. Uzun kay\u0131tlarda (binlerce nokta) her "tam tarama" GPS-s\u0131\xe7rama kontrol\xfc kayd\u0131n ba\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren t\xfcm noktalar\u0131 tarad\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan kay\u0131t uzad\u0131k\xe7a harita giderek a\u011f\u0131rla\u015f\u0131p kilitleniyordu - tarama art\u0131k en fazla son 3000 noktayla s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131. \u0130zler listesinde art\u0131k her sat\u0131r\u0131n ba\u015f\u0131nda o rotan\u0131n k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir taslak \xe7izimi var (rota \u015fekli \xf6nceden hesaplan\u0131p saklan\u0131yor, listenin a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f h\u0131z\u0131 etkilenmiyor), se\xe7im kutucuklar\u0131 da ba\u015ftan g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr - ayr\u0131 bir "se\xe7im moduna" girmeye gerek yok. Renk temas\u0131 pembe-turuncu yerine mavi-beyaz a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 hale getirildi (k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 "seed" renk Material 3\'te pembemsi tonlar t\xfcretiyordu).',"Auto-pause no longer lifts on a single bad GPS jump (1\u20132 km while holding the phone). After an update the old process exits once the Android installer opens. Long recordings no longer full-scan every GPS-jump check from the start \u2014 only the last 3000 points. Route list rows show a precomputed sketch and always-visible checkboxes. Theme shifted from pink-orange toward blue-white.")
B.RX=new A.X("v1.4.88 beta","2026-09-05","Uygulama ikonu bir kez daha sadele\u015fti: ayn\u0131 kompozisyon, kal\u0131n krem renkli siluetler ve koyu lacivert da\u011flarla \xe7ok daha yal\u0131n/piktogram tarz\u0131 bir g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm - V2'den daha y\xfcksek kontrast. Arka plan rengi yine yeni g\xf6ky\xfcz\xfc tonuna g\xf6re g\xfcncellendi.","App icon simplified again: same composition, thicker cream silhouettes and dark navy mountains, higher contrast than V2. Background color matches the new sky.")
B.SR=new A.X("v1.4.87 beta","2026-09-05","Uygulama ikonu daha yal\u0131n, y\xfcksek kontrastl\u0131 bir versiyona ge\xe7ti: ayn\u0131 kompozisyon (arkadan motorcu, k\u0131vr\u0131lan yol, g\xfcn bat\u0131m\u0131, hedef pini) ama k\xfc\xe7\xfck boyutlarda (48px ve alt\u0131) daha net g\xf6r\xfcnen kal\u0131n \xe7izgili, krem r\xf6tu\u015flu bir stil - \xf6nceki yumu\u015fak/gradyanl\u0131 versiyon k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcl\xfcnce motorcu koyu bir lekeye d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcyordu. Arka plan rengi yeni g\xf6ky\xfcz\xfc tonuna g\xf6re g\xfcncellendi.","App icon moved to a high-contrast, thick-line cream style that stays readable at 48 px and below \u2014 the previous soft/gradient rider collapsed into a dark blob. Background updated to the new sky.")
B.T1=new A.X("v1.4.86 beta","2026-09-05","Uygulama ikonu de\u011fi\u015fti: g\xfcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda arkadan g\xf6r\xfcnen bir motorcu, k\u0131vr\u0131lan da\u011f yolu ve yolun ilerisinde k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 bir hedef pini. T\xfcm platformlar (Android, iOS, macOS, web, Windows) i\xe7in ikon dosyalar\u0131 yeniden \xfcretildi; Android'in adaptif ikonundaki eski logo i\xe7in ayarlanm\u0131\u015f %16 bo\u015fluk kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (tam kadraj sahne art\u0131k kenara kadar dolduruyor); arka plan rengi yeni ikonun g\xf6ky\xfcz\xfc tonuna g\xf6re g\xfcncellendi.","New app icon: rider from behind at sunset, winding mountain road, red destination pin. Icons regenerated for Android, iOS, macOS, web, Windows; Android adaptive safe-zone padding removed so the scene fills the frame.")
B.RT=new A.X("v1.4.85 beta","2026-09-04",'\u0130z \xe7izgileri virajl\u0131 da\u011f yollar\u0131nda k\xf6\u015feleri kesip d\xfcz bir \xe7izgiye d\xf6n\xfc\u015ft\xfcr\xfcyordu - harita basitle\u015ftirme tolerans\u0131 1.5\'ten 0.4\'e d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcld\xfc. Ayr\u0131ca \xe7ok g\xfcnl\xfck bir turda g\xfcnl\xfck nokta b\xfct\xe7esi g\xfcn say\u0131s\u0131na b\xf6l\xfcn\xfcyordu, bu da tek bir g\xfcn\xfc 400 noktaya kadar s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p virajlar\u0131 d\xfczle\u015ftirebiliyordu - bu s\u0131n\u0131rlama kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. Rota detay\u0131 ve \xe7oklu rota ekranlar\u0131ndaki "konumum" ikonu MediaAtlas\'taki gibi do\u011fru "t\xfcm izi s\u0131\u011fd\u0131r" ikonu ve ipucu metniyle de\u011fi\u015ftirildi (zaten GPS konumuna de\u011fil rotaya s\u0131\u011fd\u0131r\u0131yordu).',"Track lines were cutting corners on winding mountain roads \u2014 map simplify tolerance 1.5 \u2192 0.4. Multi-day tours no longer split the point budget across days (that could flatten a day to ~400 points). Route detail and multi-route \u201cmy location\u201d icons are now the correct fit-whole-track icon and tooltip.")
B.Sd=new A.X("v1.4.84 beta","2026-09-02",'Android "RideAtlas ile a\xe7": so\u011fuk a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta dosya yay\u0131n ak\u0131\u015f\u0131nda dinleyici yokken d\xfc\u015f\xfcyordu \u2014 uygulama a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor, iz kaydedilmiyordu. \u015eimdi \xf6nce dinle, sonra al; import izler listesine yaz\u0131l\u0131r, harita a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Haritada \xe7izgi her zaman nokta nokta (eski\u2192yeni) b\xfcy\xfcr; b\xfcy\xfck GPX sadele\u015ftirilmi\u015f k\xf6\u015felerle animasyonlan\u0131r.',"Android \u201cOpen with RideAtlas\u201d: a cold start dropped the file because no listener was registered yet \u2014 the app opened, the track was not saved. Listen first, then receive; import writes the rides list and opens the map. The line always grows old\u2192new; large GPX files animate with simplified vertices.")
B.Ua=new A.X("v1.4.83 beta","2026-08-30","B\xfcy\xfck rota haritas\u0131 (\xf6r. 8 g\xfcnl\xfck GPX): kayd\u0131rma/pinch s\u0131ras\u0131nda on binlerce nokta her karede boyan\u0131yordu ve kilitleniyordu. Ekranda en fazla ~8000 k\xf6\u015fe \xe7izilir (analiz/kay\u0131t tam kal\u0131r); 3000+ noktada \xe7izgi animasyonu atlan\u0131r; dokununca animasyon iptal. flutter_map sadele\u015ftirme tolerans\u0131 y\xfckseltildi.","Large route maps (e.g. 8-day GPX) froze on pan/pinch because tens of thousands of points painted every frame. At most ~8000 on-screen vertices (analysis/recording stay full); 3000+ points skip line animation; a tap cancels animation. flutter_map simplify tolerance raised.")
B.SP=new A.X("v1.4.82 beta","2026-08-29","Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131 kilitlenmesi: GpsRecorder her noktada + her saniye saat tikinde t\xfcm FlutterMap (karo + t\xfcm polyline) yeniden kuruluyordu; 2\u20133 dakika sonra UI donuyordu. Art\u0131k iskele sadece idle/kay\u0131t ge\xe7i\u015finde yenilenir; karolar durur, k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \xe7izgi eklenerek b\xfcy\xfcr, s\xfcre ayr\u0131 notifier ile akar. Referans rota \xe7izimi de setState ile t\xfcm ekran\u0131 16ms'de bir y\u0131kmaz.","Recording map freeze: GpsRecorder rebuilt the whole FlutterMap (tiles + polyline) on every point and every 1 s clock tick; UI locked after 2\u20133 minutes. The scaffold now rebuilds only on idle/recording transitions; tiles stay, the red line grows, duration uses its own notifier. Reference routes no longer setState the whole screen every 16 ms.")
B.TP=new A.X("v1.4.81 beta","2026-08-29",'Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131 course-up i\u015faret d\xfczeltmesi: flutter_map d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfc heading de\u011fil -heading (Android Auto ile ayn\u0131). Gidi\u015f yukar\u0131, eski noktalar a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da (gelinen yol arkada). Ayr\u0131ca son 15 dakikay\u0131 s\u0131\u011fd\u0131ran ayr\u0131 bir \xf6zet tu\u015fu (saat ikonu); "t\xfcm iz" duruyor. Canl\u0131 takip h\xe2l\xe2 son 2\u20133 noktadan.',"Recording map course-up: flutter_map rotation is -heading (same as Android Auto). Travel is up, older points sit below (the path behind you). A separate clock-icon control fits the last 15 minutes; \u201cwhole track\u201d remains. Live follow still uses the last 2\u20133 points.")
B.TQ=new A.X("v1.4.80 beta","2026-08-29","Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131 course-up: kamera ve ara\xe7 i\u015fareti art\u0131k k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 izin ucundan (son 2\u20133 nokta, eskiden \u2192 yeniye bearing) takip eder; \xf6nceden ayr\u0131 Geolocator ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 \xe7izgiyle senkron olmay\u0131nca iz yukar\u0131 gidip a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 kay\u0131yormu\u015f gibi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu. Idle konum h\xe2l\xe2 Dart GPS; kay\u0131t ba\u015flad\u0131ktan sonra tek kaynak native iz.","Recording map course-up: camera and vehicle marker follow the red-track tip (bearing from the last 2\u20133 points). A separate Geolocator stream used to desync so the track looked like it ran up then slid down. Idle location is still Dart GPS; once recording starts the native track is the only source.")
B.TC=new A.X("v1.4.79 beta","2026-08-29",'\u0130z y\xfckleme / harita: yeni GPX a\xe7\u0131l\u0131nca rota haritas\u0131nda g\xf6sterilir. Tek iz t\xfcm pencereye s\u0131\u011facak \u015fekilde (MediaAtlas tarz\u0131) otomatik yak\u0131nla\u015f\u0131r; birden fazla se\xe7ili iz birlikte kapsan\u0131r. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda referans rota y\xfcklenince de ayn\u0131 s\u0131\u011fd\u0131rma; "t\xfcm iz" tu\u015fu canl\u0131 kay\u0131t + y\xfcklenen referanslar\u0131 birlikte \xe7er\xe7eveler. Listeden tek se\xe7im \u2192 tek rota haritas\u0131, \xe7oklu \u2192 \xe7oklu harita.',"Opening a new GPX shows it on the route map. A single track auto-fits the window (MediaAtlas-style); several selected tracks are framed together. Loading a reference route on the recording screen fits the same way; \u201cwhole track\u201d frames live recording plus references. One list pick \u2192 single-route map; several \u2192 multi-route map.")
B.RO=new A.X("v1.4.78 beta","2026-08-28",'S\xfcr\xfc\u015f listesi: s\u0131ralama kay\u0131ttaki GPS tarihine (recordedAt) g\xf6re yeniden \u2192 eskiye; indeks Hive\'da \xf6nbellekli - liste her a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta GPX dosyalar\u0131n\u0131 yeniden okumaz. Ayn\u0131 iz (nokta parmak izi) tekrar i\xe7e aktar\u0131lamaz: dosya se\xe7ince / "\u015eununla a\xe7" ile ayn\u0131 rota gelirse "zaten kay\u0131tl\u0131" uyar\u0131s\u0131 + mevcut kay\u0131t a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Eski kay\u0131tlara parmak izi bir kez arka planda yaz\u0131l\u0131r.',"Rides list sorts by GPS recordedAt newest\u2192oldest; the index is cached in Hive so opening the list does not re-read GPX files. The same track (point fingerprint) cannot be imported twice: picker / \u201cOpen with\u201d shows \u201calready saved\u201d and opens the existing ride. Older rides get a fingerprint written once in the background.")
B.UC=new A.X("v1.4.77 beta","2026-08-28",'Saat dilimi: \xe7ok g\xfcnl\xfck analiz ve g\xfcn filtreleri art\u0131k UTC yerine cihaz\u0131n yerel takvim g\xfcn\xfcne g\xf6re b\xf6l\xfcn\xfcyor (T\xfcrkiye UTC+3\'te gece yar\u0131s\u0131ndan sonraki noktalar \xf6nceki g\xfcne yaz\u0131l\u0131yordu - "d\xfcn gitmedi\u011fim kadar yol" g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc). Kay\u0131t tarihi/saati g\xf6sterimleri toLocal() ile d\xfczeldi. Android: GPX/KML/KMZ i\xe7in VIEW + SEND intent-filter eklendi - dosya y\xf6neticisinde "\u015eununla a\xe7" listesinde RideAtlas g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr; se\xe7ilince dosya i\xe7eriye al\u0131n\u0131r ve haritada a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r (payla\u015f men\xfcs\xfc de desteklenir).',"Time zone: multi-day analysis and day filters split on the device\u2019s local calendar day, not UTC (in Turkey UTC+3, post-midnight points were landing on the previous day). Displayed record dates use toLocal(). Android: VIEW + SEND intent-filters for GPX/KML/KMZ so RideAtlas appears in \u201cOpen with\u201d and the share sheet.")
B.Ur=new A.X("v1.4.76 beta","2026-08-28","Web otomatik g\xfcncelleme (KDO mimarisi): web/sw.js service worker eklendi - s\xfcr\xfcml\xfc cache (rideatlas-vX.Y.Z), install'da \xe7ekirdek shell precache, activate'te eski cache temizli\u011fi + clients.claim(), SKIP_WAITING mesaj\u0131 deste\u011fi; HTML network-first, di\u011fer varl\u0131klar cache-then-network. app_update.js SW'yi kaydeder, bekleyen yeni SW g\xf6r\xfcnce alttan sabit \"Yeni s\xfcr\xfcm haz\u0131r / G\xfcncelle\" banner'\u0131 g\xf6sterir (TR/EN/DE), G\xfcncelle \u2192 SKIP_WAITING \u2192 controllerchange'de tek seferlik reload; 60 sn'de bir ve sekme \xf6ne gelince arka planda reg.update(). S\xfcr\xfcm de\u011fi\u015fiminde localStorage kar\u015f\u0131la\u015ft\u0131rmal\u0131 tek seferlik hard-reload emniyeti. S\xfcr\xfcm + SW cache ad\u0131 + ?v= buster'lar deploy-web.yml taraf\u0131ndan build_info.dart'tan otomatik damgalan\u0131r; elle senkron gerekmez. Header'a ikon eklenmedi, yaln\u0131z alt banner; Android APK g\xfcncelleme ak\u0131\u015f\u0131na dokunulmad\u0131.","Web auto-update (KDO-style): versioned service-worker cache, core-shell precache, old-cache cleanup, SKIP_WAITING; HTML network-first, other assets cache-then-network. A waiting SW shows the bottom \u201cA new version is ready / Update\u201d banner (TR/EN/DE); Update \u2192 one reload. Background update every 60 s and on tab focus. Version, cache name and ?v= busters are stamped from build_info.dart on deploy. Bottom banner only; Android APK flow unchanged.")
B.SQ=new A.X("v1.4.75 beta","2026-08-28",'Sokak ve sade/siyasi haritada CARTO "API KEY REQUIRED" filigran\u0131 kalkt\u0131 (OSM/Esri katmanlar\u0131). Kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda GPS s\u0131\xe7rama patlamalar\u0131 canl\u0131 izden otomatik d\xfczeltilir.',"CARTO \u201cAPI KEY REQUIRED\u201d watermark removed from street and clean/political maps (OSM/Esri layers). GPS jump bursts during recording are auto-corrected on the live track.")
B.T_=new A.X("v1.4.74 beta","2026-08-28","G\xfcncelleme MedyaAtlas gibi arka planda indirilir: kilitleyen y\xfczde diyalo\u011fu yok; ana/kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki banner\u2019da % g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr, uygulama kullan\u0131labilir. APK do\u011frudan dosyaya akar (bellekte biriktirilmez).","Updates download in the background like MedyaAtlas: no blocking percent dialog; the home/recording banner shows % and the app stays usable. The APK streams to a file instead of buffering in memory.")
B.U9=new A.X("v1.4.73 beta","2026-08-28","Konum tu\u015fu canl\u0131 GPS okur; eski \xf6nbellek ve \u0130stanbul varsay\u0131lan\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 \u2014 Tampa vb. yerlerde yanl\u0131\u015f \u015fehre gitmez.","The location button reads live GPS; the old cache and Istanbul default are gone \u2014 it no longer jumps to the wrong city in Tampa and similar places.")
B.Um=new A.X("v1.4.72 beta","2026-08-27","Y\xfcr\xfcrken oto-duraklama kalkar: d\xfc\u015f\xfck h\u0131zda veya ~20 m ilerleyince kay\u0131t devam eder.","Auto-pause lifts when walking: recording resumes at low speed or after about 20 m of progress.")
B.SC=new A.X("v1.4.71 beta","2026-08-27","Kay\u0131tl\u0131 ride listesi kay\u0131t tarihine g\xf6re (en yeni \xfcstte) s\u0131ralan\u0131r.","The saved-rides list is sorted by recording date (newest first).")
B.TJ=new A.X("v1.4.70 beta","2026-08-27","Kay\u0131t s\xfcrerken ana haritadaki konum tu\u015fu kay\u0131t haritas\u0131n\u0131 canl\u0131 izle a\xe7ar; k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kay\u0131t ikonu metin/istatistik sayfas\u0131na gider. Ana haritada da ayn\u0131 k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kay\u0131t izi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr \u2014 d\u0131\u015far\u0131daki ve kay\u0131t haritas\u0131 ayn\u0131 yerde kal\u0131r.","While recording, the home map\u2019s location button opens the recording map on the live track; the red REC icon goes to the stats page. The same red recording track is drawn on the home map so both maps stay aligned.")
B.Ti=new A.X("v1.4.69 beta","2026-08-27","\u0130lk a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta (ve stil de\u011fi\u015fiminde) harita bazen bo\u015f kal\u0131yordu \u2014 flutter_map ilk kamera hareketini tile iste\u011fine \xe7evirmiyordu. K\xfc\xe7\xfck bir tile \u201ckick\u201d eklendi; zoom\u2019a basmadan harita boyan\u0131r.","On first open (and after a style change) the map could stay blank \u2014 flutter_map did not turn the first camera move into a tile request. A small tile \u201ckick\u201d paints the map without tapping zoom.")
B.Si=new A.X("v1.4.68 beta","2026-08-27",'Haritadaki ara\xe7/konum ("ride") ikonu k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcld\xfc ama beyaz kenar + g\xf6lge/glow ile daha vurgulu hale getirildi; uydu haritada ne devasa g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor ne de arkada kayboluyor.',"The map vehicle/location (\u201cride\u201d) icon is smaller but stronger with a white edge and glow, so it neither dominates satellite nor disappears.")
B.TG=new A.X("v1.4.67 beta","2026-08-27","Y\xfcklenen / a\xe7\u0131lan bir rotada k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 iz ad\u0131m ad\u0131m \xe7izildikten sonra kaybolma sorunu d\xfczeltildi. Sebep: ge\xe7ici k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \xe7izgi, g\xfcn renklerine ge\xe7erken zaman damgas\u0131 olmayan noktalar\u0131 (veya e\u015fle\u015fmeyen g\xfcn filtresini) d\xfc\u015f\xfcrebiliyordu; art\u0131k tam iz korunuyor.","A loaded route\u2019s red track no longer vanished after the step-by-step draw. The temporary red line could drop untimestamped points (or a mismatched day filter) when switching to day colors; the full track is kept.")
B.UP=new A.X("v1.4.66 beta","2026-08-27",'Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131nda "konumuma d\xf6n" art\u0131k her zaman cihaz GPS konumuna sabit yak\u0131n zoom ile gider (kay\u0131t ederken / etmezken ayn\u0131; \xf6nceden takip a\xe7\u0131kken hi\xe7 tepki vermiyor veya ara zoom / tween kal\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131na z\u0131playabiliyordu). T\xfcm kayd\u0131 g\xf6stermek i\xe7in zoom-out ikonu ayr\u0131 duruyor.',"On the recording map, \u201cback to my location\u201d always goes to device GPS at a fixed close zoom (recording or idle). The zoom-out icon remains for showing the whole recording.")
B.UT=new A.X("v1.4.65 beta","2026-08-27",'Android/web derlemesi d\xfczeltildi (kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda eksik gpx_parser import). \xdcstteki "N rota" ile listeden yeniden se\xe7im (1.4.64) bu s\xfcr\xfcmle telefona iner.',"Android/web build fixed (missing gpx_parser import on the recording screen). Re-picking from the top \u201cN routes\u201d chip (1.4.64) now ships to the phone.")
B.UY=new A.X("v1.4.64 beta","2026-08-27",'\xc7oklu rota haritas\u0131nda \xfcstteki "N rota" ba\u015fl\u0131\u011f\u0131na bas\u0131nca t\xfcm kay\u0131tlar\u0131n listesi a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor; Hepsi / tek tek se\xe7ip G\xf6ster ile haritay\u0131 yeniden y\xfckleyebiliyorsunuz (yine kademeli \xe7izim).',"On the multi-route map, tapping the top \u201cN routes\u201d title opens the full list; All / pick-then-Show reloads the map (still drawn progressively).")
B.T2=new A.X("v1.4.63 beta","2026-08-27",'Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131ndaki rota se\xe7im diyalo\u011fu: "Kaydet" \u2192 "G\xf6ster", "Hepsi" kutusu ile tek dokunu\u015fta hepsini se\xe7/kald\u0131r, "Temizle" kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. \xc7oklu "Haritada g\xf6ster" art\u0131k \xf6nce haritay\u0131 a\xe7\u0131p her rotay\u0131 arka planda parse ederek ad\u0131m ad\u0131m \xe7iziyor (\xf6nceden hepsi bitene kadar kilitleniyordu / "cevap vermiyor").',"Recording-map route picker: \u201cSave\u201d \u2192 \u201cShow\u201d, All checkbox to select/clear everything, Clear removed. Multi \u201cShow on map\u201d opens the map first and parses each route in the background so the UI no longer freezes until everything is ready.")
B.TF=new A.X("v1.4.62 beta","2026-08-26",'Android g\xfcncelleme banner\'\u0131 art\u0131k sadece ana haritada de\u011fil; kay\u0131t haritas\u0131 ve veri/istatistik ekran\u0131nda da "G\xfcncelle" ile g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor. \u0130ndirme y\xfczdesi d\xfczeltildi: GitHub CDN \xe7o\u011fu zaman Content-Length g\xf6ndermiyordu (y\xfczde "\u2026" kal\u0131yordu); art\u0131k Releases API\'deki APK boyutu kullan\u0131l\u0131yor ("%26 \u2014 RideAtlas.apk").',"The Android update banner is no longer home-only; it also appears on the recording map and data/stats screen. Download percent fixed: GitHub\u2019s CDN often omits Content-Length; the Releases API APK size is used (\u201c26% \u2014 RideAtlas.apk\u201d).")
B.SA=new A.X("v1.4.61 beta","2026-08-26","Android APK derlemesi d\xfczeltildi: v1.4.58'deki foto konum d\xfczeltmesi photo_manager ile latlong2 LatLng isim \xe7ak\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 y\xfcz\xfcnden CI'da k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131yordu; android-latest s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc 1.4.56'da kalm\u0131\u015ft\u0131. Bu y\xfczden telefonda 60 g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyordu. Derleme onar\u0131ld\u0131; \xf6nceki s\xfcr\xfcmlerin (ayarlar, GPX animasyonu, tek G\xfcncelle + y\xfczde indirme) \xf6zellikleri bu APK'da.","Android APK build fixed: v1.4.58\u2019s photo-location change collided photo_manager with latlong2 LatLng and broke CI, leaving android-latest on 1.4.56. Build repaired; settings, GPX animation, and one-button Update + percent download are in this APK.")
B.SH=new A.X("v1.4.60 beta","2026-08-26",'Android g\xfcncelleme ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 sadele\u015ftirildi (MedyaAtlas tarz\u0131): tek "G\xfcncelle" d\xfc\u011fmesi; sonras\u0131nda indirme y\xfczdesi ("\u066a26 \u2014 RideAtlas.apk") g\xf6sterilip kurulum otomatik a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor. A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta da ayn\u0131 tek-d\xfc\u011fmeli teklif var; banner\'da kapat/iptal karma\u015fas\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.',"Android update flow simplified (MedyaAtlas-style): one Update button, then download percent (\u201c26% \u2014 RideAtlas.apk\u201d) and the installer opens. Launch uses the same one-button offer; banner dismiss/cancel clutter is gone.")
B.Us=new A.X("v1.4.59 beta","2026-08-26",'GPX/KML a\xe7\u0131l\u0131nca (\xf6zellikle \xe7ok noktal\u0131 dosyalarda) harita art\u0131k hemen geliyor: \xf6nce rota s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131na s\u0131\u011fd\u0131r\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bo\u015f harita, sonra konumlar okunduk\xe7a iz ad\u0131m ad\u0131m animasyonla \xe7iziliyor. Parse ve GPS-glitch filtresi arka planda (UI kilitlemeden) \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor; i\xe7e aktarma da ayn\u0131 \u015fekilde donmuyordu. \xd6nceden uzun dosyada t\xfcm noktalar i\u015flenene kadar spinner\'da kal\u0131n\u0131yor, "a\xe7\u0131lm\u0131yor" gibi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu.',"Opening GPX/KML (especially large files) shows the map immediately: an empty map fitted to bounds, then the track animates as points arrive. Parse and the GPS-glitch filter run off the UI isolate so import no longer freezes on a spinner.")
B.UD=new A.X("v1.4.58 beta","2026-08-26",'Ana haritada Ayarlar d\xfc\u011fmesi art\u0131k liste d\xfc\u011fmesiyle ayn\u0131 yuvarlak g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcmde (uydu haritas\u0131nda kaybolmuyordu). Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131na da Ayarlar eklendi. Kay\u0131t haritas\u0131nda iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131 "kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota g\xf6ster" tu\u015fu: bir veya birden fazla GPX/kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota se\xe7ilince canl\u0131 iz alt\u0131nda \xe7iziliyor; istemezseniz hi\xe7 se\xe7ilmez. Ayr\u0131ca kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xe7ekilen foto/videolar\u0131n konumu Android\'de art\u0131k otomatik bulunuyor: galeri GPS \u2192 EXIF \u2192 kay\u0131t an\u0131ndaki GPS izi (\xf6nceden MediaStore konumu bo\u015f gelince hep elle i\u015faretletiyordu).',"Home Settings matches the list button\u2019s round look (it used to vanish on satellite). Settings also on the recording screen. Optional \u201cshow saved routes\u201d on the recording map draws selected GPX under the live track. Photos/videos taken while recording get a location automatically on Android: gallery GPS \u2192 EXIF \u2192 the recording track.")
B.T8=new A.X("v1.4.56 beta","2026-08-26","Y\xfcklenen / a\xe7\u0131lan bir rotada haritay\u0131 sa\u011fa-sola kayd\u0131r\u0131rken veya k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcp b\xfcy\xfct\xfcrken uygulaman\u0131n kilitlenmesi d\xfczeltildi. Sebep: parmak hareketlerindeki minik harita d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfc her karede t\xfcm ekran\u0131 yeniden kuruyor, uzun izlerde mola tespiti ve g\xfcn b\xf6lme hesab\u0131 tekrar tekrar \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yordu. Art\u0131k bu hesaplar rota y\xfcklenince bir kez yap\u0131l\u0131yor; pusula d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfc de haritay\u0131 yeniden \xe7izmeden g\xfcncelleniyor.","Panning or pinching a loaded route no longer freezes the app. Tiny map rotations were rebuilding the whole screen every frame and re-running stop detection / day splits. Those run once on load; compass rotation updates without a full redraw.")
B.Tp=new A.X("v1.4.55 beta","2026-08-25",'Kay\u0131t kontrolleri yeniden d\xfczenlendi: kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda tek tu\u015f (Duraklat); duraklat\u0131nca Devam / Kaydet / S\u0131f\u0131rla. Kaydet oturumu bitirmez - kay\u0131t sonras\u0131 "devam et veya s\u0131f\u0131rla" se\xe7ilir; kaydedilmi\u015fse s\u0131f\u0131rlama uyar\u0131s\u0131z, kaydedilmemi\u015f veri varsa onay sorulur. Harita sayfas\u0131na "t\xfcm kayd\u0131 g\xf6ster" tu\u015fu eklendi (kuzey yukar\u0131, t\xfcm rota ekrana s\u0131\u011far); konum tu\u015fu o anki pozisyona ve course-up takibe d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcr. Haritan\u0131n "yukar\u0131 gidip a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 akma" titremesi \xe7\xf6z\xfcld\xfc: ara\xe7 i\u015fareti art\u0131k kamerayla ayn\u0131 animasyonda ilerliyor (fix gelince \xf6ne z\u0131play\u0131p geri akm\u0131yor) ve her fixte birikip CPU yakan eski animasyon dinleyicileri temizleniyor. Ayr\u0131ca idle haritada konuma ortalama/takip onar\u0131ld\u0131.',"Recording controls: one Pause button while recording; when paused, Resume / Save / Reset. Save does not end the session \u2014 afterwards choose resume or reset (silent if just saved, confirm if unsaved). \u201cShow whole recording\u201d on the map page (north-up, fit); location returns to the current position and course-up follow. Vehicle marker moves with the same camera animation so it no longer jumps ahead and slides back. Idle-map location average/follow repaired.")
B.RP=new A.X("v1.4.54 beta","2026-08-23",'Kay\u0131t devam\u0131 tamamland\u0131: sadece "kay\u0131t/pause" bayra\u011f\u0131 de\u011fil, ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7 saati, tamamlanm\u0131\u015f molalar ve s\xfcren duraklatma an\u0131 da diskte saklan\u0131yor. Yeniden a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta mesafe (t\xfcm GPS noktalar\u0131ndan), son konum, aktif/duraklat\u0131lm\u0131\u015f mod ve s\xfcreler kald\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerden geliyor. Kay\u0131t yokken (idle) dosya yaz\u0131lmaz - a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta kay\u0131t ba\u015flamaz. v1.4.53\'teki 2 sn GPS ve course-up d\xfczeltmeleri duruyor.',"Recording resume is complete: not only the recording/pause flag \u2014 start time, finished rests, and the in-progress pause instant are stored. On reopen, distance (from all GPS points), last location, active/paused mode and timers come back. Idle writes nothing \u2014 launch does not start recording. v1.4.53\u2019s 2 s GPS and course-up fixes remain.")
B.Uu=new A.X("v1.4.53 beta","2026-08-23",'Kay\u0131t stabilitesi: (1) Uygulama kilitlenince / yanl\u0131\u015fl\u0131kla kapan\u0131nca / OEM \xf6ld\xfcr\xfcnce kay\u0131t oturumu diskte saklan\u0131yor; tekrar a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta Motion GPX gibi kald\u0131\u011f\u0131 yerden devam ediyor (kay\u0131ttaysa kay\u0131t, duraklat\u0131lm\u0131\u015fsa duraklat\u0131lm\u0131\u015f; idle ise idle). Eski "a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta yetim noktalar\u0131 sil" davran\u0131\u015f\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131. (2) Aktif GPS aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 1 sn \u2192 2 sn; harita konum ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 ve native poll de uyumland\u0131 - saniyelik \xe7ift GPS y\xfck\xfc telefonu yoruyordu. (3) Kay\u0131t bilgi sayfas\u0131ndayken harita Offstage ile ba\u011fl\u0131 kal\u0131yor; haritaya ge\xe7ince course-up (y\xf6n yukar\u0131) yeniden etkin - \xf6nceki MapController kopmas\u0131 giderildi.',"Recording stability: (1) If the app is killed, the session is on disk and resumes where it left off (recording, paused, or idle). The old \u201cdelete orphan points on launch\u201d behavior is gone. (2) Active GPS interval 1 s \u2192 2 s; map stream and native poll match. (3) The map stays attached via Offstage on the info page so course-up works again when you return \u2014 the previous MapController detach is gone.")
B.Ta=new A.X("v1.4.52 beta","2026-08-22","Kay\u0131t rak\u0131m\u0131 d\xfczeltildi. Android GPS Location.altitude WGS84 elipsoid y\xfcksekli\u011fi verir; bir\xe7ok uygulama deniz seviyesi (MSL / ortometrik) g\xf6sterir - fark geoid und\xfclasyonu y\xfcz\xfcnden b\xf6lgeye g\xf6re genelde 20\u201340 m. Kullan\u0131c\u0131 ba\u015fka programda ~5 m g\xf6r\xfcrken RideAtlas'ta \u221229 m (yakla\u015f\u0131k 25 m d\xfc\u015f\xfck) bildirdi. RecordingLocationService art\u0131k AltitudeConverterCompat ile her fixi MSL'e \xe7eviriyor; d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcm ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z olursa eski elipsoid de\u011ferine d\xfc\u015f\xfcl\xfcyor. Canl\u0131 y\xfckseklik, min/maks irtifa, t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f ve kaydedilen GPX ayn\u0131 d\xfczeltilmi\u015f rak\u0131m\u0131 kullan\u0131r.","Recording altitude fixed. Android Location.altitude is WGS84 ellipsoid; many apps show MSL / orthometric \u2014 typically 20\u201340 m of geoid undulation. A rider saw ~5 m elsewhere and \u221229 m here. RecordingLocationService now converts each fix with AltitudeConverterCompat (falls back to ellipsoid). Live altitude, min/max, climb/descent and saved GPX use the corrected height.")
B.Ss=new A.X("v1.4.51 beta","2026-08-15",'Kullan\u0131c\u0131 "kay\u0131t yaparken s\u0131k s\u0131k kendi kendine kapan\u0131yor" diye bildirdi (\xf6zellikle uzun s\xfcr\xfc\u015flerde, tam da o g\xfcn \xfczerinde \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z 10+ saatlik/36.628 noktal\u0131k \xf6rnek gibi). Kod incelemesinde k\xf6k sebep bulundu: GpsRecorder.distanceKm getter\'\u0131 her okundu\u011funda T\xdcM nokta listesini ba\u015ftan toplayarak mesafeyi yeniden hesapl\u0131yordu, ve kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 bu de\u011feri her GPS g\xfcncellemesinde (saniyede bir) okuyordu - kay\u0131t uzad\u0131k\xe7a bu i\u015f katlanarak a\u011f\u0131rla\u015f\u0131yordu (klasik O(n\xb2) davran\u0131\u015f): birka\xe7 saat sonra saniyede binlerce mesafe hesab\u0131na \xe7\u0131k\u0131p ekran\u0131 dondurabiliyor, bu da uygulaman\u0131n "kapanmas\u0131" gibi alg\u0131lanan bir duruma yol a\xe7abiliyordu. Ayn\u0131 sorun points getter\'\u0131nda da vard\u0131 (her okumada t\xfcm liste kopyalan\u0131yordu). \u0130kisi de art\u0131k O(1): mesafe her yeni nokta geldi\u011finde tek seferlik eklenerek tutuluyor, points ise kopyalamak yerine canl\u0131 bir g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcyor. Kay\u0131t s\xfcresi ne kadar uzarsa uzas\u0131n her g\xfcncelleme art\u0131k sabit h\u0131zda kal\u0131yor.',"Long recordings could \u201cclose themselves\u201d. GpsRecorder.distanceKm recomputed the whole point list on every read, and the recording screen read it on every GPS update \u2014 O(n\xb2) that froze the UI after hours. The points getter copied the list every time too. Both are O(1): distance is accumulated, points returns a live view.")
B.Tj=new A.X("v1.4.50 beta","2026-08-15","Android'de v1.4.49'un a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta bembeyaz ekranda kalma regresyonu d\xfczeltildi. K\xf6k sebep: karo iste\u011fine User-Agent koymak i\xe7in olu\u015fturulan const header map'i, flutter_map TileLayer'\u0131n Android'de \xe7a\u011f\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131 headers.putIfAbsent ile uyumsuzdu (unmodifiable map \u2192 UnsupportedError \u2192 release'te bo\u015f beyaz ekran). Header map art\u0131k de\u011fi\u015ftirilebilir; Topo yine resmi OpenTopoMap.","v1.4.49\u2019s launch white-screen regression on Android: a const User-Agent header map was unmodifiable and TileLayer\u2019s headers.putIfAbsent threw UnsupportedError (blank release screen). The header map is mutable; Topo stays official OpenTopoMap.")
B.RK=new A.X("v1.4.49 beta","2026-08-15",'Topo katman\u0131ndaki openmaps.fr "Limited Access" uyar\u0131s\u0131 giderildi. Sunucu, be\u011fenmedi\u011fi User-Agent isteklerine ger\xe7ek harita yerine politika uyar\u0131 g\xf6rseli d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcyordu. Topo yeniden resmi OpenTopoMap (tile.opentopomap.org) kayna\u011f\u0131na al\u0131nd\u0131; karo istekleri RideAtlas (com.rideatlas.app) User-Agent ile gidiyor. v1.4.48\'deki tam-katman s\u0131f\u0131rlamama d\xfczeltmesi duruyor.',"Topo \u201cLimited Access\u201d from openmaps.fr is gone. The server returned a policy image for User-Agents it disliked. Topo is back on official OpenTopoMap (tile.opentopomap.org) with a RideAtlas (com.rideatlas.app) User-Agent. v1.4.48\u2019s no-full-layer-reset fix remains.")
B.TL=new A.X("v1.4.48 beta","2026-08-15",'Topo/harita "kare kare yan\u0131p s\xf6nme" d\xfczeltildi. K\xf6k sebep: bir karo y\xfcklenemeyince (OpenTopoMap h\u0131z limiti) t\xfcm TileLayer\'\u0131n s\u0131f\u0131rlanmas\u0131 - her 2 saniyede bir b\xfct\xfcn harita yeniden \xe7ekiliyor, ba\u015far\u0131l\u0131/ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z karolar kar\u0131\u015f\u0131k g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu. Bu tam-katman retry kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131; yaln\u0131zca budanan hatal\u0131 karolar yeniden deneniyor. Stil de\u011fi\u015fince ValueKey ile \xf6nbellek temizleniyor. Renkli topo, OTM uyumlu openmaps.fr sunucusuna ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131 (maxNativeZoom 17).',"Topo/map \u201cflashing tiles\u201d fixed. A failed tile (OpenTopoMap rate limit) used to reset the whole TileLayer every 2 s. Only pruned bad tiles are retried. Style changes clear the cache via ValueKey. Color topo moved to an OTM-compatible openmaps.fr host (maxNativeZoom 17).")
B.SM=new A.X("v1.4.47 beta","2026-08-15","Topo katman\u0131 Esri World_Topo_Map'ten OpenTopoMap'e al\u0131nd\u0131: y\xfckseklik renkleri (ye\u015fil \u2192 sar\u0131 \u2192 kahverengi) ve konturlar yeniden belirgin. Soluk \"sokak-topo\" g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc yerine renkli outdoor stil. Tile sunucusu bazen h\u0131z limiti koyarsa mevcut otomatik yeniden deneme gri kareleri dolduruyor.","Topo layer moved from Esri World_Topo_Map to OpenTopoMap: elevation colors (green \u2192 yellow \u2192 brown) and contours are visible again. Outdoor style instead of a pale street-topo. Automatic retry still fills grey tiles if the host rate-limits.")
B.TD=new A.X("v1.4.46 beta","2026-08-15","Uygulama ikonu yenilendi: k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 pin + harita \u0131zgaras\u0131 korunarak k\u0131vr\u0131lan yolun alt\u0131na motosiklet sil\xfceti eklendi. Harita t\xfcr\xfc se\xe7icide s\u0131ra Sokak / Uydu / Topo / Koyu / Sade olacak \u015fekilde d\xfczenlendi (etiket: Topo). Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki canl\u0131 haritaya da katman d\xfc\u011fmesi eklendi - tercih di\u011fer harita ekranlar\u0131yla ortak saklan\u0131yor. Android/iOS/web/masa\xfcst\xfc launcher ikonlar\u0131 yeni kaynaktan yeniden \xfcretildi.","App icon refreshed: red pin + map grid kept, motorcycle silhouette added under the winding road. Map-type picker order is Street / Satellite / Topo / Dark / Clean (label: Topo). The live recording map also has a layer button \u2014 preference is shared. Launcher icons regenerated for Android/iOS/web/desktop.")
B.TU=new A.X("v1.4.45 beta","2026-08-14",'Kullan\u0131c\u0131, v1.4.44\'teki s\u0131\xe7rama filtresinin haritadaki b\xfcy\xfck z\u0131plamay\u0131 yine de temizlemedi\u011fini g\xf6sterdi ve ger\xe7ek rota dosyas\u0131n\u0131 payla\u015ft\u0131. Dosyay\u0131 inceleyince k\xf6k sebep netle\u015fti: s\u0131\xe7rama tek bir "anl\u0131k imkans\u0131z" h\u0131z de\u011fil, cihaz dururken GPS\'in yakla\u015f\u0131k bir dakika boyunca ~1.7km uzakta donup kal\u0131p sonra ger\xe7ek konuma geri d\xf6nmesiydi - her tek ad\u0131m kendi ba\u015f\u0131na "sadece h\u0131zl\u0131" (~140 km/s) g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu, mevcut mutlak h\u0131z e\u015fi\u011fini (300 km/s) ge\xe7miyordu. gpx_parser.dart\'a yeni bir findExcursionPointIndices dedekt\xf6r\xfc eklendi: rota aniden uza\u011fa s\u0131\xe7ray\u0131p birka\xe7 \xf6l\xe7\xfcm i\xe7inde neredeyse ayn\u0131 noktaya geri d\xf6n\xfcyorsa (ger\xe7ek bir s\xfcr\xfc\u015f\xfcn asla yapmayaca\u011f\u0131 bir \u015fey), aradaki noktalar GPS aksakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 say\u0131l\u0131p otomatik filtreye ve "Anormal noktalar\u0131 d\xfczenle" ekran\u0131na dahil ediliyor. Kullan\u0131c\u0131n\u0131n payla\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131 36.628 noktal\u0131k ger\xe7ek dosya \xfczerinde do\u011fruland\u0131: algoritma tam olarak bozuk 11 noktay\u0131 buluyor, ba\u015fka hi\xe7bir ger\xe7ek s\xfcr\xfc\u015f/duraklama an\u0131n\u0131 yanl\u0131\u015fl\u0131kla i\u015faretlemiyor.',"The v1.4.44 jump filter still left a big spike on a real 36,628-point file. The glitch was not one impossible speed: GPS froze ~1.7 km away for about a minute then snapped back, each step only ~140 km/h (under the 300 km/h cap). New findExcursionPointIndices: if the route leaps away and returns to nearly the same point within a few fixes, those points are treated as a GPS fault and appear in the anomaly editor. On that file it flags exactly the 11 bad points and no real riding/stops.")
B.RE=new A.X("v1.4.44 beta","2026-08-14",'Kullan\u0131c\u0131, kay\u0131tl\u0131 bir rotan\u0131n "Ortalama h\u0131z"\u0131n\u0131n ba\u015fka bir GPX program\u0131ndakiyle uyu\u015fmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bildirdi. \u0130nceleme RideAtlas\'\u0131n kendi i\xe7inde de bir tutars\u0131zl\u0131k ortaya \xe7\u0131kard\u0131: \xd6zet sekmesindeki "Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi" molalar\u0131 >=10dk e\u015fi\u011fiyle hesaplarken, hemen yan\u0131ndaki "Ortalama h\u0131z" 1km/s alt\u0131ndaki her segmenti ayr\u0131ca tamamen hesap d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rakan farkl\u0131 bir y\xf6ntem kullan\u0131yordu - iki rakam Mesafe/S\xfcre ile \xe7arp\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda birbirini tutmuyordu. Art\u0131k "Ortalama h\u0131z" da "Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi" ile ayn\u0131 s\xfcreyi kullan\u0131yor. Ayn\u0131 bildirimde, tek bir k\xf6t\xfc GPS noktas\u0131ndan kaynaklanan haritadaki "s\u0131\xe7rama" da g\xfcndeme geldi - iki par\xe7al\u0131 \xe7\xf6z\xfcm eklendi: (1) b\xf6yle noktalar art\u0131k harita ve istatistik hesaplar\u0131nda otomatik olarak yok say\u0131l\u0131yor (dosya de\u011fi\u015fmiyor), (2) "Rotalar" listesindeki \u22ee men\xfcs\xfcne "Anormal noktalar\u0131 d\xfczenle" eklendi - tespit edilen noktalar\u0131 g\xf6r\xfcp istediklerinizi kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak rotadan silebilirsiniz.',"Average speed disagreed with another GPX app \u2014 and with RideAtlas itself: Overview \u201cActive riding time\u201d used \u226510 min rests while Average speed dropped every <1 km/h segment. Average speed now uses the same duration as active riding. Single bad GPS jumps are ignored on the map and in stats (file unchanged), and Routes \u22ee has \u201cEdit anomalous points\u201d to delete flagged points permanently.")
B.SY=new A.X("v1.4.43 beta","2026-08-14","v1.4.42'deki d\xfczeltme (duraklamada d\xfc\u015f\xfck hassasiyetli konuma ge\xe7meyi engellemek) yeterli de\u011filmi\u015f - kullan\u0131c\u0131 ger\xe7ek bir s\xfcr\xfc\u015fte ekran g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcs\xfcyle yine \"Otomatik duraklat\u0131ld\u0131\"n\u0131n hi\xe7 kapanmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, sadece elle duraklat/devam ettirince \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterdi. Kod i\xe7inde as\u0131l sebep bulundu: RecordingLocationService.kt'deki konum callback'i duraklama s\u0131ras\u0131nda gelen HER fix'i \"if (isPaused) return\" ile en ba\u015ftan yok say\u0131yordu - GPS'in kendisi d\xfczelse bile hi\xe7bir konum Flutter taraf\u0131na ula\u015fm\u0131yordu, o y\xfczden h\u0131z\u0131 kontrol edip duraklamay\u0131 kald\u0131ran mant\u0131k hi\xe7 \xe7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lam\u0131yordu. Elle duraklat/devam ettir \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yordu \xe7\xfcnk\xfc o buton konum beklemeden direkt durumu de\u011fi\u015ftiriyor. D\xfczeltildi: duraklama s\u0131ras\u0131nda da her konum art\u0131k Flutter'a iletiliyor (h\u0131z kontrol\xfc i\xe7in) - sadece kay\u0131tl\u0131 rotaya eklenmiyor, o davran\u0131\u015f de\u011fi\u015fmedi.","v1.4.42 (stay on high-accuracy GPS while paused) was not enough \u2014 auto-pause never cleared unless Pause/Resume was tapped. RecordingLocationService dropped every paused fix (`if (isPaused) return`), so Flutter never saw speed to lift the pause. Manual buttons worked because they change state without a fix. Paused locations are now forwarded for speed checks but still not appended to the saved track.")
B.TW=new A.X("v1.4.42 beta","2026-08-14","v1.4.38/v1.4.41'deki pil tasarrufu de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011finde daha ciddi bir hata vard\u0131: kullan\u0131c\u0131 mola sonras\u0131 bazen \"Otomatik duraklat\u0131ld\u0131\" yaz\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n hi\xe7 kapanmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131, ger\xe7ekten tak\u0131l\u0131 kald\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 bildirdi (ge\xe7en s\xfcr\xfcmde ele al\u0131nan birka\xe7 saniyelik gecikmeden farkl\u0131). K\xf6k sebep: duraklama s\u0131ras\u0131nda GPS iste\u011fi d\xfc\u015f\xfck hassasiyetli (PRIORITY_BALANCED_POWER_ACCURACY) moddayd\u0131 - bu Android'in GPS \xe7ipi yerine WiFi/baz istasyonu konumlamas\u0131na ge\xe7mesine izin veriyor, ve bu kaynaklar genelde h\u0131z bilgisi vermiyor (0 d\xf6n\xfcyor). Ger\xe7ekten hareket etmeye ba\u015flasan\u0131z bile \xf6l\xe7\xfclen h\u0131z s\u0131f\u0131ra yak\u0131n kal\u0131p 6km/s e\u015fi\u011fini hi\xe7 ge\xe7emiyor, duraklama asla kapanm\u0131yordu. Duraklama s\u0131ras\u0131nda GPS \xe7ipi devrede kalacak \u015fekilde (PRIORITY_HIGH_ACCURACY, sadece yenileme aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 seyrek) d\xfczeltildi - pil tasarrufu yenileme aral\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan geliyor zaten, art\u0131k ger\xe7ek h\u0131z her zaman \xf6l\xe7\xfcl\xfcyor.","A worse side-effect of the v1.4.38/41 battery change: \u201cAuto-paused\u201d could stick forever. While paused, GPS used PRIORITY_BALANCED_POWER_ACCURACY (Wi\u2011Fi/cell), which often reports 0 speed so the 6 km/h resume threshold never tripped. Pause now keeps PRIORITY_HIGH_ACCURACY and only lengthens the interval \u2014 real speed is always measured.")
B.RF=new A.X("v1.4.41 beta","2026-08-14","v1.4.38'deki pil tasarrufu de\u011fi\u015fikli\u011finin yan etkisi d\xfczeltildi: duraklama s\u0131ras\u0131nda GPS 8 saniyede bire kadar yava\u015fl\u0131yordu, bu da tekrar harekete ge\xe7ti\u011finizde \"Otomatik duraklat\u0131ld\u0131\" yaz\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n 8 saniyeye kadar ekranda as\u0131l\u0131 kalmas\u0131na neden oluyordu - kullan\u0131c\u0131 bir ekran g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcs\xfcyle bunu yakalad\u0131. Duraklamadaki GPS yenileme aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 3 saniyeye d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcld\xfc (aktif haldeki 1sn'nin 3 kat\u0131 - h\xe2l\xe2 ciddi pil tasarrufu sa\u011fl\u0131yor) - harekete ge\xe7i\u015f art\u0131k \xe7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131 fark ediliyor.","v1.4.38\u2019s battery save slowed paused GPS to every 8 s, so \u201cAuto-paused\u201d could linger up to 8 s after you moved. Paused interval is now 3 s (3\xd7 the 1 s active rate) \u2014 still a clear battery win, much faster resume.")
B.Sf=new A.X("v1.4.40 beta","2026-08-14","v1.4.39'daki isim sorma diyalo\u011funda ger\xe7ek bir hata vard\u0131: girilen isim do\u011fru soruluyordu ama Android'in payla\u015f\u0131m ekran\u0131na ge\xe7ince dosya rastgele/anlams\u0131z bir isimle (UUID benzeri) g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu - XFile.fromData Android'de verilen ismi payla\u015f\u0131m sayfas\u0131na ta\u015f\u0131m\u0131yormu\u015f. Art\u0131k dosya \xf6nce ger\xe7ek ad\u0131yla diske yaz\u0131l\u0131p \xf6yle payla\u015f\u0131l\u0131yor, payla\u015f\u0131m ekran\u0131nda da do\u011fru isim g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor. Web taraf\u0131 etkilenmedi, orada zaten do\u011fru \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yordu.","The v1.4.39 name dialog asked for the right name, but Android\u2019s share sheet showed a UUID-like filename \u2014 XFile.fromData does not pass the name through. The file is now written to disk under the real name before sharing. Web was already correct.")
B.UN=new A.X("v1.4.39 beta","2026-08-14",'Harita ekran\u0131ndaki payla\u015f/d\u0131\u015fa aktar ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 art\u0131k format sorusundan sonra dosya ismini de soruyor - varsay\u0131lan olarak rotan\u0131n kay\u0131tl\u0131 ismi geliyor, isterseniz de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsiniz. \xd6zellikle birle\u015ftirilmi\u015f rotalarda (otomatik "A + B" ismiyle gelenler) faydal\u0131.',"Share/export on the map now asks for a file name after the format, defaulting to the saved route name. Especially useful for merged routes that arrive as \u201cA + B\u201d.")
B.V3=new A.X("v1.4.38 beta","2026-08-14","Pil tasarrufu: incelendi\u011finde ortaya \xe7\u0131kt\u0131 ki oto-duraklama ve manuel duraklama sadece g\xf6rsel/kay\u0131t filtresiydi - GPS \xe7ipi arkada h\xe2l\xe2 tam h\u0131zda (1 saniyede bir, y\xfcksek hassasiyet) \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131p pil t\xfcketmeye devam ediyordu. Art\u0131k duraklama ba\u015flar ba\u015flamaz native GPS iste\u011fi yava\u015fl\u0131yor (8 saniyede bir, d\xfc\u015f\xfck g\xfc\xe7 modu); hareket alg\u0131lan\u0131r alg\u0131lanmaz eski h\u0131z\u0131na (1sn/y\xfcksek hassasiyet) d\xf6n\xfcyor. Hem otomatik hem elle duraklatma bu de\u011fi\u015fiklikten yararlan\u0131yor.","Battery: auto-pause and manual pause were only a visual/record filter \u2014 the GPS chip still ran at 1 s high accuracy. As soon as pause starts, the native request slows (every 8 s, low power) and returns to 1 s / high accuracy when motion is detected. Both auto and manual pause use this.")
B.SU=new A.X("v1.4.37 beta","2026-08-14","Test s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc: yerel Flutter + Android SDK derleme zinciri do\u011fruland\u0131. \xdcr\xfcn davran\u0131\u015f\u0131 v1.4.36 ile ayn\u0131; etiket yeni APK/web yay\u0131n\u0131n\u0131n geldi\u011fini do\u011frulamak i\xe7in.","Test build: local Flutter + Android SDK toolchain verified. Product behavior matches v1.4.36; the label only confirms a new APK/web release.")
B.Tu=new A.X("v1.4.36 beta","2026-08-13",'\u0130ki ekran g\xf6r\xfcnt\xfcs\xfcyle yakalanan iki ger\xe7ek harita hatas\u0131 d\xfczeltildi: (1) K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 rota \xe7izgisinde ara s\u0131ra beliren keskin "s\u0131\xe7rama"lar (\xf6zellikle kav\u015fak/y\xfcksek bina yak\u0131nlar\u0131nda) - GPS servisinden gelen fiziksel olarak imkans\u0131z h\u0131zl\u0131 s\u0131\xe7ramalar art\u0131k rotaya hi\xe7 eklenmiyor, kaydedilen iz temiz kal\u0131yor. (2) Harita y\xf6n-takip (course-up) modunun "neden yukar\u0131 gitmiyor" sorunu - k\xf6k neden bulundu: bilgi sayfas\u0131ndan haritaya her ge\xe7i\u015fte, harita widget\'\u0131 yeniden kurulurken flutter_map k\xfct\xfcphanesinin kendi i\xe7 olay\u0131 ("boyut de\u011fi\u015fti") yanl\u0131\u015fl\u0131kla "kullan\u0131c\u0131 haritay\u0131 elle kayd\u0131rd\u0131" san\u0131l\u0131p y\xf6n-takip modunu sessizce kapat\u0131yordu - siz hi\xe7 dokunmasan\u0131z bile. Art\u0131k sadece ger\xe7ek s\xfcr\xfckleme/yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131rma hareketleri modu kapat\u0131yor.',"Two real map bugs from screenshots: (1) Sharp \u201cjumps\u201d on the red line (junctions / tall buildings) \u2014 physically impossible GPS hops are no longer added. (2) Course-up looking like it was not heading up: leaving the info page rebuilt the map and flutter_map\u2019s \u201csize changed\u201d event was treated as a user pan, silently turning follow off. Only real drag/pinch now disables follow.")
B.TI=new A.X("v1.4.35 beta","2026-08-13","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n canl\u0131 bilgi sayfas\u0131ndaki kartlar\u0131n varsay\u0131lan s\u0131ras\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fti: Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi/Mesafe, Mola s\xfcresi/Son moladan bu yana, Ortalama h\u0131z/Maks. h\u0131z, Maks. irtifa/Min. irtifa, \u0130ni\u015f/T\u0131rman\u0131\u015f, en altta tek ba\u015f\u0131na Y\xfckseklik. Bu sadece varsay\u0131lan - kartlar\u0131 bas\u0131l\u0131 tutup s\xfcr\xfckleyerek istedi\u011finiz gibi de\u011fi\u015ftirmeye devam edebilirsiniz.","Default order of live recording cards: Active time/Distance, Rest/Since last rest, Average/Max speed, Max/Min altitude, Descent/Climb, Elevation alone at the bottom. Still fully rearrangeable in Settings.")
B.UZ=new A.X("v1.4.34 beta","2026-08-12",'Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi mant\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\xf6zden ge\xe7irildi: art\u0131k her durdu\u011funuzda (k\u0131sa duraklama da olsa) ekranda an\u0131nda donuyor - \xf6nceden hi\xe7 donmuyordu, sadece 10dk+ molalar sonradan d\xfc\u015f\xfcl\xfcyordu. Tekrar harekete ge\xe7ince: duraklama 10 dakikan\u0131n alt\u0131ndaysa o s\xfcre geriye d\xf6n\xfck olarak aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015fe eklenir (k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir s\u0131\xe7rama g\xf6r\xfcrs\xfcn\xfcz), 10 dakika ve \xfczeriyse mola say\u0131l\u0131r. Toplam s\xfcre = Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f + Mola s\xfcresi e\u015fitli\u011fi hep korunuyor. Ayr\u0131ca "Son moladan bu yana" sayac\u0131, devam eden bir molay\u0131 (10dk+ duraklamay\u0131) art\u0131k kendi i\xe7ine katm\u0131yor - mola s\xfcrerken s\u0131f\u0131rda duruyor, mola bitip tekrar harekete ge\xe7ince s\u0131f\u0131rdan saymaya ba\u015fl\u0131yor.',"Active riding time now freezes as soon as you stop (even briefly); before it never froze and only subtracted 10+ min rests later. On resume, a rest under 10 minutes is added back to active time (a small jump); 10+ minutes stays a rest. Total = Active + Rest always holds. \u201cSince last rest\u201d no longer includes an in-progress 10+ min rest \u2014 it stays at zero during the rest and restarts when you move.")
B.S9=new A.X("v1.4.33 beta","2026-08-12","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n canl\u0131 bilgi sayfas\u0131ndaki kartlar \xe7ok k\xfc\xe7\xfck kal\u0131yordu, altta bo\u015f yer duruyordu - art\u0131k her sat\u0131r kalan dikey alan\u0131 doldurup b\xfcy\xfcyor, kartlar\u0131n i\xe7indeki yaz\u0131 da kart boyutuna g\xf6re otomatik \xf6l\xe7ekleniyor. Ayr\u0131ca art\u0131k Ayarlar'a gitmeden, tam telefon ana ekran\u0131ndaki uygulama ikonlar\u0131n\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131ma gibi: bir kart\u0131 parmakla bas\u0131l\u0131 tutup ba\u015fka bir kart\u0131n \xfczerine s\xfcr\xfckleyip b\u0131rakarak yerlerini do\u011frudan de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsiniz.","Live recording cards were tiny with empty space below \u2014 each row now fills leftover height and type scales with the card. You can long-press and drag a card onto another to reorder, like moving home-screen icons, without opening Settings.")
B.Se=new A.X("v1.4.32 beta","2026-08-12",'Maks./Min. irtifa etiketleri ta\u015f\u0131yordu ("Maksimum ..." gibi kesiliyordu) - k\u0131salt\u0131ld\u0131 ve kart yaz\u0131 boyutu k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcld\xfc. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki "Toplam s\xfcre" yaz\u0131s\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131, sadece ikon+s\xfcre kald\u0131. Oto-duraklama art\u0131k 3 saniye durunca devreye giriyor (\xf6nceden 15 saniyeydi) - bu sadece g\xf6rsel "bekleniyor" rozeti, mola say\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 (10 dakika e\u015fi\u011fi) etkilemiyor. Ayarlar\'a yeni bir ekran eklendi: "Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 kartlar\u0131" - kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n canl\u0131 bilgi sayfas\u0131ndaki kartlar\u0131 (s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi, mesafe, irtifa, h\u0131z vb.) s\xfcr\xfckleyip istedi\u011finiz s\u0131raya koyabilir, istemediklerinizi anahtarla kapatabilirsiniz.',"Max./Min. altitude labels were overflowing \u2014 shortened, card type smaller. \u201cTotal duration\u201d text on the recording screen removed (icon+time only). Auto-pause engages after 3 s still (was 15 s) \u2014 visual badge only, rest counting still uses the 10 min threshold. Settings \u2192 \u201cRecording screen cards\u201d lets you drag-reorder and hide live cards.")
B.Tl=new A.X("v1.4.31 beta","2026-08-12","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 canl\u0131 bilgi sayfas\u0131nda aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi art\u0131k mesafenin hemen yan\u0131nda (G\xfcnl\xfck sekmesindeki s\xfcre+km e\u015fle\u015fmesiyle ayn\u0131 mant\u0131k) - mola s\xfcresi de y\xfckseklikle e\u015fle\u015fti. Harita sayfas\u0131ndaki k\xfc\xe7\xfck h\u0131z kutusu belirgin \u015fekilde b\xfcy\xfct\xfcld\xfc.","On the live info page, active riding time sits next to distance (same pairing as the Daily tab\u2019s time+km); rest duration pairs with elevation. The small map-page speed box is much larger.")
B.Rz=new A.X("v1.4.30 beta","2026-08-12","KR\u0130T\u0130K CI d\xfczeltmesi (3. ad\u0131m): Gradle ve AGP'den sonra bu sefer de Kotlin s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc (2.1.20) Flutter'\u0131n yeni minimum gereksinimini (2.2.20) kar\u015f\u0131lam\u0131yordu. Kotlin 2.2.20'ye y\xfckseltildi - h\xe2l\xe2 AGP 9'un alt\u0131nda kal\u0131n\u0131yor (file_picker gibi eklentilerin Kotlin derlemesini bozmamas\u0131 i\xe7in). Uygulama taraf\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik yok.","Critical CI fix (step 3): after Gradle and AGP, Kotlin 2.1.20 was below Flutter\u2019s new minimum (2.2.20). Kotlin raised to 2.2.20, still under AGP 9 so plugins like file_picker keep compiling. No visible product change.")
B.Ue=new A.X("v1.4.29 beta","2026-08-12","KR\u0130T\u0130K CI d\xfczeltmesi (devam): bir \xf6nceki Gradle y\xfckseltmesi tek ba\u015f\u0131na yetmedi - Flutter bu sefer de Android Gradle Plugin s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn\xfcn (8.11.0) en az 8.11.1 olmas\u0131n\u0131 istedi. AGP 8.11.1'e y\xfckseltildi (h\xe2l\xe2 9'un alt\u0131nda - file_picker gibi baz\u0131 eklentilerin Kotlin derlemesini bozmamas\u0131 i\xe7in AGP 9+'a ge\xe7ilmiyor). Uygulama taraf\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik yok.","Critical CI fix (continued): Flutter then required Android Gradle Plugin \u2265 8.11.1 (was 8.11.0). AGP 8.11.1, still below 9 so file_picker and similar plugins keep compiling. No visible product change.")
B.TT=new A.X("v1.4.28 beta","2026-08-12",'Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki en \xfcstteki "Toplam s\xfcre" \u015feridi (ikon+etiket+rakam hepsi tek sat\u0131rda) dengesiz duruyordu - art\u0131k ikon+etiket \xfcstte, b\xfcy\xfck s\xfcre rakam\u0131 hemen alt\u0131nda ortalanm\u0131\u015f. Ayr\u0131ca: G\xfcnl\xfck sekmesindeki g\xfcn ayr\u0131m\u0131n\u0131n zaten takvim g\xfcn\xfc (gece yar\u0131s\u0131) s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131na g\xf6re otomatik oldu\u011fu do\u011fruland\u0131 - ek bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik gerekmedi.',"The top \u201cTotal duration\u201d strip (icon+label+number on one line) looked unbalanced \u2014 icon+label on top, large time centered under it. Daily-tab day splits already use calendar midnight; no extra change needed.")
B.Uh=new A.X("v1.4.27 beta","2026-08-12","KR\u0130T\u0130K CI d\xfczeltmesi: bir \xf6nceki push'ta Android APK derlemesi ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131z oldu - CI'daki Flutter \"stable\" kanal\u0131 kendili\u011finden yeni bir s\xfcr\xfcme ge\xe7mi\u015f ve art\u0131k en az Gradle 8.14.0 istiyor, projeyse 8.13'e sabitliydi. android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties 8.14'e y\xfckseltildi. Uygulama taraf\u0131nda g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik yok.","Critical CI fix: the previous push\u2019s Android APK failed because CI Flutter stable now wants Gradle \u2265 8.14.0 and the project was pinned to 8.13. gradle-wrapper.properties raised to 8.14. No visible product change.")
B.RD=new A.X("v1.4.26 beta","2026-08-12",'Bir \xf6nceki s\xfcr\xfcmde "ikon rengi/b\xfcy\xfckl\xfc\u011f\xfc" ayar\u0131 yanl\u0131\u015fl\u0131kla sadece istatistik kart\u0131 ikonlar\u0131na eklenmi\u015fti - kullan\u0131c\u0131 asl\u0131nda harita \xfczerindeki ara\xe7 ikonunu (motor/araba i\u015faret\xe7isi) kastetmi\u015fti. Ara\xe7 ikonu se\xe7im ekran\u0131 de ayn\u0131 mant\u0131\u011fa ge\xe7ti: ara\xe7 t\xfcr\xfc (klasik nokta/motosiklet/araba), renk ve b\xfcy\xfckl\xfck art\u0131k \xfc\xe7 ayr\u0131, birbirinden ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z se\xe7im - \xf6nceden bunlar 10 sabit kombinasyondan biri olarak se\xe7ilebiliyordu (\xf6r. "se\xe7enek 3" hem belirli bir rengi hem belirli bir boyu birlikte getiriyordu), art\u0131k istedi\u011fin rengi istedi\u011fin boyla e\u015fle\u015ftirebilirsin.',"The previous \u201cicon color/size\u201d setting only hit stat-card icons \u2014 the request was the map vehicle marker. The vehicle picker now has independent type (classic/motorcycle/car), color and size instead of 10 fixed combos.")
B.Ux=new A.X("v1.4.25 beta","2026-08-12","Analiz paneli ve kay\u0131t bilgi sayfas\u0131nda bir dizi d\xfczen d\xfczeltmesi: (1) \xd6zet sekmesinin en \xfcstteki 3'l\xfc \u015feridi (\"Mesafe/Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi/Maks. h\u0131z\") uzun etiket y\xfcz\xfcnden dengesiz g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu - Maks. h\u0131z yerine Ortalama h\u0131z kondu, s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi s\xfctununa daha fazla yer ayr\u0131ld\u0131. (2) Ayn\u0131 sekmenin Zaman grid'inde: Ortalama h\u0131z'\u0131n yan\u0131na Maks. h\u0131z eklendi, Maksimum/Minimum irtifa sat\u0131r\u0131 T\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/\u0130ni\u015f'in \xfcst\xfcne ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131, Pil kutusu grid'den \xe7\u0131kar\u0131l\u0131p ayr\u0131, ortalanm\u0131\u015f bir sat\u0131r oldu. (3) Y\xfckseklik sekmesinin en alt\u0131na b\xfcy\xfck punto ile \"Son irtifa\" eklendi. (4) Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n canl\u0131 bilgi sayfas\u0131nda: Maksimum/Minimum irtifa yukar\u0131, T\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/\u0130ni\u015f a\u015fa\u011f\u0131 ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131, Ortalama h\u0131z'\u0131n yan\u0131na Maks. h\u0131z geldi, Son moladan bu yana kendi sat\u0131r\u0131na ge\xe7ti. (5) G\xfcnl\xfck sekmesinde s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi art\u0131k mesafeden \xf6nce (yan yana kal\u0131yor). (6) Canl\u0131 harita \xfcst\xfcndeki S\xfcre/Mesafe/Y\xfckseklik kutular\u0131n\u0131n de\u011ferleri art\u0131k etiketlerinin yan\u0131nda de\u011fil alt\u0131nda, ortalanm\u0131\u015f.","Analysis and recording-info layout: (1) Overview top trio uses Average speed instead of Max so riding time has more room. (2) Time grid: Max next to Average, Max/Min altitude above Climb/Descent, Battery on its own centered row. (3) Elevation tab ends with a large \u201cLast altitude\u201d. (4) Live info: Max/Min altitude up, Climb/Descent down, Max next to Average, Since last rest on its own row. (5) Daily tab shows riding time before distance. (6) Live map Duration/Distance/Elevation values sit under their labels, centered.")
B.S7=new A.X("v1.4.24 beta","2026-08-12",'v1.4.23\'te Analiz panelinin \xd6zet sekmesine eklenen "Son moladan bu yana" kart\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 - kaydedilmi\u015f/i\xe7e aktar\u0131lm\u0131\u015f bir rota i\xe7in "\u015fu ana kadar" gibi bir zaman kavram\u0131 anlams\u0131z, bu ancak canl\u0131, devam eden bir kay\u0131t i\xe7in mant\u0131kl\u0131 bir bilgi. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n bilgi sayfas\u0131nda (canl\u0131) oldu\u011fu gibi duruyor.',"The \u201cSince last rest\u201d card added to Analysis \u2192 Overview in v1.4.23 is gone \u2014 \u201cuntil now\u201d is meaningless on a saved/imported route. It stays on the live recording info page.")
B.Sp=new A.X("v1.4.23 beta","2026-08-12",'Kay\u0131tl\u0131/y\xfcklenmi\u015f rotalar i\xe7in ayr\u0131 bir tam ekran "\xf6zet" sayfas\u0131 (mavi kartl\u0131) eklenmi\u015fti (v1.4.19), ama zaten var olan Analiz panelinin \xd6zet sekmesiyle neredeyse ayn\u0131 bilgileri g\xf6steriyordu - ayn\u0131 rota i\xe7in iki ayr\u0131 \xf6zet ekran\u0131 olmas\u0131 kafa kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131yd\u0131. Ayr\u0131 mavi sayfa tamamen kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131; onda olup Analiz panelinde olmayan bilgiler (t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f, ini\u015f, son moladan bu yana ge\xe7en s\xfcre) Analiz panelinin \xd6zet sekmesine eklendi. Art\u0131k rota istatistikleri i\xe7in tek bir yer var.',"The extra full-screen blue \u201csummary\u201d page (v1.4.19) duplicated Analysis \u2192 Overview. It is removed; climb, descent and time since last rest moved onto Overview. Route stats live in one place.")
B.So=new A.X("v1.4.22 beta","2026-08-12","\xd6zet sayfalar\u0131ndaki (hem canl\u0131 kay\u0131t hem kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota) t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f/maksimum irtifa/minimum irtifa kartlar\u0131 tek sat\u0131rda 4'l\xfc g\xf6steriliyordu, \xe7ok s\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131k duruyordu. Art\u0131k iki sat\u0131ra b\xf6l\xfcnd\xfc: t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f ve ini\u015f bir sat\u0131rda, maksimum ve minimum irtifa hemen alt\u0131ndaki sat\u0131rda.","Climb/descent/max/min altitude cards on summary pages were a cramped row of four. Now two rows: climb+descent, then max+min altitude.")
B.U6=new A.X("v1.4.21 beta","2026-08-12",'Bir seferde bir\xe7ok k\xfc\xe7\xfck d\xfczeltme: (1) Uygulama a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f\u0131nda yar\u0131m kalm\u0131\u015f kay\u0131tlar\u0131 otomatik "kurtar\u0131p" rota listesine ekleyen \xf6zellik kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 - anl\u0131k aksakl\u0131klarda ortaya \xe7\u0131kan sahte kay\u0131tlarla listeyi kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131yordu, art\u0131k b\xf6yle bir kal\u0131nt\u0131 sessizce siliniyor. (2) Mola tan\u0131m\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fti: art\u0131k sadece 10 dakika ve \xfczeri s\xfcren duru\u015flar "mola" say\u0131l\u0131yor - k\u0131sa bir k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131k/duraklama art\u0131k s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresine dahil kal\u0131yor, mola s\xfcresini \u015fi\u015firmiyor (hem canl\u0131 kay\u0131tta hem kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota \xf6zetinde). (3) "Ortalama h\u0131z" art\u0131k ger\xe7ekten sadece s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi \xfczerinden (mesafe \xf7 hareket h\xe2lindeki s\xfcre) hesaplan\u0131yor. (4) Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki canl\u0131 haritan\u0131n \xfcst\xfcndeki S\xfcre/Mesafe/Y\xfckseklik kutular\u0131 art\u0131k h\u0131z rakam\u0131n\u0131n kendi sat\u0131r\u0131nda de\u011fil, alt\u0131nda ayr\u0131 bir sat\u0131rda - h\u0131z 3 haneye \xe7\u0131k\u0131nca art\u0131k o kutular\u0131 s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p okunmaz h\xe2le getirmiyor. (5) Ayarlar\'a yeni bir "\u0130statistik ikon g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm\xfc" eklendi: kart ikonlar\u0131n\u0131n rengini ve b\xfcy\xfckl\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfc istedi\u011fin gibi se\xe7ebiliyorsun. (6) Hem canl\u0131 kay\u0131t hem kay\u0131tl\u0131 rota \xf6zet sayfalar\u0131nda: "Toplam s\xfcre" \u015feridi kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 (S\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi + Mola s\xfcresi zaten yeterli), "Maks. h\u0131z" kart\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131na "Son moladan bu yana" ge\xe7en s\xfcre eklendi, t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f/maksimum irtifa/minimum irtifa art\u0131k tek sat\u0131rda yan yana - hepsi ayn\u0131 irtifa profiline ait olduklar\u0131 i\xe7in birlikte okunuyor.',"Several small fixes: (1) Auto-recovering half-finished recordings into the list is gone \u2014 glitches created junk rides; leftovers are deleted quietly. (2) A rest is 10+ minutes; short lights stay in riding time. (3) Average speed is distance \xf7 moving time. (4) Live map Duration/Distance/Elevation sit on their own row under speed so 3-digit speeds do not crush them. (5) Settings \u2192 \u201cStat icon look\u201d for card icon color and size. (6) Summary pages: Total strip removed (Riding + Rest is enough), \u201cSince last rest\u201d next to Max speed, climb/descent/max/min altitude on one row.")
B.V2=new A.X("v1.4.20 beta","2026-08-12","GPS h\u0131z/y\xf6n gecikmesine farkl\u0131 bir \xe7\xf6z\xfcm denendi: bir telefonun GPS \xe7ipi zaten ger\xe7ek\xe7i olarak saniyede birden h\u0131zl\u0131 \xf6l\xe7\xfcm \xfcretemiyor (bir \xf6nceki s\xfcr\xfcmde aral\u0131k zaten bu tavana \xe7ekilmi\u015fti), yani aral\u0131\u011f\u0131 daha da k\u0131saltman\u0131n faydas\u0131 yok - as\u0131l sorun her yeni \xf6l\xe7\xfcm gelene kadar rakam\u0131n/haritan\u0131n oldu\u011fu yerde donup sonra bir anda z\u0131plamas\u0131. Art\u0131k h\u0131z rakam\u0131 (hem kay\u0131t hem bilgi sayfas\u0131nda) ve harita kameras\u0131 (konum + y\xf6n birlikte) her yeni \xf6l\xe7\xfcmde hedefe do\u011fru s\xfcrekli, ak\u0131c\u0131 bir animasyonla kay\u0131yor - veri ger\xe7ekte h\xe2l\xe2 ~1 saniyede bir gelse de ekran hi\xe7 dura\u011fan g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyor, s\xfcrekli canl\u0131/hareket h\xe2linde hissettiriyor.","GPS speed/heading still arrive about once a second; the number and map camera now ease toward each new fix so the screen never looks frozen between updates.")
B.Sm=new A.X("v1.4.19 beta","2026-08-12",'Kay\u0131tl\u0131/y\xfcklenmi\u015f rotalar i\xe7in de kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n bilgi sayfas\u0131na benzer bir "\xf6zet" sayfas\u0131 eklendi (harita ekran\u0131ndaki yeni ikonla ge\xe7iliyor): en \xfcstte b\xfcy\xfck bir "Toplam s\xfcre" \u015feridi, alt\u0131nda s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi/mola s\xfcresi \xe7ifti, ard\u0131ndan mesafe, ortalama h\u0131z, maks. h\u0131z, t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f, ini\u015f, maksimum irtifa ve minimum irtifa - hepsi ayn\u0131 mavi kart tasar\u0131m\u0131yla. Ayr\u0131ca kay\u0131t ekran\u0131n\u0131n bilgi sayfas\u0131ndaki, k\xfc\xe7\xfck oldu\u011fu i\xe7in okunmas\u0131 g\xfc\xe7 h\u0131z/y\xfckseklik mini grafikleri kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131; yerlerine maksimum irtifa ve minimum irtifa kutular\u0131 eklendi.',"Saved/imported routes get a summary page like recording info (new map icon): large Total duration, riding/rest pair, then distance, average/max speed, climb, descent, max/min altitude in the same blue cards. Tiny live speed/elevation mini-charts are replaced by max/min altitude boxes.")
B.Tn=new A.X("v1.4.18 beta","2026-08-11","KR\u0130T\u0130K d\xfczeltme: h\u0131z g\xf6stergesi \xe7ok gecikmeli g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu, harita da bazen ger\xe7ek y\xf6nle uyu\u015fmayan bir tarafa d\xf6nm\xfc\u015f kal\u0131yordu - as\u0131l sebep, hem kay\u0131t i\xe7in kullan\u0131lan native GPS servisinin hem de haritay\u0131 d\xf6nd\xfcren konum ak\u0131\u015f\u0131n\u0131n sadece 5 saniyede bir g\xfcncellenmesiydi (bir de native tarafta 2 saniyelik ek e\u015fik vard\u0131). \u0130kisi de art\u0131k saniyede bir g\xfcncelleniyor (native tarafta ek e\u015fik 0.5 saniyeye indirildi) - normal bir navigasyon uygulamas\u0131n\u0131n g\xfcncelleme h\u0131z\u0131na yak\u0131n. H\u0131z art\u0131k ger\xe7ek h\u0131zlanma/yava\u015flamay\u0131 \xe7ok daha yak\u0131ndan takip ediyor, harita da d\xf6n\xfc\u015fleri \xe7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131 yakal\u0131yor.","Critical: speed lagged and the map sometimes faced the wrong way because both the native GPS service and the heading stream updated only every 5 s (plus a 2 s native threshold). Both now update about once a second (native threshold 0.5 s) \u2014 closer to a normal navigation app.")
B.S_=new A.X("v1.4.17 beta","2026-08-11",'Kay\u0131t bilgi sayfas\u0131nda "Toplam s\xfcre" \u015feridi en az 2 kat b\xfcy\xfct\xfcld\xfc - art\u0131k alttaki mavi kartlar\u0131n yaz\u0131lar\u0131ndan belirgin \u015fekilde daha b\xfcy\xfck. Rotalar listesinde: ayarlar ikonu art\u0131k \xe7oklu se\xe7im modunda da g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor (\xf6nceden kayboluyordu); se\xe7im ara\xe7 \xe7ubu\u011funa "T\xfcm\xfcn\xfc g\xf6ster" onay kutusu eklendi (i\u015faretlenince t\xfcm rotalar tek seferde se\xe7ilir); "Haritada g\xf6ster"in yan\u0131na bir sil ikonu eklendi, se\xe7ili rotalar\u0131 tek dokunu\u015fla (onay istenerek) siler.',"Recording-info \u201cTotal duration\u201d strip is at least 2\xd7 larger than the blue cards. On the routes list the settings icon stays in multi-select; the toolbar has a \u201cShow all\u201d checkbox and a delete icon next to \u201cShow on map\u201d (with confirm).")
B.Sh=new A.X("v1.4.16 beta","2026-08-11",'Bilgi sayfas\u0131 yeniden d\xfczenlendi: "Toplam s\xfcre" art\u0131k en \xfcstte, "Otomatik duraklat\u0131ld\u0131" band\u0131n\u0131n \xfczerinde kendi \u015feridinde; s\xfcre kutular\u0131 sat\u0131r\u0131nda toplam s\xfcre yerine art\u0131k mola s\xfcresi var (aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresinin yan\u0131nda); "Y\xfckseklik" kart\u0131 istatistik \u0131zgaras\u0131nda art\u0131k "Mesafe"nin hemen yan\u0131nda; mavi kartlardaki ikon+yaz\u0131 blo\u011fu art\u0131k kutunun ortas\u0131nda (\xf6nceden sola yasl\u0131yd\u0131); h\u0131z/y\xfckseklik grafiklerine ayr\u0131lan alan b\xfcy\xfct\xfcld\xfc (mola s\xfcresi ve toplam s\xfcre \u0131zgaradan \xe7\u0131k\u0131nca bo\u015fta kalan yer de\u011ferlendirildi). Harita sayfas\u0131nda h\u0131z kutusuna biraz daha nefes alan\u0131 b\u0131rakmak i\xe7in sa\u011fdaki s\xfcre/mesafe/y\xfckseklik kutusunun yaz\u0131lar\u0131 az\u0131c\u0131k k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcld\xfc (yine de eski halinden b\xfcy\xfck).',"Info page: \u201cTotal duration\u201d is its own top strip above the auto-pause band; the time row shows rest next to active riding; Elevation sits beside Distance; blue-card icon+text is centered; speed/elevation charts use the freed space. Map-page Duration/Distance/Elevation type is slightly smaller to give the speed box room (still larger than originally).")
B.Rx=new A.X("v1.4.15 beta","2026-08-11","KR\u0130T\u0130K d\xfczeltme: haritadaki ara\xe7 i\u015faret\xe7isi h\xe2l\xe2 yukar\u0131 bakm\u0131yordu - ger\xe7ek sebep, flutter_map'in Marker bile\u015feninin varsay\u0131lan olarak haritayla B\u0130RL\u0130KTE d\xf6nmesiydi (rotate:true set edilmemi\u015fti), yani harita y\xf6n-takip i\xe7in d\xf6nd\xfck\xe7e i\u015faret\xe7i de onunla birlikte d\xf6n\xfcp ekranda yanl\u0131\u015f a\xe7\u0131da kal\u0131yordu. Art\u0131k i\u015faret\xe7i haritan\u0131n d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfcne kar\u015f\u0131 sabitlenip her zaman yukar\u0131 bak\u0131yor. Ayr\u0131ca: harita sayfas\u0131ndaki h\u0131z/s\xfcre/mesafe/y\xfckseklik kutular\u0131n\u0131n yaz\u0131lar\u0131 en az 2 kat b\xfcy\xfct\xfcld\xfc; bilgi sayfas\u0131ndaki alt kartlar\u0131n de\u011ferleri art\u0131k aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi kutusuyla ayn\u0131 b\xfcy\xfckl\xfckte (gerekirse sayfa kayabilir); bilgi sayfas\u0131n\u0131n rengi k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 temadan mavi-beyaz a\u011f\u0131rl\u0131kl\u0131 bir palete \xe7evrildi; h\u0131z grafi\u011findeki s\xfcr\xfc\u015f\xfcn ba\u015f\u0131ndaki anlams\u0131z bo\u015f b\xf6lge kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131, grafik art\u0131k ger\xe7ek hareketin ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131 noktadan ba\u015fl\u0131yor.","Critical: the vehicle marker still did not point up because flutter_map Markers rotate with the map by default. The marker is now counter-rotated so it always points up. Map HUD type is at least 2\xd7 larger; info-page lower cards match active-time size; info palette is blue-white instead of red; the speed chart starts at real movement, not a leading empty gap.")
B.Uy=new A.X("v1.4.14 beta","2026-08-11","Bilgi sayfas\u0131 ba\u015ftan tasarland\u0131: h\u0131z rakam\u0131 \xe7ok daha b\xfcy\xfck ve farkl\u0131 (italik, kal\u0131n, parlamal\u0131) bir fontla g\xf6steriliyor; arka plan art\u0131k d\xfcz renk yerine hafif hareketli, modern bir gradyan+parlama efekti; \xf6nceki 7 farkl\u0131 renkli kart tek bir tutarl\u0131 renge (cam g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcml\xfc, kenarl\u0131kl\u0131) \xe7evrildi. H\u0131z ve y\xfckseklik grafiklerinde art\u0131k en y\xfcksek (ve y\xfckseklikte en d\xfc\u015f\xfck) noktalar her zaman bir nokta+etiketle sabit olarak i\u015faretli, grafi\u011fin ekseni zamanla yeniden \xf6l\xe7eklense bile pik de\u011fer g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr kal\u0131yor. Haritaya ge\xe7i\u015f d\xfc\u011fmesi sol alttan sa\u011f \xfcste ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131 - art\u0131k iki sayfada da ayn\u0131 k\xf6\u015fede.","Info page redesigned: much larger italic/bold speed, a subtle moving gradient, one consistent glass card style. Speed and elevation charts always mark peak (and elevation trough) with a dot+label. The map toggle moved from bottom-left to top-right \u2014 same corner on both pages.")
B.Sc=new A.X("v1.4.13 beta","2026-08-11","Harita sayfas\u0131n\u0131n \xfcst bilgi \xe7ubu\u011fu istenen \u015fablona g\xf6re d\xfczenlendi: solda tek b\xfcy\xfck h\u0131z kutusu, sa\u011fda s\xfcre/mesafe/y\xfckseklik art\u0131k yan yana \xfc\xe7 s\xfctun de\u011fil, alt alta \xfc\xe7 sat\u0131r.","Map-page top HUD matches the requested template: one large speed box on the left; duration/distance/elevation stacked on the right instead of three columns.")
B.Uw=new A.X("v1.4.12 beta","2026-08-11",'D\xfczeltme: v1.4.9\'da titremeyi gidermek i\xe7in eklenen "son birka\xe7 okuman\u0131n ortalamas\u0131" y\xf6ntemi, GPS g\xfcncellemeleri seyrek geldi\u011finde (~5 saniyede bir) d\xf6neme\xe7lerde haritan\u0131n ger\xe7ek y\xf6ne yeti\u015fmesini yava\u015flat\u0131yordu - yol d\xf6n\xfcyor ama harita h\xe2l\xe2 eski y\xf6ne bak\u0131yor gibi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu. Ortalama alma yerine art\u0131k h\u0131z filtresiyle ayn\u0131 mant\u0131k kullan\u0131l\u0131yor: ger\xe7ek bir d\xf6n\xfc\u015f (ne kadar keskin olursa olsun) an\u0131nda uygulan\u0131yor, sadece fiziksel olarak imkans\u0131z ani s\u0131\xe7ramalar (tek bir k\xf6t\xfc GPS \xf6l\xe7\xfcm\xfc) g\xf6z ard\u0131 ediliyor. Ayr\u0131ca bilgi panelinden haritaya ge\xe7erken harita art\u0131k bir sonraki GPS g\xfcncellemesini beklemeden an\u0131nda do\u011fru konum/y\xf6ne senkronize ediliyor.',"The v1.4.9 heading average lagged in corners when GPS was ~5 s apart \u2014 the road turned, the map still faced the old way. Heading now uses the same logic as the speed filter: real turns apply immediately, only impossible single-sample jumps are ignored. Switching from the info panel to the map syncs position/heading immediately, without waiting for the next fix.")
B.SS=new A.X("v1.4.11 beta","2026-08-11","D\xfczeltme: GPS ara s\u0131ra tek bir k\xf6t\xfc \xf6l\xe7\xfcmle fiziksel olarak imkans\u0131z bir h\u0131z s\u0131\xe7ramas\u0131 veriyordu (\xf6r. 95 km/s seyirde aniden 200 km/s g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcp hemen eski h\u0131za d\xf6nmesi) - h\u0131z grafi\u011finde ve maks. h\u0131z istatisti\u011finde belirgin dikenler olarak g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu. Art\u0131k son kabul edilen okumaya g\xf6re saniyede ~30 km/s'i a\u015fan imkans\u0131z h\u0131zlanma/yava\u015flamalar (ger\xe7ek bir motorun yapamayaca\u011f\u0131 kadar ani) hem canl\u0131 h\u0131z g\xf6stergesinde hem de h\u0131z grafi\u011fi/istatistik hesaplamalar\u0131nda g\xf6z ard\u0131 ediliyor.","A single bad GPS sample could spike speed (e.g. 95 \u2192 200 km/h and back) on the chart and max-speed stat. Accelerations/brakes over ~30 km/h per second versus the last accepted reading are ignored on the live speed, chart and stats.")
B.RM=new A.X("v1.4.10 beta","2026-08-11","Bilgi paneli geri bildirimlere g\xf6re yeniden d\xfczenlendi: en \xfcstte art\u0131k b\xfcy\xfck puntoyla anl\u0131k h\u0131z var, hemen alt\u0131nda aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi ve toplam s\xfcre yan yana; onlar\u0131n alt\u0131nda renkli, daha kompakt bir istatistik \u0131zgaras\u0131 (mesafe, mola, ort./maks. h\u0131z, y\xfckseklik, \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f); en altta da h\u0131z ve y\xfckseklik grafikleri yan yana - hepsi kayd\u0131rma olmadan tek ekrana s\u0131\u011f\u0131yor. Harita d\xfc\u011fmesi sa\u011f \xfcstten sol alta ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131.","Info panel from feedback: large instant speed on top, active and total time side by side, then a compact colored stat grid (distance, rest, avg/max speed, elevation, climb/descent) and side-by-side speed/elevation charts \u2014 all on one screen. Map button moved from top-right to bottom-left.")
B.U2=new A.X("v1.4.9 beta","2026-08-11","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 iki sayfaya ayr\u0131ld\u0131: kay\u0131t ba\u015flar ba\u015flamaz art\u0131k \xf6nce toplam s\xfcre, aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi, mola s\xfcresi, ortalama/maks. h\u0131z, toplam \xe7\u0131k\u0131\u015f/ini\u015f ve h\u0131z/y\xfckseklik grafiklerinin oldu\u011fu bir bilgi paneli a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor; sa\u011f \xfcstteki d\xfc\u011fmeyle haritaya ge\xe7ilebiliyor. Ayr\u0131ca haritan\u0131n y\xf6n-yukar\u0131 d\xf6n\xfc\u015f\xfc art\u0131k sa\u011fa sola titremiyor - son birka\xe7 GPS y\xf6n\xfcn\xfcn ortalamas\u0131 al\u0131n\u0131p yumu\u015fak \u015fekilde d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcl\xfcyor (navigasyon uygulamalar\u0131 gibi).","Recording is two pages: starting a ride opens an info panel (total/active/rest time, avg/max speed, climb/descent, speed/elevation charts); top-right goes to the map. Course-up no longer jitters \u2014 the last few GPS headings are averaged and rotated smoothly.")
B.Te=new A.X("v1.4.8 beta","2026-08-11","v1.4.7'nin devam\u0131: baz\u0131 telefonlarda (\xf6zellikle MIUI gibi agresif arka plan y\xf6netimi olanlarda) sistem, \xf6ld\xfcrd\xfc\u011f\xfc kay\u0131t servisini hi\xe7 yeniden ba\u015flatm\u0131yor - START_STICKY yeniden ba\u015flatmas\u0131 hi\xe7 tetiklenmiyor, dolay\u0131s\u0131yla \xf6nceki d\xfczeltmenin kurtarma kodu da hi\xe7 \xe7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yordu. Veri dosyas\u0131 diskte kal\u0131yordu ama kimse onu geri okumuyordu. Art\u0131k uygulama her a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta yar\u0131m kalm\u0131\u015f bir kay\u0131t olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 kontrol ediyor; varsa otomatik olarak rota listesine kaydediyor ve bildirim g\xf6steriyor.","Follow-up to v1.4.7: some phones (especially aggressive MIUI) never restart a killed recording service, so START_STICKY and the recovery code never ran. The data file stayed on disk unread. Every launch now checks for a half-finished recording, saves it to the route list and shows a notification.")
B.Tc=new A.X("v1.4.7 beta","2026-08-11",'KR\u0130T\u0130K d\xfczeltme: \xe7ok d\xfc\u015f\xfck pilde (veya OEM\'in agresif pil y\xf6netiminde) Android t\xfcm uygulamay\u0131 \xf6ld\xfcr\xfcp arka plandaki kay\u0131t servisini kendi kendine yeniden ba\u015flatt\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, kod bunu "yeni bir kay\u0131t ba\u015fl\u0131yor" san\u0131p o ana kadar diskte biriken GPS verisini siliyordu - kay\u0131t "durmu\u015f" gibi g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor, veri de gidiyordu. Art\u0131k sistemin kendi yeniden ba\u015flatmas\u0131 ile ger\xe7ek bir yeni kay\u0131t ay\u0131rt ediliyor; \xf6nceki veri silinmek yerine geri y\xfckleniyor.',"Critical: on very low battery (or aggressive OEM killers) Android could kill the app and restart the recording service, which treated that as a new recording and wiped the GPS buffer \u2014 the ride looked \u201cstopped\u201d and data was gone. System restarts are now distinguished from a real new recording and previous data is restored.")
B.Td=new A.X("v1.4.6 beta","2026-08-10","Yeni: Android Auto'da kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 art\u0131k ger\xe7ek bir harita g\xf6steriyor - telefondaki gibi y\xf6n-yukar\u0131 (course-up) d\xf6nen, kat edilen rota \xe7izgisiyle. Karolar telefonun zaten kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 \xfccretsiz Carto kayna\u011f\u0131ndan (API anahtar\u0131 gerekmiyor). Deneysel: ger\xe7ek bir ara\xe7ta test edilemedi, sorun g\xf6r\xfcrseniz bildirin.","New: Android Auto recording shows a real map \u2014 course-up like the phone, with the driven line. Tiles from the same free Carto source (no API key). Experimental: not tested in a real car; please report issues.")
B.U3=new A.X("v1.4.5 beta","2026-08-10","D\xfczeltme: Android Auto uygulama listesinde RideAtlas hi\xe7 g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyordu. Sebebi, androidx.car.app k\xfct\xfcphanesinin zorunlu tuttu\u011fu bir manifest ayar\u0131n\u0131n (minCarApiLevel) eksik olmas\u0131yd\u0131 - bu olmadan Android Auto uygulamay\u0131 hatas\u0131z \u015fekilde sessizce listeden d\xfc\u015f\xfcr\xfcyor. Eklendi.","Fix: RideAtlas never appeared in the Android Auto app list. androidx.car.app requires minCarApiLevel in the manifest; without it Auto silently drops the app. Added.")
B.UH=new A.X("v1.4.4 beta","2026-08-09",'D\xfczeltme: bir \xf6nceki s\xfcr\xfcmde "Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi" nokta-nokta h\u0131za bakarak hesaplanmaya ba\u015flam\u0131\u015ft\u0131, ama bu G\xfcnl\xfck sekmesindeki "S\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi"nin kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 (20+ dk duraklama k\xfcmeleri tespit eden) y\xf6ntemden farkl\u0131yd\u0131 - ayn\u0131 rota i\xe7in iki sekmede farkl\u0131 say\u0131lar g\xf6r\xfcnebiliyordu. Art\u0131k \xd6zet sekmesi de G\xfcnl\xfck sekmesiyle ayn\u0131 mola tespitini kullan\u0131yor; "Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi" ve "Mola s\xfcresi" art\u0131k her iki sekmede de tutarl\u0131.',"\u201cActive riding time\u201d had started using point-to-point speed, which disagreed with Daily \u201cRiding time\u201d (20+ min stop clusters). Overview now uses the same stop detection; Active riding and Rest match on both tabs.")
B.Sn=new A.X("v1.4.3 beta","2026-08-09",'\xd6nemli d\xfczeltme: Analiz > \xd6zet sekmesinde "Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi" baz\u0131 rotalarda "Toplam s\xfcre" ile birebir ayn\u0131 \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor, bu y\xfczden "Mola s\xfcresi" de her zaman 0 g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyordu. K\xf6k neden: eski hesap, sadece noktalar aras\u0131nda 60 saniyeden uzun bir bo\u015fluk varsa "mola verildi" say\u0131yordu - ama bir\xe7ok GPS cihaz\u0131/uygulamas\u0131 dururken de sabit aral\u0131klarla nokta kaydetmeye devam ediyor, bu da hi\xe7 bo\u015fluk olu\u015fmamas\u0131na yol a\xe7\u0131yordu. Art\u0131k her nokta \xe7ifti aras\u0131ndaki ger\xe7ek h\u0131za bak\u0131l\u0131yor (duraklarda h\u0131z ~0 km/s), bu y\xfczden hangi cihazla kaydedilmi\u015f olursa olsun do\u011fru sonu\xe7 veriyor.',"Important: Analysis \u2192 Overview \u201cActive riding time\u201d sometimes equalled Total, so Rest was always 0. The old math only counted a rest when points had a 60 s gap \u2014 many GPS devices keep logging while stopped, so no gap appeared. Each pair now uses real speed (~0 km/h when stopped), so any logger is correct.")
B.Sy=new A.X("v1.4.2 beta","2026-08-09",'Rota listesinde birden fazla rota se\xe7ti\u011finizde art\u0131k "Birle\u015ftir" se\xe7ene\u011fi de var - \xf6rne\u011fin birka\xe7 g\xfcnl\xfck bir gezinin her g\xfcn\xfc ayr\u0131 kaydedildiyse, se\xe7ilenler kendi ilk GPS zaman damgas\u0131na g\xf6re otomatik s\u0131ralan\u0131p (se\xe7im s\u0131ras\u0131 \xf6nemli de\u011fil) tek bir yeni rotada birle\u015ftiriliyor; yeni rota i\xe7in bir isim soruluyor. Orijinal rotalar silinmiyor, sadece isimlerine "(birle\u015ftirildi)" ekleniyor; \xfczerlerindeki foto\u011fraf/videolar da yeni rotaya kopyalan\u0131yor.',"Selecting several routes now offers Merge \u2014 e.g. each day of a trip recorded separately. Selection is ordered by first GPS time (not tap order), you name the new route, originals stay with a \u201c(merged)\u201d suffix, and their photos/videos are copied.")
B.Ut=new A.X("v1.4.1 beta","2026-08-09",'Analiz > \xd6zet sekmesi sadele\u015ftirildi: T\u0131rman\u0131\u015f \xe7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131 (zaten Y\xfckseklik sekmesinde var); yerine Ortalama h\u0131z, Minimum/Maksimum/Son irtifa ve Mola s\xfcresi (toplam s\xfcre \u2212 aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi) eklendi. "Net s\xfcre" etiketi "Aktif s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi" oldu. \xdcstteki \xfc\xe7 b\xfcy\xfck de\u011ferin (mesafe, s\xfcre, h\u0131z) uzun metinlerde ortadan b\xf6l\xfcnmesine yol a\xe7an g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcm hatas\u0131 d\xfczeltildi.',"Analysis \u2192 Overview simplified: Climb removed (already on Elevation); Average speed, Min/Max/Last altitude and Rest (total \u2212 active) added. \u201cNet time\u201d is now \u201cActive riding time\u201d. The top three big values no longer wrap mid-word on long labels.")
B.Sj=new A.X("v1.4.0 beta","2026-08-09","S\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\u0131ras\u0131nda \xe7ekilen foto\u011fraflar rotaya ba\u011flanabiliyor: kay\u0131t bitirilip kaydedildi\u011finde, o s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresince telefonun galerisine eklenmi\u015f foto\u011fraf/videolar varsa bunlar listelenir, hangilerinin rotaya eklenece\u011fini se\xe7ebilirsiniz. Konumu bilinmeyen bir foto/video se\xe7ilirse, haritadan elle nereye ait oldu\u011funu i\u015faretlemeniz istenir. Rota haritas\u0131na, foto\u011fraf/video konumlar\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6sterme veya gizleme i\xe7in yeni bir d\xfc\u011fme eklendi (varsay\u0131lan: g\xf6steriliyor); g\xf6sterildi\u011finde her biri haritada k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir \xf6nizlemeyle i\u015faretlenir ve dokununca tam ekran a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r. Foto\u011fraf/video daha sonra da elle eklenebilir - bu zaten var olan \xf6zellik de\u011fi\u015fmedi.","Photos taken during a ride can attach to the route: after save, gallery photos/videos from that session are listed for you to pick. Media without a location can be placed on the map by hand. A new map button shows/hides photo pins (default on); tap a pin for full screen. Manual add later is unchanged.")
B.To=new A.X("v1.3.48 beta","2026-08-09","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki harita art\u0131k her zaman y\xf6n-takip (course-up) modunda - kuzey-sabit moda ge\xe7i\u015f kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131, konum tu\u015fu art\u0131k her bas\u0131\u015fta sadece ortal\u0131yor. \xdcstteki s\xfcre/mesafe/y\xfckseklik kutusu yeniden d\xfczenlendi: de\u011ferler dar ekranlarda birbirine kar\u0131\u015f\u0131p ta\u015fmak yerine, aralar\u0131nda ince bir ayra\xe7la, kendi s\xfctunlar\u0131nda okunakl\u0131 \u015fekilde g\xf6steriliyor.","The recording map is always course-up \u2014 north-up toggle removed; the location button only recenters. The top duration/distance/elevation box uses thin separators and its own columns so values no longer collide on narrow screens.")
B.TV=new A.X("v1.3.47 beta","2026-08-09","Ekran kapal\u0131 / uyku modunda GPS kayd\u0131n\u0131n kesilmesine k\xf6k \xe7\xf6z\xfcm: konum art\u0131k Flutter/geolocator ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 yerine Android native foreground serviste toplan\u0131yor (Fused Location + wake lock + kal\u0131c\u0131 bildirim). Flutter motoru Doze ile donsa bile noktalar native tampona yaz\u0131l\u0131yor; kay\u0131t bitince rota bundan \xfcretiliyor.","Root fix for GPS cutting out with the screen off: location is collected in an Android native foreground service (Fused Location + wake lock + persistent notification) instead of Flutter/geolocator. Points go to a native buffer even if the Flutter engine freezes in Doze; the route is built from that on finish.")
B.UI=new A.X("v1.3.46 beta","2026-08-09","Arka planda / ekran kilitliyken GPS kayd\u0131n\u0131n kesilmesi i\xe7in \xf6nemli d\xfczeltme: eski LocationManager yolu modern Android'de ekran kapan\u0131nca ~60 sn i\xe7inde GPS'i durdurabiliyordu; kay\u0131t art\u0131k Fused Location + kal\u0131c\u0131 bildirim + 5 sn aral\u0131kl\u0131 g\xfcncelleme kullan\u0131yor. \"Her zaman izin ver\" yoksa kay\u0131t ba\u015flam\u0131yor (Ayarlar'a y\xf6nlendirir); pil muafiyeti de kay\u0131ttan \xf6nce isteniyor.","Background / lock-screen GPS drop: the old LocationManager path could stop GPS ~60 s after the screen off. Recording now uses Fused Location + a persistent notification + 5 s updates. Recording will not start without \u201cAllow all the time\u201d (opens Settings); battery exemption is requested first.")
B.SN=new A.X("v1.3.45 beta","2026-08-08","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki harita art\u0131k normal navigasyon uygulamalar\u0131 gibi varsay\u0131lan olarak y\xf6n-takip (course-up) modunda a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor - harita, gidilen y\xf6ne g\xf6re d\xf6n\xfcyor. Konum tu\u015funa basarak kuzey-sabit moda ge\xe7ilebiliyor; hangi mod se\xe7iliyse bir sonraki kay\u0131tta da o hat\u0131rlan\u0131yor.","The recording map opens course-up like a normal navigation app. The location button switches to north-up; the chosen mode is remembered for the next recording.")
B.Ty=new A.X("v1.3.44 beta","2026-08-05",'Ekran kilitliyken GPS kayd\u0131n\u0131n kesilmesi sorununun ger\xe7ek k\xf6k nedeni bulundu: uygulama Android\'den hi\xe7bir zaman "her zaman" (arka planda) konum izni istemiyordu - bu y\xfczden telefonun Ayarlar ekran\u0131nda bu se\xe7enek hi\xe7 g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyordu, sadece "uygulama kullan\u0131l\u0131rken" se\xe7ilebiliyordu, pil izni/otomatik ba\u015flatma ne kadar a\xe7\u0131k olursa olsun bu durumda ekran kilitlenince konum kesiliyordu. Art\u0131k bu izin de isteniyor; kay\u0131t ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131nda h\xe2l\xe2 sadece "kullan\u0131l\u0131rken" izni varsa, Ayarlar\'\u0131 a\xe7man\u0131z i\xe7in bir uyar\u0131 \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor. Ayarlar ekran\u0131na da "Konum: Her zaman izin ver" k\u0131sayolu eklendi.',"Root cause of lock-screen GPS drop: the app never asked Android for \u201callow all the time\u201d, so that option never appeared in Settings \u2014 only \u201cwhile using the app\u201d, which stops location when locked no matter the battery settings. That permission is now requested; if recording starts with only \u201cwhile using\u201d, a prompt opens Settings. Settings also has a \u201cLocation: Allow all the time\u201d shortcut.")
B.UJ=new A.X("v1.3.43 beta","2026-08-05","Ekran kilitliyken GPS kayd\u0131n\u0131n kesilmesi sorunu i\xe7in ek bir d\xfczeltme: pil optimizasyonu muafiyeti ve otomatik ba\u015flatma izni verilmesine ra\u011fmen baz\u0131 telefonlarda (Xiaomi/MIUI do\u011fruland\u0131) kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda konum g\xfcncellemeleri h\xe2l\xe2 duruyordu - rota haritada d\xfcz bir \xe7izgiyle \"atl\u0131yordu\". Konum art\u0131k Google Play Servisleri'nin FusedLocationProviderClient'\u0131 yerine Android'in kendi GPS sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131s\u0131 (LocationManager) \xfczerinden al\u0131n\u0131yor; \xfcretici pil y\xf6neticileri genellikle Play Servisleri konumunu \xe7ok daha agresif k\u0131s\u0131tl\u0131yor.","Further lock-screen GPS fix: even with battery exemption and autostart, some phones (Xiaomi/MIUI confirmed) still stopped updates \u2014 the track jumped as a straight line. Location now uses Android\u2019s own LocationManager instead of FusedLocationProviderClient; OEM battery managers usually throttle Play Services harder.")
B.SL=new A.X("v1.3.42 beta","2026-08-05","\xd6nemli d\xfczeltme: baz\u0131 telefonlarda ara\xe7 ikonunun rengi t\xfcm ekran\u0131 kapl\u0131yordu (harita ve Ara\xe7 ikonu se\xe7im ekran\u0131 dahil) - \xe7al\u0131\u015fma zaman\u0131nda renklendirme yerine, her renk se\xe7ene\u011fi art\u0131k \xf6nceden haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015f ayr\u0131 bir g\xf6rsel olarak geliyor, sorun k\xf6kten \xe7\xf6z\xfcld\xfc. Uydu say\u0131s\u0131 g\xf6stergesi art\u0131k ba\u011flant\u0131 yeterliyken (4+ uydu) ye\u015fil, azken k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 renkte g\xf6steriliyor.","Important: on some phones the vehicle-icon color flooded the whole screen (map and picker). Runtime tinting is gone; each color is a pre-made asset. Satellite-count badge is green at 4+ satellites, red when fewer.")
B.UQ=new A.X("v1.3.41 beta","2026-08-05",'Ara\xe7 ve motor haritada art\u0131k emoji yerine ger\xe7ek, \xfcstten \xe7ekilmi\u015f ara\xe7 foto\u011fraflar\u0131yla g\xf6steriliyor - her ikisi i\xe7in de 5 renk ve 5 \xf6l\xe7ek se\xe7ene\u011fi var (Ayarlar > Ara\xe7 ikonu). Ana ekrandaki kay\u0131t tu\u015funun alt\u0131nda ve kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda, ba\u011fl\u0131 GPS uydu say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6steren k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir rozet eklendi; Ayarlar > "Uydu say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 g\xf6ster" ile istenirse kapat\u0131labilir.',"Car and motorcycle markers are real top-down photos instead of emoji \u2014 5 colors and 5 scales each (Settings \u2192 Vehicle icon). A small connected-satellite badge sits under the home record button and on the recording screen; Settings \u2192 \u201cShow satellite count\u201d can hide it.")
B.Tk=new A.X("v1.3.40 beta","2026-08-05",'\xd6nemli d\xfczeltme: baz\u0131 telefon \xfcreticilerinin (Xiaomi/MIUI, Oppo/ColorOS, Samsung/OneUI gibi) ek pil k\u0131s\u0131tlamalar\u0131 y\xfcz\xfcnden, ekran kapan\u0131nca kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda GPS g\xfcncellemeleri duruyordu - bu foreground servis d\u0131\u015f\u0131nda, \xfcretici bazl\u0131 ek bir k\u0131s\u0131tlama. Art\u0131k kay\u0131t ba\u015flarken uygulamay\u0131 pil optimizasyonundan muaf tutman\u0131z i\xe7in sistem izni isteniyor; Ayarlar > "Arka planda GPS izni" ile istedi\u011finiz zaman tekrar a\xe7abilirsiniz.',"Important: extra OEM battery limits (Xiaomi/MIUI, Oppo/ColorOS, Samsung/OneUI) could stop GPS updates when the screen turned off, beyond the foreground service. Recording now asks to exempt the app from battery optimization; Settings \u2192 \u201cBackground GPS permission\u201d can open that again.")
B.SF=new A.X("v1.3.39 beta","2026-08-05",'Oto-duraklama hassasiyeti d\xfczeltildi: art\u0131k tekil GPS s\u0131\xe7ramalar\u0131 yerine son birka\xe7 okuman\u0131n ortalamas\u0131na g\xf6re karar veriyor, durma/kalkma e\u015fikleri de ayr\u0131 tutuldu (titreme olmas\u0131n diye). Ara\xe7 ve motor i\u015faret\xe7ileri renkli rozetli, ger\xe7ek emoji g\xf6rsellerine ge\xe7ti. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki konum i\u015faret\xe7isine, MotionX-GPS\'teki gibi GPS y\xf6n\xfcn\xfc g\xf6steren yar\u0131 saydam bir "y\xf6n konisi" eklendi - kuzey-sabit moddayken de y\xf6n art\u0131k g\xf6r\xfclebiliyor.',"Auto-pause uses an average of recent readings instead of a single GPS hop, with separate stop/start thresholds to avoid flicker. Vehicle markers are colored-badge real emoji images. The recording location marker has a translucent heading cone like MotionX-GPS so direction is visible in north-up too.")
B.U1=new A.X("v1.3.38 beta","2026-08-05",'Ana ekrandaki kay\u0131t d\xfc\u011fmesi k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcld\xfc. Alt\u0131nda GPS durumu k\u0131sa s\xfcre g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor: GPS yoksa offline kay\u0131t uyar\u0131s\u0131, GPS gelince do\u011fruluk bilgisiyle birlikte "haz\u0131r" mesaj\u0131 (birka\xe7 saniye sonra kaybolur, t\u0131klanamaz).',"Home record button is smaller. GPS status flashes under it briefly: offline-recording hint if there is no GPS, then a \u201cready\u201d message with accuracy (disappears after a few seconds, not tappable).")
B.Uz=new A.X("v1.3.37 beta","2026-08-04","\xd6nemli d\xfczeltme: v1.3.34'te Android Auto eklenirken MainActivity'nin Flutter motorunu ele al\u0131\u015f \u015fekli de\u011fi\u015fmi\u015fti, bu da Android'de arka planda (uygulama k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcl\xfcnce) konum al\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131 bozmu\u015ftu - geri al\u0131nd\u0131, arka plan takibi eskisi gibi \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor. Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki ara\xe7 ikonu art\u0131k her zaman yukar\u0131 bak\u0131yor; kuzey-sabit moddayken de art\u0131k kendi etraf\u0131nda d\xf6nm\xfcyor.","Important: adding Android Auto in v1.3.34 changed how MainActivity owns the Flutter engine and broke background location when the app was minimized. Reverted; background tracking works as before. The recording vehicle icon always points up and no longer spins in place in north-up.")
B.SZ=new A.X("v1.3.36 beta","2026-08-04","REC g\xf6stergesi art\u0131k ba\u011f\u0131ms\u0131z bir kutu olarak ekran\u0131n \xfcst\xfcnde y\xfczm\xfcyor - ayarlar ikonunun hemen sa\u011f\u0131nda, \xfcst \xe7ubuktaki di\u011fer ikonlarla ayn\u0131 sat\u0131rda, k\xfc\xe7\xfck yan\u0131p s\xf6nen bir ikon olarak duruyor (\xf6nceden ayarlar ikonunun \xfcst\xfcne biniyordu). Rota haritas\u0131n\u0131n \xfcst \xe7ubu\u011fundaki foto ekleme ikonu kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131 - ekran\u0131n alt\u0131ndaki foto/video \u015feridinde zaten ayn\u0131 i\u015fi yapan bir d\xfc\u011fme var.","The REC indicator is no longer a floating box \u2014 it sits as a small blinking icon to the right of Settings on the same top-bar row (it used to overlap Settings). The route-map top-bar add-photo icon is gone; the bottom photo/video strip already has that action.")
B.RZ=new A.X("v1.3.35 beta","2026-08-04","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki konum tu\u015fu art\u0131k ger\xe7ek bir mod anahtar\u0131: zaten ortalanm\u0131\u015fken her bas\u0131\u015f kuzey-sabit (harita hi\xe7 d\xf6nmez, ara\xe7 ikonu gitti\u011fi y\xf6n\xfc g\xf6sterecek \u015fekilde d\xf6ner) ile y\xf6n-takip (harita gitti\u011finiz y\xf6ne d\xf6ner, ara\xe7 ikonu hep yukar\u0131 bakar) aras\u0131nda ge\xe7i\u015f yap\u0131yor. REC g\xf6stergesi art\u0131k ekran\u0131n hemen k\xf6\u015fesinde, t\xfcm kutusuyla yan\u0131p s\xf6nerek duruyor - fark edilmesi daha kolay.","The recording location button is a real mode switch: when already centered, each tap toggles north-up (map still, vehicle rotates) and course-up (map turns, vehicle stays up). REC blinks as a full box in the corner so it is easier to see.")
B.RA=new A.X("v1.3.34 beta","2026-08-04","Android Auto deste\u011fi eklendi: telefonda ba\u015flat\u0131lan bir kay\u0131t, araban\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan da g\xf6r\xfcl\xfcp kontrol edilebiliyor - h\u0131z, s\xfcre, mesafe orada da g\xf6steriliyor; duraklat/devam et ve bitir d\xfc\u011fmeleri \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yor (s\xfcr\xfc\u015f g\xfcvenli\u011fi kurallar\u0131 gere\u011fi araba ekran\u0131ndan isim yaz\u0131lam\u0131yor, kay\u0131t otomatik bir isimle kaydediliyor). Telefon uygulamas\u0131n\u0131n en az bir kez a\xe7\u0131lm\u0131\u015f olmas\u0131 yeterli. CarPlay i\xe7in Apple'dan \xf6zel izin (entitlement) gerekiyor, hen\xfcz eklenmedi.","Android Auto: a recording started on the phone can be watched and controlled on the car screen \u2014 speed, time, distance; pause/resume and finish work (no naming while driving; it saves under an auto name). The phone app must have been opened at least once. CarPlay needs an Apple entitlement and is not included yet.")
B.UU=new A.X("v1.3.33 beta","2026-08-04",'\xd6nemli d\xfczeltme: v1.3.32\'de kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki h\u0131z/s\xfcre/mesafe/y\xfckseklik kutusu bir d\xfczen hatas\u0131 y\xfcz\xfcnden hi\xe7 g\xf6r\xfcnm\xfcyordu - d\xfczeltildi. REC g\xf6stergesi sa\u011f \xfcst k\xf6\u015feye ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131, art\u0131k k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 yan\u0131p s\xf6n\xfcyor ve "REC" yaz\u0131s\u0131 i\xe7eriyor. Kay\u0131t s\xfcrerken ana ekrandaki b\xfcy\xfck "kay\u0131t yap" d\xfc\u011fmesi art\u0131k gizleniyor - geri d\xf6nmek i\xe7in REC g\xf6stergesine dokunun.',"Important: v1.3.32 hid the recording speed/time/distance/elevation box due to a layout bug \u2014 fixed. REC moved to the top-right, blinks red and says \u201cREC\u201d. While recording, the large home record button is hidden \u2014 tap REC to return.")
B.RQ=new A.X("v1.3.32 beta","2026-08-04",'Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 yenilendi: h\u0131z b\xfcy\xfck punto ile \xf6ne \xe7\u0131kar\u0131ld\u0131, s\xfcre/mesafe/y\xfckseklik yan\u0131nda k\xfc\xe7\xfck g\xf6steriliyor, oto-duraklama rozeti b\xfcy\xfct\xfcld\xfc. Geri tu\u015fu art\u0131k kayd\u0131 durdurmuyor - kay\u0131t arka planda s\xfcrerken ekran kenar\u0131nda bir REC d\xfc\u011fmesi beliriyor, dokununca kay\u0131t ekran\u0131na d\xf6n\xfcl\xfcyor. Kay\u0131t ba\u015flarken ara\xe7 ekran\u0131n ortas\u0131nda ba\u015fl\u0131yor; konum tu\u015funa 2. kez bas\u0131nca harita kuzeye d\xf6n\xfcyor. Rota \xf6zetine net s\xfcr\xfc\u015f s\xfcresi, toplam s\xfcre ve pil ba\u015flang\u0131\xe7/biti\u015f y\xfczdesi eklendi. Ayarlar > Ara\xe7 ikonu ile haritadaki "buraday\u0131m" i\u015faretini motosiklet veya araba simgesiyle (5\'er \xf6l\xe7ek/renk se\xe7ene\u011fi) de\u011fi\u015ftirebilirsiniz.',"Recording screen refreshed: large speed, smaller time/distance/elevation beside it, bigger auto-pause badge. Back no longer stops the recording \u2014 a REC button stays on the screen edge and returns you. The vehicle starts centered; a second tap on location resets north. Route overview adds net riding time, total time and start/end battery. Settings \u2192 Vehicle icon can replace the \u201cI am here\u201d mark with a motorcycle or car (5 scales/colors each).")
B.UA=new A.X("v1.3.31 beta","2026-08-04","Dil ikonu yerine Ayarlar ikonu geldi; i\xe7ine Dil, Yard\u0131m (t\xfcm \xf6zelliklerin detayl\u0131 anlat\u0131m\u0131) ve Hakk\u0131nda (g\xfcncel s\xfcr\xfcm + s\xfcr\xfcm ge\xe7mi\u015fi) b\xf6l\xfcmleri eklendi. Ekranda dola\u015fan versiyon rozeti kald\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131.","The language icon is now a Settings icon with Language, Help (full feature write-up) and About (current version + history). The floating version badge is gone.")
B.UL=new A.X("v1.3.30 beta","2026-08-03","Versiyon etiketi art\u0131k ekran\u0131n sol kenar\u0131n\u0131n ortas\u0131nda - foto\u011fraf/video \u015feridiyle sol alt k\xf6\u015fede \xfcst \xfcste binmiyordu.","The version label sits mid-left on the screen so it no longer overlaps the photo/video strip in the bottom-left corner.")
B.UW=new A.X("v1.3.29 beta","2026-08-03","Rota isminin alt\u0131nda art\u0131k ay\u0131n ve y\u0131l\u0131n (g\xfcn olmadan) yazd\u0131\u011f\u0131 bir tarih g\xf6steriliyor. Dosya ad\u0131ndan gelen rota isimlerinin sonundaki gereksiz alt \xe7izgi/tire gibi karakterler art\u0131k otomatik temizleniyor.","Under the route name, month and year are shown (no day). Trailing underscores/dashes from file-based names are stripped automatically.")
B.V1=new A.X("v1.3.28 beta","2026-08-03","Foto\u011fraf/video ekleme art\u0131k tek noktadan (galeriden ikisi birden se\xe7ilebiliyor). Rota ad\u0131 art\u0131k \xfcst \xe7ubu\u011fun alt\u0131nda tam geni\u015flikte, kesilmeden g\xf6z\xfck\xfcyor. Mola ve geceleme i\u015faretleri art\u0131k rota ilk a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda gizli - istenirse d\xfc\u011fmeyle a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor.","Adding photos/videos is one control (gallery can pick both). The route name is full-width under the app bar, not clipped. Stop and overnight markers start hidden and can be shown with a button.")
B.UF=new A.X("v1.3.27 beta","2026-08-02","Rotalara art\u0131k video da eklenebiliyor (kameradan veya galeriden). Foto\u011fraf veya videoda konum bilgisi bulunamazsa, haritada nereye ait oldu\u011funu elle i\u015faretleyebiliyorsunuz.","Routes can include video (camera or gallery). If a photo or video has no location, you can mark where it belongs on the map.")
B.RL=new A.X("v1.3.26 beta","2026-08-02",'\u0130ki d\xfczeltme: kayda ba\u015flarken harita art\u0131k yanl\u0131\u015f bir konuma z\u0131plam\u0131yor; ve "G\xfcncelle" d\xfc\u011fmesi art\u0131k APK\'y\u0131 indirip do\u011frudan kurulum ekran\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7\u0131yor (\xf6nceden sadece indiriyordu, kurmak i\xe7in ayr\u0131ca dosyay\u0131 bulup a\xe7mak gerekiyordu).',"Two fixes: starting a recording no longer jumps the map to the wrong place; Update now downloads the APK and opens the installer (it previously only downloaded, and you had to find the file).")
B.TO=new A.X("v1.3.25 beta","2026-08-02","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131nda haritay\u0131 elle ba\u015fka bir yere s\xfcr\xfckledi\u011finizde art\u0131k konumunuza geri d\xf6nmek i\xe7in bir d\xfc\u011fme \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor - \xf6nceden harita her GPS g\xfcncellemesinde otomatik olarak eski yerine d\xf6n\xfcyordu.","After you pan the recording map, a button appears to return to your location \u2014 the map used to snap back on every GPS update.")
B.RN=new A.X("v1.3.24 beta","2026-08-02","Kay\u0131t ekran\u0131 art\u0131k a\xe7\u0131l\u0131r a\xe7\u0131lmaz mevcut konumunuzu g\xf6steriyor - \xf6nceden kay\u0131t ba\u015flayana kadar (ve ilk GPS noktas\u0131 gelene kadar) sabit bir varsay\u0131lan konumda kal\u0131yordu.","The recording screen shows your current location as soon as it opens \u2014 it used to stay on a fixed default until recording started and the first GPS point arrived.")
B.Ud=new A.X("v1.3.23 beta","2026-08-02",'Android uygulamas\u0131 art\u0131k a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta yeni bir s\xfcr\xfcm olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 GitHub\'dan sessizce kontrol ediyor; varsa haritan\u0131n \xfcst\xfcnde bir "G\xfcncelle" d\xfc\u011fmesi \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor ve tek dokunu\u015fla indirme sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\xe7\u0131yor.',"The Android app silently checks GitHub for a new version on launch; if one exists, an Update button appears above the map and one tap opens the download page.")
B.Tq=new A.X("v1.3.22 beta","2026-08-02",'Android uygulamas\u0131nda kay\u0131t ekran\u0131ndaki "sadece \xf6n planda s\xfcrer" uyar\u0131s\u0131 art\u0131k yanl\u0131\u015ft\u0131 - Android\'de arka planda da kaydetti\u011fini do\u011fru \u015fekilde belirtiyor (web s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcnde uyar\u0131 h\xe2l\xe2 ge\xe7erli).',"The Android recording \u201cforeground only\u201d warning was wrong \u2014 it now correctly says recording continues in the background (the web warning still applies).")
B.UG=new A.X("v1.3.21 beta","2026-08-02","Rota haritas\u0131na foto\u011fraf ekleyebilme \xf6zelli\u011fi geldi: kameradan \xe7ekip veya galeriden se\xe7ip ekleyebilirsiniz. Konum bilgisi olan foto\u011fraflar haritada da k\xfc\xe7\xfck bir i\u015faret olarak g\xf6steriliyor.","You can add photos to a route map from the camera or gallery. Photos with location also show as a small mark on the map.")
B.SG=new A.X("v1.3.20 beta","2026-08-02","Android taraf\u0131nda kay\u0131t art\u0131k arka planda (uygulama k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfclse bile) bir bildirimle birlikte devam edebiliyor. Web taraf\u0131 de\u011fi\u015fmedi - h\xe2l\xe2 sekme \xf6n plandayken kaydediyor.","On Android, recording can continue in the background (even if the app is minimized) with a notification. Web is unchanged \u2014 still only while the tab is in front.")
B.UX=new A.X("v1.3.19 beta","2026-08-02","Rota haritas\u0131na geri d\xf6n\xfc\u015f oku eklendi (eksikti) ve rota listesinden bir rotaya girmek art\u0131k ge\xe7mi\u015fte liste ekran\u0131n\u0131 b\u0131rakm\u0131yor - b\xf6ylece geri d\xf6nmek tek dokunu\u015fla ana ekrana ula\u015f\u0131yor.","A back arrow was added on the route map (it was missing), and opening a route from the list no longer leaves the list in history \u2014 one back goes to Home.")
B.SB=new A.X("v1.3.18 beta","2026-07-30","Ana ekrana b\xfcy\xfck bir kay\u0131t d\xfc\u011fmesi eklendi. Kay\u0131t s\u0131ras\u0131nda art\u0131k h\u0131z ve y\xfckseklik de \xfcstte g\xf6steriliyor; uzun s\xfcre dursan\u0131z kay\u0131t otomatik olarak durakl\u0131yor, hareket edince kendili\u011finden devam ediyor.","A large record button on Home. While recording, speed and elevation also show at the top; staying still for a long time auto-pauses, and movement resumes it.")
B.Sr=new A.X("v1.3.17 beta","2026-07-30","A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f haritas\u0131 art\u0131k konumunuz bulundu\u011funda yak\u0131n plana zum yapm\u0131yor; geni\u015f, b\xf6lgesel bir g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcmde kal\u0131yor.","The launch map no longer zooms in tight when your location is found; it stays on a wide regional view.")
B.S4=new A.X("v1.3.16 beta","2026-07-30","Uygulama art\u0131k, konumunuzu g\xf6steren canl\u0131 bir haritayla a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor. Kaydetti\u011finiz rotalara sol \xfcstteki liste ikonundan ula\u015fabilirsiniz.","The app now opens on a live map of your location. Saved routes are behind the top-left list icon.")
B.Tx=new A.X("v1.3.15 beta","2026-07-28","Rota listesindeki k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 kay\u0131t d\xfc\u011fmesiyle art\u0131k GPS ile canl\u0131 rota kayd\u0131 yapabilirsiniz. Not: bu, sadece sekme \xf6n planda ve ekran a\xe7\u0131kken \xe7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r - arka planda devam etmez.","The red record button on the route list starts a live GPS recording. Note: this only runs while the tab is in front and the screen is on \u2014 it does not continue in the background.")
B.Uv=new A.X("v1.3.14 beta","2026-07-28","Birden fazla rotay\u0131 ayn\u0131 haritada g\xf6sterirken de, haritay\u0131 d\xf6nd\xfcrd\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfczde art\u0131k kuzeye d\xf6n pusulas\u0131 \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor.","Showing several routes on one map now also offers the north-up compass when you rotate the map.")
B.TE=new A.X("v1.3.13 beta","2026-07-28",'Harita ekran\u0131ndaki "Rotalar" penceresine de \xe7oklu se\xe7im eklendi: oradan da birden fazla rotay\u0131 i\u015faretleyip ayn\u0131 haritada g\xf6sterebilirsiniz.',"The map screen\u2019s \u201cRoutes\u201d sheet also has multi-select: pick several routes there and show them on the same map.")
B.T9=new A.X("v1.3.12 beta","2026-07-28","\xdcst \xe7ubuktaki \xe7oklu se\xe7im ikonu, sadece 2+ rota varken de\u011fil, tek rota varken de art\u0131k g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcyor.","The app-bar multi-select icon is visible even when there is only one route, not only at 2+.")
B.Sz=new A.X("v1.3.11 beta","2026-07-27",'Rota listesinde art\u0131k \xe7oklu se\xe7im var (\xfcst \xe7ubuktaki se\xe7im ikonu): birden fazla rotay\u0131 i\u015faretleyip "Haritada g\xf6ster" ile hepsini ayn\u0131 haritada, farkl\u0131 renklerle \xfcst \xfcste g\xf6rebilirsiniz.',"The route list has multi-select (app-bar icon): pick several routes and \u201cShow on map\u201d stacks them in different colors.")
B.U4=new A.X("v1.3.10 beta","2026-07-27","Topografik harita katman\u0131 art\u0131k Esri altyap\u0131s\u0131ndan geliyor - OpenTopoMap bazen baz\u0131 kareleri (gri kutular) hi\xe7 y\xfcklemiyordu.","The topographic layer now comes from Esri \u2014 OpenTopoMap sometimes never loaded some tiles (grey boxes).")
B.UR=new A.X("v1.3.9 beta","2026-07-27","Sol alttaki versiyon yaz\u0131s\u0131na dokununca art\u0131k t\xfcm s\xfcr\xfcm ge\xe7mi\u015fini (hangi tarihte ne eklendi\u011fini) g\xf6steren bir liste a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor.","Tapping the bottom-left version label opens the full version history (what landed on which date).")
B.Ry=new A.X("v1.3.8 beta","2026-07-27","Geceleme noktalar\u0131 art\u0131k g\xfcn de\u011fi\u015fiminin oldu\u011fu yere g\xf6re i\u015faretleniyor, s\xfcre e\u015fi\u011fine g\xf6re de\u011fil - bu sayede hi\xe7bir geceleme atlanm\u0131yor.","Overnight stays are marked at the calendar-day change, not by a duration threshold \u2014 none are skipped.")
B.UV=new A.X("v1.3.7 beta","2026-07-27","Haritada art\u0131k gecelemeler (4 saat+ s\xfcren duraklar) molalardan farkl\u0131 bir renk ve ikonla g\xf6steriliyor - ayn\u0131 g\xf6ster/gizle d\xfc\u011fmesiyle.","Overnight stays (stops of 4+ hours) use a different color and icon from regular stops \u2014 same show/hide button.")
B.Ui=new A.X("v1.3.6 beta","2026-07-27","Bazen harita \xfczerinde y\xfcklenmeyip gri kalan kareler art\u0131k birka\xe7 saniye i\xe7inde otomatik olarak yeniden y\xfckleniyor.","Tiles that stay grey on the map now retry automatically after a few seconds.")
B.RV=new A.X("v1.3.5 beta","2026-07-27","Haritadaki mola noktalar\u0131 art\u0131k iste\u011fe ba\u011fl\u0131: sa\u011f alttaki mola d\xfc\u011fmesiyle a\xe7\u0131p kapatabilirsiniz.","Stop markers on the map are optional: toggle them with the bottom-right stop button.")
B.RI=new A.X("v1.3.4 beta","2026-07-27","Tespit edilen molalar art\u0131k haritada turuncu bir noktayla i\u015faretleniyor; noktaya dokununca o konuma yak\u0131nla\u015f\u0131l\u0131yor.","Detected stops are marked with an orange dot on the map; tapping one zooms to that place.")
B.RC=new A.X("v1.3.3 beta","2026-07-27","Haritay\u0131 iki parmakla d\xf6nd\xfcrd\xfc\u011f\xfcn\xfczde art\u0131k sa\u011f altta bir pusula d\xfc\u011fmesi \xe7\u0131k\u0131yor; ona dokununca harita kuzeye g\xf6re yeniden hizalan\u0131yor.","Two-finger rotating the map now shows a bottom-right compass; tap it to realign north.")
B.U8=new A.X("v1.3.2 beta","2026-07-27","Dil se\xe7ici art\u0131k harita ekran\u0131nda da mevcut (\xfcst \xe7ubu\u011fun sa\u011f\u0131nda, d\xfcnya simgesi). Rota listesi ekran\u0131ndaki dil simgesi h\xe2l\xe2 orada.","The language picker is also on the map screen (globe on the right of the app bar). The route-list language icon is still there.")
B.TH=new A.X("v0.4.1 beta","2026-07-27","\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck rotalarda art\u0131k haritada hangi g\xfcnlerin g\xf6sterilece\u011fini se\xe7ebilirsiniz (sadece 1. g\xfcn, ya da 3. ve 7. g\xfcnler gibi) - sa\u011f alttaki filtre d\xfc\u011fmesinden.","On multi-day routes you can choose which days to show on the map (only day 1, or days 3 and 7, etc.) from the bottom-right filter.")
B.Uc=new A.X("v0.4.0 beta","2026-07-27","Uygulama art\u0131k T\xfcrk\xe7e, \u0130ngilizce ve Almanca dillerinde kullan\u0131labiliyor. Sa\u011f \xfcstteki dil simgesinden dilinizi se\xe7ebilirsiniz.","The app is available in Turkish, English and German. Pick your language from the top-right language icon.")
B.SW=new A.X("v0.3.2 beta","2026-07-27",'\xc7ok g\xfcnl\xfck rotalar art\u0131k haritada her g\xfcn farkl\u0131 bir renkle \xe7iziliyor. Analizde yeni "G\xfcnl\xfck" sekmesi: her g\xfcn i\xe7in mesafe, s\xfcr\xfc\u015f/mola s\xfcresi, maksimum irtifa, t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f ve o g\xfcn ge\xe7ilen \xfclkeler.',"Multi-day routes are drawn in a different color per day. New Analysis \u201cDaily\u201d tab: each day\u2019s distance, riding/rest time, max altitude, climb and countries.")
B.U0=new A.X("v0.3.0 beta","2026-07-27","Haritada katman se\xe7imi eklendi: sa\u011f alttaki katman ikonuna basarak Sokak, Sade/Siyasi, Koyu, Uydu ve Topografik harita t\xfcrleri aras\u0131nda ge\xe7i\u015f yapabilirsin. Se\xe7imin hat\u0131rlan\u0131r.","Map layer picker: tap the bottom-right layers icon to switch Street, Clean/Political, Dark, Satellite and Topographic. Your choice is remembered.")
B.TB=new A.X("v0.2.9 beta","2026-07-27",'\u0130\xe7e aktar\u0131lan rotan\u0131n ismi art\u0131k dosya ad\u0131n\u0131 \xf6nceliyor - GPX/KML dosyas\u0131n\u0131n i\xe7ine g\xf6m\xfcl\xfc genel isimler (\xf6r. "Track 219") art\u0131k senin verdi\u011fin dosya ad\u0131n\u0131n \xf6n\xfcne ge\xe7miyor.',"An imported route\u2019s name prefers the file name \u2014 generic names embedded in the GPX/KML (e.g. \u201cTrack 219\u201d) no longer override the name you gave the file.")
B.Uj=new A.X("v0.2.8 beta","2026-07-27","GitHub Pages derlemesinde service worker kapat\u0131ld\u0131; eski s\xfcr\xfcm tak\u0131l\u0131 kalmas\u0131n diye. H\xe2l\xe2 eski badge g\xf6r\xfcrsen: site verilerini temizle veya gizli pencerede a\xe7.","The GitHub Pages build disables the service worker so an old version does not stick. If you still see an old badge: clear site data or open a private window.")
B.Sx=new A.X("v0.2.7 beta","2026-07-27","KML ayr\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 g\xfc\xe7lendirildi: i\xe7 i\xe7e Folder/MultiGeometry, birden fazla LineString, gx:Track ve waypoint'ler. run_dev_web.bat port 8080'i ba\u015flamadan \xf6nce temizler.","KML parser strengthened: nested Folder/MultiGeometry, several LineStrings, gx:Track and waypoints. run_dev_web.bat clears port 8080 before starting.")
B.V5=new A.X("v0.2.4 beta","2026-07-27","Web s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc GitHub Pages \xfczerinde yay\u0131nda: https://alid67-git.github.io/RideAtlas/ \u2014 GPX'ler taray\u0131c\u0131da saklan\u0131r (cihaz ba\u015f\u0131na). Analiz sekmeleri: \xd6zet, Y\xfckseklik, G\xfczerg\xe2h, Molalar, Hava.","Web build is live on GitHub Pages: https://alid67-git.github.io/RideAtlas/ \u2014 GPX files stay in the browser (per device). Analysis tabs: Overview, Elevation, Route, Stops, Weather.")
B.V_=new A.X("v0.2.2 beta","2026-07-27","GitHub Actions ile GitHub Pages'e otomatik yay\u0131nlama eklendi - depo public yap\u0131l\u0131p Pages a\xe7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda, her push sonras\u0131 site birka\xe7 dakika i\xe7inde otomatik g\xfcncellenecek.","GitHub Actions publishes to GitHub Pages automatically \u2014 once the repo is public and Pages is on, each push updates the site within a few minutes.")
B.TY=new A.X("v0.2.1 beta","2026-07-25","build_web.bat art\u0131k --pwa-strategy=none ile derliyor: Flutter'\u0131n service worker \xf6nbelleklemesi kapat\u0131ld\u0131, b\xf6ylece yeni bir derleme sonras\u0131 eski s\xfcr\xfcm\xfcn taray\u0131c\u0131da tak\u0131l\u0131 kalmas\u0131 sorunu \xe7\xf6z\xfcl\xfcyor.","build_web.bat now builds with --pwa-strategy=none: Flutter\u2019s service-worker cache is off so a new build no longer leaves the old version stuck in the browser.")
B.Uk=new A.X("v0.2.0 beta","2026-07-25","KML deste\u011fi eklendi: art\u0131k .gpx yan\u0131nda .kml dosyalar\u0131 da i\xe7e aktar\u0131labiliyor. Payla\u015f butonuna bas\u0131nca art\u0131k GPX mi KML mi istedi\u011fin soruluyor. Haritan\u0131n ilk a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta bo\u015f gelme sorununa y\xf6nelik ek bir d\xfczeltme daha yap\u0131ld\u0131.","KML support: .kml files import next to .gpx. Share asks GPX or KML. Extra fix for the map opening blank.")
B.St=new A.X("v0.1.12 beta","2026-07-25",'"GPX \u0130\xe7e Aktar" butonu sadece rota listesi ekran\u0131nda vard\u0131; \u015fimdi haritadaki "Rotalar" penceresine de eklendi, listeye d\xf6nmeden yeni GPX ekleyebilirsin.',"\u201cImport GPX\u201d lived only on the route list; it is also on the map \u201cRoutes\u201d sheet so you can add a GPX without going back to the list.")
B.S0=new A.X("v0.1.11 beta","2026-07-25",'build_web.bat d\xfczeltildi: "call" eksikti, bu y\xfczden pub get sonras\u0131 derleme ad\u0131m\u0131 hi\xe7 \xe7al\u0131\u015fm\u0131yordu.',"build_web.bat fixed: missing \u201ccall\u201d meant the build step never ran after pub get.")
B.T3=new A.X("v0.1.10","2026-07-25","A\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015f art\u0131k \xe7ok daha h\u0131zl\u0131: build_web.bat ile bir kez derleyip run_web.bat ile an\u0131nda a\xe7abilirsin (her seferinde yeniden derlemiyor).","Launch is much faster: build once with build_web.bat and open instantly with run_web.bat (no rebuild every time).")
B.Sl=new A.X("v0.1.9","2026-07-25","Harita art\u0131k ilk a\xe7\u0131l\u0131\u015fta da tam y\xfckleniyor (\xf6nceden yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131rma butonuna basmak gerekiyordu). Analiz butonu \xfcst \xe7ubu\u011fa ta\u015f\u0131nd\u0131. Rota de\u011fi\u015ftirme penceresinden art\u0131k yeniden adland\u0131rma/silme de yap\u0131labiliyor.","The map now fully loads on first open (you used to have to tap zoom). Analysis moved to the app bar. The switch-route sheet can also rename/delete.")
B.Ul=new A.X("v0.1.8","2026-07-25","Analiz paneli art\u0131k ortada, derli toplu bir pencere olarak a\xe7\u0131l\u0131yor (alttan a\xe7\u0131lan panel yerine). Harita ekran\u0131ndaki liste butonu da art\u0131k ge\xe7erli haritay\u0131 kapatmadan di\u011fer rotalar\u0131n listesini ortada bir pencerede a\xe7\u0131yor.","The analysis panel opens as a compact centered window (not a bottom sheet). The map list button opens other routes in a centered sheet without closing the current map.")
B.Sq=new A.X("v0.1.7","2026-07-25","Haritaya yak\u0131nla\u015ft\u0131rma/uzakla\u015ft\u0131rma butonlar\u0131 eklendi. Analiz paneli k\xfc\xe7\xfclt\xfcld\xfc ve min/maks irtifa art\u0131k ayr\u0131 kartlarda g\xf6steriliyor.","Zoom in/out buttons on the map. Analysis panel is smaller and min/max altitude are on separate cards.")
B.Sw=new A.X("v0.1.6","2026-07-25","Harita karolar\u0131 art\u0131k y\xfckleniyor (web'de CORS sorunu veren OSM sunucusu yerine CARTO kullan\u0131l\u0131yor). Analiz paneli yeniden d\xfczenlendi: b\xfcy\xfck \xf6zet say\u0131lar ve y\xfckseklik grafi\u011fi art\u0131k en \xfcstte, daha g\xf6rsel.","Map tiles load (CARTO instead of the OSM host that hit CORS on web). Analysis panel redesigned: large summary numbers and the elevation chart on top.")
B.Tm=new A.X("v0.1.5","2026-07-25","Harita art\u0131k t\xfcm ekran\u0131 kapl\u0131yor (\xf6nceki s\xfcr\xfcmde \xfcstte k\xfc\xe7\xfck kal\u0131yordu). B\xfcy\xfck GPX dosyalar\u0131 i\xe7in depolama ayr\u0131ca iyile\u015ftirildi.","The map fills the whole screen (it used to stay small at the top). Storage improved for large GPX files.")
B.S2=new A.X("v0.1.4","2026-07-25","Harita boyutu d\xfczeltildi.","Map size fixed.")
B.Ts=new A.X("v0.1.3","2026-07-25","Hive depolama eklendi.","Hive storage added.")
